(646976, 67721, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I like the symmetry... it is nicely offset by the patterns on the surface of the board.  I think this photo could benefit from extra depth of field.  The foremost pieces in the scene are soft because of this.   I can''t really see any improvement in the image by shooting it this way.  = 7</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I like the symmetry... it is nicely offset by the patterns on the surface of the board.  I think this photo could benefit from extra depth of field.  The foremost pieces in the scene are soft because of this.   I can''t really see any improvement in the image by shooting it this way.  = 7', '2004-04-01 01:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(646982, 67258, 675, '<td valign="top">this one definitely stands out to me right away.  i like it a alot.  i would like it even more with some more negative space though.  still a nice shot.</td>', 'this one definitely stands out to me right away.  i like it a alot.  i would like it even more with some more negative space though.  still a nice shot.', '2004-04-01 01:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(646984, 66787, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail.. the composition feels a little ''tight''.. primary elements are a bit too close to the edge of the frame in places.  The background doens''t support the subject well either, IMO.  = 5</td>', 'Very nice detail.. the composition feels a little ''tight''.. primary elements are a bit too close to the edge of the frame in places.  The background doens''t support the subject well either, IMO.  = 5', '2004-04-01 01:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(646995, 66913, 17296, '<td valign="top">This is the most disgusting bug ever. I hope never to see one in person. Good photo. Light is a bit flat, but I  don''t blame you for not experimenting more.</td>', 'This is the most disgusting bug ever. I hope never to see one in person. Good photo. Light is a bit flat, but I  don''t blame you for not experimenting more.', '2004-04-01 01:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(646997, 67805, 17837, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this photo. The tones are great. However, I can see where you tried to burn in the sky around the steering wheel, and also it look to be around the Wheel as well.  Had I not noticed this, I probably would have voted a 7.</td>', 'I really enjoy this photo. The tones are great. However, I can see where you tried to burn in the sky around the steering wheel, and also it look to be around the Wheel as well.  Had I not noticed this, I probably would have voted a 7.', '2004-04-01 01:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(647002, 67324, 15207, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this. I love the pose and the expression on this beautiful creature''s face. My only suggestion would be to maybe crop in a little closer because the subject is just so amazing.</td>', 'I absolutely love this. I love the pose and the expression on this beautiful creature''s face. My only suggestion would be to maybe crop in a little closer because the subject is just so amazing.', '2004-04-01 01:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
