(647098, 67775, 1135, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot but it looks a little flat. I put it in Photoshop and adjusted the levels a little and it really popped. Also rule of thirds would help the composition, the empty space on the right seems a little awkward to me. Still there are a lot of things to draw my interest (What is the little girl looking at? Why was the ball abandoned? Did the fisherman have any luck?) Nice shot.</td>', 'I really like this shot but it looks a little flat. I put it in Photoshop and adjusted the levels a little and it really popped. Also rule of thirds would help the composition, the empty space on the right seems a little awkward to me. Still there are a lot of things to draw my interest (What is the little girl looking at? Why was the ball abandoned? Did the fisherman have any luck?) Nice shot.', '2004-04-01 01:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
