(647125, 67744, 10170, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic model you have there.  Very very natural looking, almost candid, rather than poised, yet it is obviously a posed photo.  Great lighting, great model, great pose.  Love it.</td>', 'What a fantastic model you have there.  Very very natural looking, almost candid, rather than poised, yet it is obviously a posed photo.  Great lighting, great model, great pose.  Love it.', '2004-04-01 01:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
