(647550, 67437, 11738, '<td valign="top">The petal edges on the white backgound seem weird as if the image was overshaprened or if the background was cloned out.  Yellow petals at top also seem washed out.</td>', 'The petal edges on the white backgound seem weird as if the image was overshaprened or if the background was cloned out.  Yellow petals at top also seem washed out.', '2004-04-01 07:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
