(647565, 67703, 11738, '<td valign="top">Another one from the raptor centre?  Nice shot.  What species?  Love his intense stare.  Feathers near the bottom right of the image look all weird, as if down or under-feathers showing.</td>', 'Another one from the raptor centre?  Nice shot.  What species?  Love his intense stare.  Feathers near the bottom right of the image look all weird, as if down or under-feathers showing.', '2004-04-01 07:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
