(647568, 65085, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice siluette. However, oversharpening seems to put a white glow on the edges. The middle-left roof is way too sharpened. Good colors.</td>', 'Nice siluette. However, oversharpening seems to put a white glow on the edges. The middle-left roof is way too sharpened. Good colors.', '2004-04-01 07:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
