(647573, 67720, 7543, '<td valign="top">Too "soft focusy" for me. Nice model and expression.  Black background nicely done.</td>', 'Too "soft focusy" for me. Nice model and expression.  Black background nicely done.', '2004-04-01 07:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(647575, 67637, 11738, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT painting with light and the washed out feel to this image is great!  Soft focus works well here too.  One of the nicest floral / still life shots I have seen in a long time.  Good luck.  Among my favs.</td>', 'EXCELLENT painting with light and the washed out feel to this image is great!  Soft focus works well here too.  One of the nicest floral / still life shots I have seen in a long time.  Good luck.  Among my favs.', '2004-04-01 07:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(647577, 64871, 4543, '<td valign="top">Love the details and nice pattern.  Great shot and good luck! 8.</td>', 'Love the details and nice pattern.  Great shot and good luck! 8.', '2004-04-01 07:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(647581, 67781, 4543, '<td valign="top">Yes indeed.  Not sure though if this would please the audience here.  Would have been better in macro and the tree backround would have not been distracting.  Good Luck!</td>', 'Yes indeed.  Not sure though if this would please the audience here.  Would have been better in macro and the tree backround would have not been distracting.  Good Luck!', '2004-04-01 07:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(647582, 67638, 11738, '<td valign="top">Dead bug with blown out background.  The ultr-harsh lighting really detracts from the subject.  Focus is good though as we see most of the "corpse" and flower in focus.  White boirder does nothing to enhance this shot.</td>', 'Dead bug with blown out background.  The ultr-harsh lighting really detracts from the subject.  Focus is good though as we see most of the "corpse" and flower in focus.  White boirder does nothing to enhance this shot.', '2004-04-01 07:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(647584, 67806, 11738, '<td valign="top">Wicked Blackbird shot.  Excellent DOF and good crisp focus on your bird.  I love seeing these guys come back.  Spring is on the way when you hear them kon-ka-ree!</td>', 'Wicked Blackbird shot.  Excellent DOF and good crisp focus on your bird.  I love seeing these guys come back.  Spring is on the way when you hear them kon-ka-ree!', '2004-04-01 07:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(647591, 67805, 16636, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, it''s a shame not to be sharper which I would have prefered.</td>', 'Nice picture, it''s a shame not to be sharper which I would have prefered.', '2004-04-01 07:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(647600, 66532, 16636, '<td valign="top">I like your photo, although a portrait crop would have improved the photo for me</td>', 'I like your photo, although a portrait crop would have improved the photo for me', '2004-04-01 07:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(647606, 67794, 7800, '<td valign="top">Overall, really neat picture. I think it would have been nicer if you hadn''t placed her in the center of the image. Perhaps gone to the side of her and got the one side of the kids sweeping around. Fabulous motion blur though.</td>', 'Overall, really neat picture. I think it would have been nicer if you hadn''t placed her in the center of the image. Perhaps gone to the side of her and got the one side of the kids sweeping around. Fabulous motion blur though.', '2004-04-01 08:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(647611, 66692, 14401, '<td valign="top">Wow - lovely scenery!  I was looking for the bird, LOL - the only thing that would have made this shot better IMO - but once the picture came up, I just thought "WOW".</td>', 'Wow - lovely scenery!  I was looking for the bird, LOL - the only thing that would have made this shot better IMO - but once the picture came up, I just thought "WOW".', '2004-04-01 08:10:12.000000', NULL, 1);
