(647744, 64384, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic image, probably even more so in black and white. The tones are good, composition is excellent, looks like a nice place!</td>', 'Very dramatic image, probably even more so in black and white. The tones are good, composition is excellent, looks like a nice place!', '2004-04-01 09:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(647751, 67567, 806, '<td valign="top">the horizon line is not straight, and is not far enough off center to make a difference. The composition on the bottom 2/3 of the photo is very nice, and I really like the cold feeling and detail. good that you didn''t slice the bird''s head with the ocean/horizon line.</td>', 'the horizon line is not straight, and is not far enough off center to make a difference. The composition on the bottom 2/3 of the photo is very nice, and I really like the cold feeling and detail. good that you didn''t slice the bird''s head with the ocean/horizon line.', '2004-04-01 09:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(647752, 63870, 6008, '<td valign="top">The yellow is warm and pleasing, although maybe a tad underexposed due to the painting with light. It also makes the image a little soft, but I think that may go with the theme of being a delicate image. Not so sure about the dead center composition, though. It''s a good shot, just not a lot of wow factor for me, sorry.</td>', 'The yellow is warm and pleasing, although maybe a tad underexposed due to the painting with light. It also makes the image a little soft, but I think that may go with the theme of being a delicate image. Not so sure about the dead center composition, though. It''s a good shot, just not a lot of wow factor for me, sorry.', '2004-04-01 09:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(647755, 67642, 806, '<td valign="top">nice moment.  colors okay.. noise from pushing saturation? or exposure too dark?<br/>(asks self). either way, quality is lessened a bit from it, but I like it overall.</td>', 'nice moment.  colors okay.. noise from pushing saturation? or exposure too dark?(asks self). either way, quality is lessened a bit from it, but I like it overall.', '2004-04-01 09:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
