(647777, 65815, 7291, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t DrJones, then you''ve stolen his technique (and model).  Excellent photo, great lighting, cool setting and of course...sexy as always! - 10</td>', 'If this isn''t DrJones, then you''ve stolen his technique (and model).  Excellent photo, great lighting, cool setting and of course...sexy as always! - 10', '2004-04-01 09:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
