(647794, 67324, 14593, '<td valign="top">It looks like the otter posed for you!     great photo!   great crop....very sharp &amp; detailed....excellent depth of field with the pretty blue/green water.  Fantastic capture here!!</td>', 'It looks like the otter posed for you!     great photo!   great crop....very sharp & detailed....excellent depth of field with the pretty blue/green water.  Fantastic capture here!!', '2004-04-01 10:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
