(647802, 63705, 14614, '<td valign="top">Somehow the border (which I like) draws extra attention to the black background at the top two corners (which I find distracting).  Otherwise, nice composition, nice detail on the center thingies, I''d like more dof so the yellow isn''t as blurry.</td>', 'Somehow the border (which I like) draws extra attention to the black background at the top two corners (which I find distracting).  Otherwise, nice composition, nice detail on the center thingies, I''d like more dof so the yellow isn''t as blurry.', '2004-04-01 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(647805, 67437, 14614, '<td valign="top">fine composition;  the green stuff has a nice texture, the edges of the petals are your trouble area here - there is something funky about them.  I''d suggest a very slight blur filter to softed them</td>', 'fine composition;  the green stuff has a nice texture, the edges of the petals are your trouble area here - there is something funky about them.  I''d suggest a very slight blur filter to softed them', '2004-04-01 10:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(647808, 64040, 4543, '<td valign="top">I really like this, I like the lighting and the background.  Well done. 9</td>', 'I really like this, I like the lighting and the background.  Well done. 9', '2004-04-01 10:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(647809, 67637, 14614, '<td valign="top">lovely mood created by the dual tones and soft focus.  The arrangement of the flowers and the selection of background and vase is wonderful.  but ooo that border  why, oh, why did you put it? ;)    A thinner, neutral color would have been all that you needed.</td>', 'lovely mood created by the dual tones and soft focus.  The arrangement of the flowers and the selection of background and vase is wonderful.  but ooo that border  why, oh, why did you put it? ;)    A thinner, neutral color would have been all that you needed.', '2004-04-01 10:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(647810, 66986, 7543, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, maybe the sky is over-burned.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, maybe the sky is over-burned.', '2004-04-01 10:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(647811, 67801, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great angle, interesting shot. Crop maybe a bit tight on the sides.</td>', 'Great angle, interesting shot. Crop maybe a bit tight on the sides.', '2004-04-01 10:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(647812, 66991, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very crisp, clear shot. You can see the eyes of the biker staring right at you while showing off. That makes this a particularly nice capture. The subtlety of the main subject at the top of the frame adds to the image. Nicely done!</td>', 'Very crisp, clear shot. You can see the eyes of the biker staring right at you while showing off. That makes this a particularly nice capture. The subtlety of the main subject at the top of the frame adds to the image. Nicely done!', '2004-04-01 10:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(647814, 67781, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice use of the tree to offer extra texture .  The spotlight (filter?) on the daffodil creates the focal point.  The sky on the upper right and the trees on the upper left don''t add -- perhaps cropping along the sides to avoid pulling my eye to uninteresting parts of the shot??</td>', 'nice use of the tree to offer extra texture .  The spotlight (filter?) on the daffodil creates the focal point.  The sky on the upper right and the trees on the upper left don''t add -- perhaps cropping along the sides to avoid pulling my eye to uninteresting parts of the shot??', '2004-04-01 10:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(647815, 67061, 4543, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the B&amp;W background, you may get a comment that its oversharpened but I like the effect that brings the tulips texture out.  Good Luck 9!</td>', 'I love the composition and the B&W background, you may get a comment that its oversharpened but I like the effect that brings the tulips texture out.  Good Luck 9!', '2004-04-01 10:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(647819, 67771, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve made a find shot on the white flower, well lit and nice use of shadows... I don''t think any of the other elements in the shot add (the buidling, red tulip, other white flower) to your "friend"''s beauty.  The red tulip, because of it''s color, dominates as the main subject but since it''s partially covered, the composition suffers</td>', 'You''ve made a find shot on the white flower, well lit and nice use of shadows... I don''t think any of the other elements in the shot add (the buidling, red tulip, other white flower) to your "friend"''s beauty.  The red tulip, because of it''s color, dominates as the main subject but since it''s partially covered, the composition suffers', '2004-04-01 10:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(647821, 66702, 5792, '<td valign="top">The eyes, composition and very high technical quality make this image excellent!</td>', 'The eyes, composition and very high technical quality make this image excellent!', '2004-04-01 10:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
