(647837, 66992, 14614, '<td valign="top">good dof and composition (tough to get those ladybugs to stay where you ask them to)  There is something about the lighting here that''s a bit off - it doesn''t give your shot that punch it should/could have.</td>', 'good dof and composition (tough to get those ladybugs to stay where you ask them to)  There is something about the lighting here that''s a bit off - it doesn''t give your shot that punch it should/could have.', '2004-04-01 10:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(647838, 67745, 4543, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but blurred.  I think this is a hurried shot.  Good luck on this.</td>', 'Nice composition but blurred.  I think this is a hurried shot.  Good luck on this.', '2004-04-01 10:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(647839, 67649, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and the color palette.  If only you could get the sky to cooperate and give you a bit of blue all around the flower... ;)  the white doesn''t show off the colors as well as the white/blue mix.</td>', 'I like your composition and the color palette.  If only you could get the sky to cooperate and give you a bit of blue all around the flower... ;)  the white doesn''t show off the colors as well as the white/blue mix.', '2004-04-01 10:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(647841, 66692, 4543, '<td valign="top">Very nice scenery.  Did you apply painting effect or something?</td>', 'Very nice scenery.  Did you apply painting effect or something?', '2004-04-01 10:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(647843, 64015, 4543, '<td valign="top">Love the composition,  I like that rose candle and perfect background.  Good Luck! 8.</td>', 'Love the composition,  I like that rose candle and perfect background.  Good Luck! 8.', '2004-04-01 10:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(647845, 66158, 14614, '<td valign="top">Having spent quite a lot of time this month photoing the same subject, I appreciate what you''ve done here.  Excellent use of light/shadow make this a great composition, placement of all the elements of the flower is very well done.  High marks from me.  Suggestions: no too many - perhaps a bit less black on either to top or bottom to take the flower out of the center?</td>', 'Having spent quite a lot of time this month photoing the same subject, I appreciate what you''ve done here.  Excellent use of light/shadow make this a great composition, placement of all the elements of the flower is very well done.  High marks from me.  Suggestions: no too many - perhaps a bit less black on either to top or bottom to take the flower out of the center?', '2004-04-01 10:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(647846, 66555, 4543, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I can see those saliva juices coming out.  Did you manually blurred the background?</td>', 'Nice photo, I can see those saliva juices coming out.  Did you manually blurred the background?', '2004-04-01 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(647848, 67566, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve selected a great speciment and really did a fine job placing it in your frame.  Border is nicely done.  The background is the only detraction I can see - it''s so busy that your main subject isn''t as isolated from it -- the stick/stem on the left going through your composition couldn''t be avoided, I''m sure, but that does detract a bit.</td>', 'You''ve selected a great speciment and really did a fine job placing it in your frame.  Border is nicely done.  The background is the only detraction I can see - it''s so busy that your main subject isn''t as isolated from it -- the stick/stem on the left going through your composition couldn''t be avoided, I''m sure, but that does detract a bit.', '2004-04-01 10:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(647849, 66917, 1280, '<td valign="top">Marvelous detail!  Great job.</td>', 'Marvelous detail!  Great job.', '2004-04-01 10:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(647850, 66158, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lovely light.  Nice!</td>', 'Lovely light.  Nice!', '2004-04-01 10:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(647851, 67585, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the spotlight on the orange thing - you''ve given my eye the focal  point you wanted me to have.  The surrounding area detracts from your lovely composition, however e.g. the yellow in the upper left.  I''d like to see more of the flower but the white thing at the bottom blocks the bottom and leaves the flower with a cut-off feel.  I thing the white border adds little to the shot.</td>', 'I like the spotlight on the orange thing - you''ve given my eye the focal  point you wanted me to have.  The surrounding area detracts from your lovely composition, however e.g. the yellow in the upper left.  I''d like to see more of the flower but the white thing at the bottom blocks the bottom and leaves the flower with a cut-off feel.  I thing the white border adds little to the shot.', '2004-04-01 10:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(647853, 66722, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line coming in from the brc, well composed, good picture, clever title. :-)</td>', 'Nice leading line coming in from the brc, well composed, good picture, clever title. :-)', '2004-04-01 10:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(647856, 67643, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great portrait</td>', 'Great portrait', '2004-04-01 10:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(647857, 67603, 14614, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried this type of shot and know it''s quite difficult to pull off -- you''ve got the center point done expertly.  I would like to see the sides either cropped or more in focus - this would add to the wow factor imho.  The white border is a detractor - theres'' no white in your shot so it doesn''t add and it''s too wide in proportion so it almost becomes an element of your shot instead of the finishing edge.</td>', 'I''ve tried this type of shot and know it''s quite difficult to pull off -- you''ve got the center point done expertly.  I would like to see the sides either cropped or more in focus - this would add to the wow factor imho.  The white border is a detractor - theres'' no white in your shot so it doesn''t add and it''s too wide in proportion so it almost becomes an element of your shot instead of the finishing edge.', '2004-04-01 10:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(647858, 64850, 7543, '<td valign="top">Over processed for my taste (for DPC), it is nicely done though.</td>', 'Over processed for my taste (for DPC), it is nicely done though.', '2004-04-01 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(647863, 67739, 18219, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.<br/>It would look awesome if I could see it in a bigger size.<br/>My favorite one so far.<br/>I''ve just gone back and changed from a nine to a ten!</td>', 'I really like this picture.It would look awesome if I could see it in a bigger size.My favorite one so far.I''ve just gone back and changed from a nine to a ten!', '2004-04-01 10:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(647867, 67797, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''ve used light well in your composition to create interest in the shadows and the play of greens.  it''s hard to put into words but it''s almost like you''ve taken an excellent background shot that''s waiting for the focal point.</td>', 'you''ve used light well in your composition to create interest in the shadows and the play of greens.  it''s hard to put into words but it''s almost like you''ve taken an excellent background shot that''s waiting for the focal point.', '2004-04-01 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(647868, 65811, 4564, '<td valign="top">hehehehehehe.... ;-)</td>', 'hehehehehehe.... ;-)', '2004-04-01 10:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(647871, 66491, 7543, '<td valign="top">Over sharpening is evident here, see the bright halos around the boats and the horizon. The foreground is underexposed as well, but it''s always hard to make the sky look good if you want the foreground well done.</td>', 'Over sharpening is evident here, see the bright halos around the boats and the horizon. The foreground is underexposed as well, but it''s always hard to make the sky look good if you want the foreground well done.', '2004-04-01 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(647872, 67071, 14614, '<td valign="top">a lot to like here - the background has an impressionistic feel and sets off your main subject really well.  your lighting is great and the color palette of the whole is wonderful.  I''d like to see the yellow petals more in focus (dof, wind? may have blurred them a bit too much)</td>', 'a lot to like here - the background has an impressionistic feel and sets off your main subject really well.  your lighting is great and the color palette of the whole is wonderful.  I''d like to see the yellow petals more in focus (dof, wind? may have blurred them a bit too much)', '2004-04-01 10:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(647873, 67323, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good crop</td>', 'Good crop', '2004-04-01 10:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(647875, 67015, 14614, '<td valign="top">that''s a fine silk rose - it looks quite real.  I like your placement and use of black background.  the lighting is off somehow as I''d like the flower to pop off the background -- as presented it melts into it.  I think there may be a few too many water droplets as these become an element of the shot as opposed to an accent.</td>', 'that''s a fine silk rose - it looks quite real.  I like your placement and use of black background.  the lighting is off somehow as I''d like the flower to pop off the background -- as presented it melts into it.  I think there may be a few too many water droplets as these become an element of the shot as opposed to an accent.', '2004-04-01 10:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(647876, 67725, 7543, '<td valign="top">Processing of the sky is way too much for my taste...</td>', 'Processing of the sky is way too much for my taste...', '2004-04-01 10:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(647877, 63870, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''ve done a good job of painting with light -- i really like the dark flowers in the background as it plays against the lighter one.  the lighter one needs something more to make it the main subject - perhaps a tighter crop, a bit more light - not sure.</td>', 'you''ve done a good job of painting with light -- i really like the dark flowers in the background as it plays against the lighter one.  the lighter one needs something more to make it the main subject - perhaps a tighter crop, a bit more light - not sure.', '2004-04-01 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(647881, 67795, 14614, '<td valign="top">excellent composition!  the green, yellow, and lilac colors works so well against eachother.  one of the better florals this time around!</td>', 'excellent composition!  the green, yellow, and lilac colors works so well against eachother.  one of the better florals this time around!', '2004-04-01 10:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(647882, 64520, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice. Looks like frost on the panes.</td>', 'Nice. Looks like frost on the panes.', '2004-04-01 10:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(647885, 67365, 3724, '<td valign="top">I sure prefer this to a golf ball shot.  Nice view of this course.</td>', 'I sure prefer this to a golf ball shot.  Nice view of this course.', '2004-04-01 10:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(647887, 65374, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve lit this yellow flower to perfection as it really pops from the background.  I''d like it to be totally in focus as your background is nicely all out of focus.  The border detracts as it contains no color found in your shot so it competes with the composition and almost becomes an element (vs. a finishing edge).  I''d like a bit more negative space on the right and bottom of the yellow petals.</td>', 'You''ve lit this yellow flower to perfection as it really pops from the background.  I''d like it to be totally in focus as your background is nicely all out of focus.  The border detracts as it contains no color found in your shot so it competes with the composition and almost becomes an element (vs. a finishing edge).  I''d like a bit more negative space on the right and bottom of the yellow petals.', '2004-04-01 11:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(647889, 67310, 14614, '<td valign="top">like the placement of the dark center part - wish it was less blury.  filling the frame was a good aesthetic choice</td>', 'like the placement of the dark center part - wish it was less blury.  filling the frame was a good aesthetic choice', '2004-04-01 11:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(647890, 67212, 19117, '<td valign="top">fascinating, the slightly drunk perspective!</td>', 'fascinating, the slightly drunk perspective!', '2004-04-01 11:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(647892, 66535, 19117, '<td valign="top">amazing color and texture</td>', 'amazing color and texture', '2004-04-01 11:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(647893, 66161, 14614, '<td valign="top">one of my favorite flowers -- good choice on the black as the purple/orange really pop.  I''d like to see a bit more of the stem as it seems too tightly cut off at the bottom - the center of the flower (the purple/tanish part) is not quite right - could be it''s fuzzy "past its peak" look??</td>', 'one of my favorite flowers -- good choice on the black as the purple/orange really pop.  I''d like to see a bit more of the stem as it seems too tightly cut off at the bottom - the center of the flower (the purple/tanish part) is not quite right - could be it''s fuzzy "past its peak" look??', '2004-04-01 11:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(647897, 67310, 19117, '<td valign="top">a lovely macro shot, especially with the seed stems radiating outward</td>', 'a lovely macro shot, especially with the seed stems radiating outward', '2004-04-01 11:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(647898, 67723, 255, '<td valign="top">heida? i could tell this was you from the thumb! it has that awesome, glowy, moody, ethereal quality that your stuff has lately. love it. 10.</td>', 'heida? i could tell this was you from the thumb! it has that awesome, glowy, moody, ethereal quality that your stuff has lately. love it. 10.', '2004-04-01 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(647899, 67762, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice grouping of flowers - presents a very frame-filling and satisfying bunch.  nice positioning in the frame.  lighting seems a bit uneven (dropping off at the sides) which works well except for a bit of fuzziness in the side flowers (not sure if I like it or not but it pulls my eye away from the center) Suggestion:  I''d like a bit more light to have the colors pop a bit more.</td>', 'nice grouping of flowers - presents a very frame-filling and satisfying bunch.  nice positioning in the frame.  lighting seems a bit uneven (dropping off at the sides) which works well except for a bit of fuzziness in the side flowers (not sure if I like it or not but it pulls my eye away from the center) Suggestion:  I''d like a bit more light to have the colors pop a bit more.', '2004-04-01 11:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(647900, 67796, 19117, '<td valign="top">the skin and hair texture is great -- I really get the feeling of the wisdom of the ages in this photo</td>', 'the skin and hair texture is great -- I really get the feeling of the wisdom of the ages in this photo', '2004-04-01 11:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(647902, 66667, 14614, '<td valign="top">very well done, great composition, greens add nicely as they draw my eye to your main subject, well exposed and crisp pansey.  one of the better flower shots this time around</td>', 'very well done, great composition, greens add nicely as they draw my eye to your main subject, well exposed and crisp pansey.  one of the better flower shots this time around', '2004-04-01 11:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(647907, 65325, 17200, '<td valign="top">I like the grittiness of this pic, makes it seem aged (in a good way)</td>', 'I like the grittiness of this pic, makes it seem aged (in a good way)', '2004-04-01 11:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(647908, 64552, 16520, '<td valign="top">Nice photo makes me miss the mountains..</td>', 'Nice photo makes me miss the mountains..', '2004-04-01 11:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(647909, 67704, 4285, '<td valign="top">Good compostion but soft focus/camera skake.</td>', 'Good compostion but soft focus/camera skake.', '2004-04-01 11:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(647910, 67745, 17200, '<td valign="top">This looks like my camera''s digital zoom... a little off. But the composition is good,</td>', 'This looks like my camera''s digital zoom... a little off. But the composition is good,', '2004-04-01 11:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(647911, 65321, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice use of light and colors.  I''d suggest using either light, dof, or lessing the amount flowers to add a focal point(s) as presented it''s a bit jumbled with some flowers cut off.</td>', 'nice use of light and colors.  I''d suggest using either light, dof, or lessing the amount flowers to add a focal point(s) as presented it''s a bit jumbled with some flowers cut off.', '2004-04-01 11:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(647913, 67409, 17200, '<td valign="top">I hate to give a duck picture a high mark, but this one is just too good, darn you! :)</td>', 'I hate to give a duck picture a high mark, but this one is just too good, darn you! :)', '2004-04-01 11:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(647914, 67678, 17200, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea! it''s a little dark on the edges for my taste, but I like it.</td>', 'Interesting idea! it''s a little dark on the edges for my taste, but I like it.', '2004-04-01 11:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(647917, 63870, 19117, '<td valign="top">breath-taking.  really wonderful lighting.  they seem to glow!</td>', 'breath-taking.  really wonderful lighting.  they seem to glow!', '2004-04-01 11:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(647919, 67657, 14614, '<td valign="top">i like the juxtaposition of the soft flowers and pointy cactus (perhaps more dof or closer to get a better sense of the cactus)  I''m left with the overall feeling that I''m too far away from the composition to really study it and "get inside" the frame.  I''d suggest getting in closer</td>', 'i like the juxtaposition of the soft flowers and pointy cactus (perhaps more dof or closer to get a better sense of the cactus)  I''m left with the overall feeling that I''m too far away from the composition to really study it and "get inside" the frame.  I''d suggest getting in closer', '2004-04-01 11:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(647921, 67655, 17200, '<td valign="top">Technically ok, but just doesn''t grab my attention.  Maybe if it was pulled back a little?</td>', 'Technically ok, but just doesn''t grab my attention.  Maybe if it was pulled back a little?', '2004-04-01 11:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(647922, 66917, 4285, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Well balanced. Great control over DOF. A touch more saturation maybe to make the eyes, beak and feet a little more vivid.</td>', 'Very nice. Well balanced. Great control over DOF. A touch more saturation maybe to make the eyes, beak and feet a little more vivid.', '2004-04-01 11:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(647924, 66476, 17200, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like a cannon that''s just fired, cool</td>', 'It almost looks like a cannon that''s just fired, cool', '2004-04-01 11:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(647925, 67755, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''ve created a very nice shot here - lighting is wonderful, border adds to the composition, two subjects get even and interesting treatment as you''ve placed them well in the frame.  your use of light allows this color shot to take on the feel of a sepia one but keeps the dimention of color.  One of the better flower shots this time around</td>', 'you''ve created a very nice shot here - lighting is wonderful, border adds to the composition, two subjects get even and interesting treatment as you''ve placed them well in the frame.  your use of light allows this color shot to take on the feel of a sepia one but keeps the dimention of color.  One of the better flower shots this time around', '2004-04-01 11:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(647926, 66692, 16520, '<td valign="top">Great shot would''ve been neat if a large bird was sitting on the tree but still very nice!!!!</td>', 'Great shot would''ve been neat if a large bird was sitting on the tree but still very nice!!!!', '2004-04-01 11:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(647927, 67781, 17200, '<td valign="top">The lighting is wonderful, makes the flower stand out well</td>', 'The lighting is wonderful, makes the flower stand out well', '2004-04-01 11:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(647928, 65934, 4285, '<td valign="top">Classic. Too bad you couldn''t have gotten a little of the red in there. It would have really made the subject stand out.</td>', 'Classic. Too bad you couldn''t have gotten a little of the red in there. It would have really made the subject stand out.', '2004-04-01 11:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(647929, 64436, 19117, '<td valign="top">this deserves its own "how''d you do that?"</td>', 'this deserves its own "how''d you do that?"', '2004-04-01 11:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(647931, 67805, 17200, '<td valign="top">Good subject, great color choice!</td>', 'Good subject, great color choice!', '2004-04-01 11:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(647934, 65510, 17200, '<td valign="top">That look! LOL!</td>', 'That look! LOL!', '2004-04-01 11:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(647936, 67083, 19117, '<td valign="top">very poignant</td>', 'very poignant', '2004-04-01 11:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(647937, 66561, 14614, '<td valign="top">setting them against the blue sky really sends the "spring" message and was a good artisic choice. your pov has used the light to backlight the flowers and the green at the bottom provides a pleasing base for the yellow color.  i think a tighter shot would be my only suggestion to try</td>', 'setting them against the blue sky really sends the "spring" message and was a good artisic choice. your pov has used the light to backlight the flowers and the green at the bottom provides a pleasing base for the yellow color.  i think a tighter shot would be my only suggestion to try', '2004-04-01 11:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(647938, 67638, 17200, '<td valign="top">Impressively close macro. The blown out highlights are distracting a little but you can''t deny the quality here!</td>', 'Impressively close macro. The blown out highlights are distracting a little but you can''t deny the quality here!', '2004-04-01 11:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(647939, 66991, 17200, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!', '2004-04-01 11:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(647940, 67806, 19117, '<td valign="top">a true sign of spring!  nice depth of field</td>', 'a true sign of spring!  nice depth of field', '2004-04-01 11:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(647942, 66950, 4285, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but looks like the sun was over head and to the left causing some over exposure.</td>', 'Nice composition but looks like the sun was over head and to the left causing some over exposure.', '2004-04-01 11:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(647944, 65355, 16520, '<td valign="top">The shadow really makes it 3D without it you would''nt know about the branch in the front very well done.....</td>', 'The shadow really makes it 3D without it you would''nt know about the branch in the front very well done.....', '2004-04-01 11:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(647945, 67798, 17200, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2004-04-01 11:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(647946, 64729, 4285, '<td valign="top">WOW. Great composition. Love the strong sillouette without the background getting too burned out.</td>', 'WOW. Great composition. Love the strong sillouette without the background getting too burned out.', '2004-04-01 11:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(647947, 65646, 19117, '<td valign="top">the colorizing bothers me, largely because of the grey skin tone.  great composition tho</td>', 'the colorizing bothers me, largely because of the grey skin tone.  great composition tho', '2004-04-01 11:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(647950, 67765, 17200, '<td valign="top">Slightly fuzzy, but I know from experience how much of a pain it is to photograph the moon. Good work!</td>', 'Slightly fuzzy, but I know from experience how much of a pain it is to photograph the moon. Good work!', '2004-04-01 11:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
