(647981, 67566, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and detail on this where it counts.  If you could have cloned out that bit of triangle below the flower it would have been even better.  Still well worthy of an 8.</td>', 'Good clarity and detail on this where it counts.  If you could have cloned out that bit of triangle below the flower it would have been even better.  Still well worthy of an 8.', '2004-04-01 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(647984, 67516, 19117, '<td valign="top">calendar caliber!</td>', 'calendar caliber!', '2004-04-01 11:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(647986, 66986, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition brings the viewer right into the picture.  Good!  8</td>', 'Lovely composition brings the viewer right into the picture.  Good!  8', '2004-04-01 11:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(647988, 67412, 17200, '<td valign="top">I bet this one wins! Great shot!</td>', 'I bet this one wins! Great shot!', '2004-04-01 11:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(647989, 64270, 14056, '<td valign="top">The bottom of this shot is fantastic.  I don''t think the blurred top adds to the shot.</td>', 'The bottom of this shot is fantastic.  I don''t think the blurred top adds to the shot.', '2004-04-01 11:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(647992, 66287, 7543, '<td valign="top">Góð portrett mynd, hálf draumkennd, bakgrunnurinn skemmtilega blurraður.</td>', 'Góð portrett mynd, hálf draumkennd, bakgrunnurinn skemmtilega blurraður.', '2004-04-01 11:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(647993, 67768, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nothing like being there at the right time with the right equipment.  Good action to get the catchlight. Since the little guy is looking left, I''d probably have cropped more of the right away.  but still well worth an 8.</td>', 'Nothing like being there at the right time with the right equipment.  Good action to get the catchlight. Since the little guy is looking left, I''d probably have cropped more of the right away.  but still well worth an 8.', '2004-04-01 11:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(647994, 67620, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very nice, amazing how sharp the foreground is compaired to the background, almost like 2 layers.</td>', 'Very nice, amazing how sharp the foreground is compaired to the background, almost like 2 layers.', '2004-04-01 11:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(647995, 67757, 17200, '<td valign="top">this would have been great for the out of place challenge, nicely done!</td>', 'this would have been great for the out of place challenge, nicely done!', '2004-04-01 11:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(647996, 67755, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice magnolias.  Good lighting and good soft focus and a pretty good frame easily earn this an 8.</td>', 'Very, very nice magnolias.  Good lighting and good soft focus and a pretty good frame easily earn this an 8.', '2004-04-01 11:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(647997, 67729, 19117, '<td valign="top">The reflection nicely melds two worlds</td>', 'The reflection nicely melds two worlds', '2004-04-01 11:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(647999, 64384, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice, very nice. Sharp, yet soft, gives it a dreamy texture, almost like it''d drawn and well drawn. Different.</td>', 'Nice, very nice. Sharp, yet soft, gives it a dreamy texture, almost like it''d drawn and well drawn. Different.', '2004-04-01 11:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(648000, 63870, 14476, '<td valign="top">There are some lovely flower portraits in this March study and this is certainly one of them.  Soft focus and warm coloring against the black make this stand out beautifully.  Pretty good border too!   8</td>', 'There are some lovely flower portraits in this March study and this is certainly one of them.  Soft focus and warm coloring against the black make this stand out beautifully.  Pretty good border too!   8', '2004-04-01 11:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(648001, 67393, 19117, '<td valign="top">so many places for the eye to go!  love it</td>', 'so many places for the eye to go!  love it', '2004-04-01 11:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(648002, 67620, 14476, '<td valign="top">Excellent seeing and great technicals on this one!  What stories you could tell  with the aid of this image.   8</td>', 'Excellent seeing and great technicals on this one!  What stories you could tell  with the aid of this image.   8', '2004-04-01 11:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(648003, 67471, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image with fine colors and composition.  Well done.  8</td>', 'Beautiful image with fine colors and composition.  Well done.  8', '2004-04-01 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(648005, 67274, 14476, '<td valign="top">Looks as if you got this fellow in the wild!  Very good redition of a much needed (but not very elegant) bird.    8</td>', 'Looks as if you got this fellow in the wild!  Very good redition of a much needed (but not very elegant) bird.    8', '2004-04-01 11:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(648007, 67409, 14476, '<td valign="top">I know you wanted to get this guy''s reflection because it is a good one, but I wish you  had left him a bit more headroom.  Still, it''s a lovely image.</td>', 'I know you wanted to get this guy''s reflection because it is a good one, but I wish you  had left him a bit more headroom.  Still, it''s a lovely image.', '2004-04-01 11:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(648012, 65510, 4482, '<td valign="top">Très belle composition JJ!  :)</td>', 'Très belle composition JJ!  :)', '2004-04-01 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(648013, 66491, 318, '<td valign="top">Nice compotition, be easier on the USM next time. :)</td>', 'Nice compotition, be easier on the USM next time. :)', '2004-04-01 11:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(648014, 67452, 14476, '<td valign="top">Once you took this image, you''d have to enter it somewhere!  Glad you put it in the March Challenge, cause it''s a beauty and this way we get to see it.  Nice.</td>', 'Once you took this image, you''d have to enter it somewhere!  Glad you put it in the March Challenge, cause it''s a beauty and this way we get to see it.  Nice.', '2004-04-01 11:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(648020, 67650, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2004-04-01 11:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(648022, 66014, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely study.  Excellent use of b&amp;w photography.  Good luck in the Challenge.  HIgh marks of course. <br/> <br/>(as an aside, I just wonder what it would have looked like if that stonework in front of the bench had been cloned out and replaced with grass.  Just a thought.)</td>', 'Lovely study.  Excellent use of b&w photography.  Good luck in the Challenge.  HIgh marks of course.  (as an aside, I just wonder what it would have looked like if that stonework in front of the bench had been cloned out and replaced with grass.  Just a thought.)', '2004-04-01 11:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(648029, 67621, 14476, '<td valign="top">Really good subject beautifully composed and photographed.</td>', 'Really good subject beautifully composed and photographed.', '2004-04-01 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(648031, 67655, 6597, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2004-04-01 12:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(648032, 67311, 772, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.  I enjoy an image where the photographer sees beyond the ''whole'' and starts to work with specific elemtns of an object.  A stop sign on its own has an interesting shape and possibly some nice contrast with its environment, but you have observed a detail within the sign that has a lot of strength on its own.  Wind, weather, and storm take their toll on everything.  Excellent capture... = 10</td>', 'This is excellent.  I enjoy an image where the photographer sees beyond the ''whole'' and starts to work with specific elemtns of an object.  A stop sign on its own has an interesting shape and possibly some nice contrast with its environment, but you have observed a detail within the sign that has a lot of strength on its own.  Wind, weather, and storm take their toll on everything.  Excellent capture... = 10', '2004-04-01 12:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(648033, 67488, 7543, '<td valign="top">Different, good idea, very nicely done.</td>', 'Different, good idea, very nicely done.', '2004-04-01 12:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(648034, 67619, 6597, '<td valign="top">nice reflection and texture 7</td>', 'nice reflection and texture 7', '2004-04-01 12:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(648035, 67795, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a a pert and sassy little flower nicely composed and photographed.  I very much like the hint of the container you left at the lower right.  Good one!  8</td>', 'This is a a pert and sassy little flower nicely composed and photographed.  I very much like the hint of the container you left at the lower right.  Good one!  8', '2004-04-01 12:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(648040, 67806, 14476, '<td valign="top">These little guys don''t hang around very long.  You did a very good job on a difficult subject.  Good catchlight. 7</td>', 'These little guys don''t hang around very long.  You did a very good job on a difficult subject.  Good catchlight. 7', '2004-04-01 12:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(648041, 66971, 16520, '<td valign="top">WOW 10</td>', 'WOW 10', '2004-04-01 12:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(648043, 67796, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the title integration on this photo.  This chimp looks old... maybe the wise man of the group... the leader.  Maybe he sits quietly and oversees the antics of the younger members of the group.  Excellent shot... = 10</td>', 'I like the title integration on this photo.  This chimp looks old... maybe the wise man of the group... the leader.  Maybe he sits quietly and oversees the antics of the younger members of the group.  Excellent shot... = 10', '2004-04-01 12:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(648044, 67648, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a very funny picture which makes up for the slight lack of definition and the small image size.  Excellent expression and body language on those birds.</td>', 'This is a very funny picture which makes up for the slight lack of definition and the small image size.  Excellent expression and body language on those birds.', '2004-04-01 12:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(648045, 67734, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good eye</td>', 'Good eye', '2004-04-01 12:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(648046, 66098, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very good closeup and detail on this Monarch.  7</td>', 'Very good closeup and detail on this Monarch.  7', '2004-04-01 12:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(648052, 65984, 7602, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The only thing I would have changed is a closer crop or more zoom on the bird, as there seems to be too much going on in the photo that distracts me from the subject.</td>', 'Very nice.  The only thing I would have changed is a closer crop or more zoom on the bird, as there seems to be too much going on in the photo that distracts me from the subject.', '2004-04-01 12:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(648054, 64085, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the colors you''ve captured here and your exposure is good. I would only say you need to improve upon the noise most evident in the sky. Try Neat Image.</td>', 'I like the colors you''ve captured here and your exposure is good. I would only say you need to improve upon the noise most evident in the sky. Try Neat Image.', '2004-04-01 12:12:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(648056, 67454, 7543, '<td valign="top">I know it''s hard to do, but this one needs the extra 1mm of DOF, since only one eye is in focus. Well done though, crop is great, and background is totally neutral.</td>', 'I know it''s hard to do, but this one needs the extra 1mm of DOF, since only one eye is in focus. Well done though, crop is great, and background is totally neutral.', '2004-04-01 12:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(648060, 67673, 7602, '<td valign="top">Awesome macro!</td>', 'Awesome macro!', '2004-04-01 12:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(648063, 67393, 7602, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  My only complaint is that there is a heavy blue cast in the photo, but that can be fixed easily.</td>', 'Great composition.  My only complaint is that there is a heavy blue cast in the photo, but that can be fixed easily.', '2004-04-01 12:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(648087, 66692, 19251, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of foregraound - background relationship, very nice job on the landscape, with lots of interesting subjects up front and in the beautiful background!</td>', 'Beautiful use of foregraound - background relationship, very nice job on the landscape, with lots of interesting subjects up front and in the beautiful background!', '2004-04-01 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(648089, 67481, 19251, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The contrast is wonderful!</td>', 'Wow!  The contrast is wonderful!', '2004-04-01 12:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(648091, 66806, 8522, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t do much for me I''m afraid. The sea is a little overexposed resulting in burnt out highlights. The overal picture looks a bit washed out, I think it could benefit from a bit more contrast. The picture could have been much sharper... maybe this is an issue with your camera. The dof seems a bit narrow, the background is less sharp than the foreground. Difficult to see why this happened, given that it is shot in bright conditions. I think you would have been better off focusing on a mid-point between the foreground and background to catch everything in focus. The composition in general seems a bit haphazard, maybe rule of thirds might have helped here.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t do much for me I''m afraid. The sea is a little overexposed resulting in burnt out highlights. The overal picture looks a bit washed out, I think it could benefit from a bit more contrast. The picture could have been much sharper... maybe this is an issue with your camera. The dof seems a bit narrow, the background is less sharp than the foreground. Difficult to see why this happened, given that it is shot in bright conditions. I think you would have been better off focusing on a mid-point between the foreground and background to catch everything in focus. The composition in general seems a bit haphazard, maybe rule of thirds might have helped here.', '2004-04-01 12:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(648094, 67725, 19251, '<td valign="top">Ominous, this is an effective use of bleak subject matter and colors.</td>', 'Ominous, this is an effective use of bleak subject matter and colors.', '2004-04-01 12:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(648097, 67324, 16520, '<td valign="top">Cute title and photo.....</td>', 'Cute title and photo.....', '2004-04-01 12:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(648101, 66287, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, very expressive tongue. Nicely blurred trees in the background. Not quite sure about your choice of blue here though. Great arms, but I''m not convinced by the crop. Well exposed.</td>', 'Nice shot, very expressive tongue. Nicely blurred trees in the background. Not quite sure about your choice of blue here though. Great arms, but I''m not convinced by the crop. Well exposed.', '2004-04-01 12:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(648105, 66961, 12417, '<td valign="top">I think your sky is too over exposed, and I''m not sure why, but I kind of like it.</td>', 'I think your sky is too over exposed, and I''m not sure why, but I kind of like it.', '2004-04-01 12:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(648106, 66950, 9821, '<td valign="top">cool looking bird, nice background blur ... but the lighting is pretty harsh on his /her beak</td>', 'cool looking bird, nice background blur ... but the lighting is pretty harsh on his /her beak', '2004-04-01 12:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(648108, 67806, 327, '<td valign="top">Redwinged blackbird on a cat tail....very cool. One of my favorites. I love their call. Nice get!! Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Redwinged blackbird on a cat tail....very cool. One of my favorites. I love their call. Nice get!! Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-01 12:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(648110, 67624, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... perhaps a little too like a snapshot. Slight overexposure resulting in burnt out highlights. The boy doesn''t seem to be very sharp, and there is bad artifacting everywhere, possibly as a result of applying sharpening in PS to a photo that wasn''t too sharp to start with. This particularly affects the texture of sand. Perhaps a little too much red overall. I think the main problem with this shot for me is that the viewer''s eye is pulled in different directions. The two subjects are both looking out of the frame in different directions so there is no clear point of focus.</td>', 'Interesting shot... perhaps a little too like a snapshot. Slight overexposure resulting in burnt out highlights. The boy doesn''t seem to be very sharp, and there is bad artifacting everywhere, possibly as a result of applying sharpening in PS to a photo that wasn''t too sharp to start with. This particularly affects the texture of sand. Perhaps a little too much red overall. I think the main problem with this shot for me is that the viewer''s eye is pulled in different directions. The two subjects are both looking out of the frame in different directions so there is no clear point of focus.', '2004-04-01 12:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(648111, 67784, 12417, '<td valign="top">I love bikes, but the light is unflattering and it looks like more of a snapshot.</td>', 'I love bikes, but the light is unflattering and it looks like more of a snapshot.', '2004-04-01 12:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(648113, 67268, 9821, '<td valign="top">it''s a little out of focus, and the crop cuts off the reflection</td>', 'it''s a little out of focus, and the crop cuts off the reflection', '2004-04-01 12:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(648114, 67768, 327, '<td valign="top">I wish he''d turn around. :) We have many black-capped-chickadees here in Oregon. I love their calls to each other. They are really quick as you know and you did a wonderful job getting this guy. Good one.</td>', 'I wish he''d turn around. :) We have many black-capped-chickadees here in Oregon. I love their calls to each other. They are really quick as you know and you did a wonderful job getting this guy. Good one.', '2004-04-01 12:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(648115, 67488, 9821, '<td valign="top">i think i would have liked this better is you left it in the horizontal position ... kinda cool to look at though</td>', 'i think i would have liked this better is you left it in the horizontal position ... kinda cool to look at though', '2004-04-01 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(648116, 67767, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good character, well composed, good crop. Her hat seems much sharper than her face though, which leads my eye away from the face. IMO the eyes need to be the sharpest thing in the frame, as this is the point of focus. The face looks a little too smooth/ blurred, possibly as a result of NeatImage. Sometimes this is a nice effect on older models, but children don''t need it.</td>', 'Very nice shot, good character, well composed, good crop. Her hat seems much sharper than her face though, which leads my eye away from the face. IMO the eyes need to be the sharpest thing in the frame, as this is the point of focus. The face looks a little too smooth/ blurred, possibly as a result of NeatImage. Sometimes this is a nice effect on older models, but children don''t need it.', '2004-04-01 12:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(648117, 67268, 17200, '<td valign="top">good compostion, but the compression of the jpg is pretty harsh, it takes away from the picture</td>', 'good compostion, but the compression of the jpg is pretty harsh, it takes away from the picture', '2004-04-01 12:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(648119, 67574, 17200, '<td valign="top">What a unique idea!</td>', 'What a unique idea!', '2004-04-01 12:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(648120, 64262, 8522, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Could have benefited from perhaps a touch more sharpness in PS. I don''t normally go for symmetrical composition, but this works really well here. Gorgeous colours. Wonderful mood.</td>', 'Stunning. Could have benefited from perhaps a touch more sharpness in PS. I don''t normally go for symmetrical composition, but this works really well here. Gorgeous colours. Wonderful mood.', '2004-04-01 12:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(648123, 67798, 327, '<td valign="top">This little man is so cute. He is hell on windows but with these shots of his face and expressions it''s worth a few bottles of Windex!!! Expressive eyes. Cutie. I hope you will continue to share these ''once in a life time'' shots as he grows. :) Good entry.</td>', 'This little man is so cute. He is hell on windows but with these shots of his face and expressions it''s worth a few bottles of Windex!!! Expressive eyes. Cutie. I hope you will continue to share these ''once in a life time'' shots as he grows. :) Good entry.', '2004-04-01 12:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(648125, 65664, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve stopped the action, but you''ve also cut off the head of the rider and the feet of the horse which weakens the shot.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve stopped the action, but you''ve also cut off the head of the rider and the feet of the horse which weakens the shot.', '2004-04-01 12:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(648126, 67373, 9821, '<td valign="top">horizon is a little tilted, but i love it ... fun picture</td>', 'horizon is a little tilted, but i love it ... fun picture', '2004-04-01 12:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(648127, 67324, 17200, '<td valign="top">nice pun in the title :) (oh, and a nice pic too)</td>', 'nice pun in the title :) (oh, and a nice pic too)', '2004-04-01 12:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(648129, 64262, 17200, '<td valign="top">Quite nicely done!</td>', 'Quite nicely done!', '2004-04-01 12:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(648132, 65592, 9821, '<td valign="top">i like the center placement, the background, the little leaves ... it''s great</td>', 'i like the center placement, the background, the little leaves ... it''s great', '2004-04-01 12:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(648137, 65321, 9821, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2004-04-01 12:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(648139, 65934, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp (perhaps only ever so slightly oversharpened), nicely blurred background. I''d have been tempted to apply NeatImage just to the background. However, you have chosen to centre your subject in the frame. This tends not to work to well with animals, as the point of focus is always the eyes, and here the eye looks as if it has not been placed at a deliberate point within the frame. I would have centred the eye, which would also have given the eagle some negative space to look into. Shame some of the white of the eagle''s head has been cropped off. I think you could have brought out more highlight detail in PS.</td>', 'Nice and sharp (perhaps only ever so slightly oversharpened), nicely blurred background. I''d have been tempted to apply NeatImage just to the background. However, you have chosen to centre your subject in the frame. This tends not to work to well with animals, as the point of focus is always the eyes, and here the eye looks as if it has not been placed at a deliberate point within the frame. I would have centred the eye, which would also have given the eagle some negative space to look into. Shame some of the white of the eagle''s head has been cropped off. I think you could have brought out more highlight detail in PS.', '2004-04-01 12:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(648140, 65355, 9821, '<td valign="top">simple ... great ... 10</td>', 'simple ... great ... 10', '2004-04-01 12:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
