(648207, 66469, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, but in my opinion there needs to be something sitting on the fence to draw the viewer''s attention. As it is, it does have very good color and composition, just needs something added for that "wow" factor.</td>', 'I really like the idea, but in my opinion there needs to be something sitting on the fence to draw the viewer''s attention. As it is, it does have very good color and composition, just needs something added for that "wow" factor.', '2004-04-01 12:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(648208, 67429, 11843, '<td valign="top">i like that you left some indication of a cheek on the right. it helps to keep a 3-dimensional feel to this photo. red wouldnt have been my first choice, not natural, but goes well with the title. 10</td>', 'i like that you left some indication of a cheek on the right. it helps to keep a 3-dimensional feel to this photo. red wouldnt have been my first choice, not natural, but goes well with the title. 10', '2004-04-01 12:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
