(648212, 65815, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one is pitch perfect. the lighting is excellent, the subject is interesting and well posed and the background is just out of this world. I love the overall composition. one of my few 10s in this challenge (which seems to have some extremely high caliber work). I hope you take home a ribbon!</td>', 'This one is pitch perfect. the lighting is excellent, the subject is interesting and well posed and the background is just out of this world. I love the overall composition. one of my few 10s in this challenge (which seems to have some extremely high caliber work). I hope you take home a ribbon!', '2004-04-01 13:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(648213, 67802, 3697, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot, is it some sort of column or pillar? Nice color and focus, and good use of lighting/shadow.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot, is it some sort of column or pillar? Nice color and focus, and good use of lighting/shadow.', '2004-04-01 13:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(648214, 65815, 17200, '<td valign="top">DrJOnes I presume. You and your lady get around a lot, heh heh. Aside from the fact she''s stunning and could stand in front of a garbage dump and you''d still have a winning picture, this is a great shot. Even my wife likes it!</td>', 'DrJOnes I presume. You and your lady get around a lot, heh heh. Aside from the fact she''s stunning and could stand in front of a garbage dump and you''d still have a winning picture, this is a great shot. Even my wife likes it!', '2004-04-01 13:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(648215, 67567, 3697, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is some serious ice!</td>', 'Wow, that is some serious ice!', '2004-04-01 13:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(648217, 67768, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love little fellows like this and just love the little seed in it''s mouth. I really like this in black and white too - the DOF is amazing and really makes the image pop! I just want to tickle this little guy''s underbelly,it looks so soft. I''m giving it a 10.</td>', 'I love little fellows like this and just love the little seed in it''s mouth. I really like this in black and white too - the DOF is amazing and really makes the image pop! I just want to tickle this little guy''s underbelly,it looks so soft. I''m giving it a 10.', '2004-04-01 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(648218, 63789, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is wicked cool! Really love the composition, and how the reflection and lighting adds to the overall balance. - 9</td>', 'This is wicked cool! Really love the composition, and how the reflection and lighting adds to the overall balance. - 9', '2004-04-01 13:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
