(648226, 66692, 15207, '<td valign="top">I could look at this one forever. The rich colours, the mist, the overall subject adn composition. All pitch perfect!</td>', 'I could look at this one forever. The rich colours, the mist, the overall subject adn composition. All pitch perfect!', '2004-04-01 13:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(648227, 64731, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really compelling. This one looks very professional, interesting and artistic. Goodl uck!</td>', 'Really compelling. This one looks very professional, interesting and artistic. Goodl uck!', '2004-04-01 13:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(648229, 67032, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really love this little bird - I have a penchant for the wildlife shots. I think your border detracts quite a bit from a really eye-popping image, but I''m not going to deduct marks or anything (unlike some people who vote in this challenge) because the overall image is just stunning. - 9</td>', 'I really love this little bird - I have a penchant for the wildlife shots. I think your border detracts quite a bit from a really eye-popping image, but I''m not going to deduct marks or anything (unlike some people who vote in this challenge) because the overall image is just stunning. - 9', '2004-04-01 13:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(648230, 63159, 19117, '<td valign="top">The perspective made me laugh out loud.</td>', 'The perspective made me laugh out loud.', '2004-04-01 13:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(648231, 67772, 15207, '<td valign="top">I wish I could just hang out here with him, instead of procrastinating at my desk like I''m doing right now. Just love the expression, the tones, texture, contrast and composition. I hope you do well! - 9</td>', 'I wish I could just hang out here with him, instead of procrastinating at my desk like I''m doing right now. Just love the expression, the tones, texture, contrast and composition. I hope you do well! - 9', '2004-04-01 13:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(648232, 67311, 11843, '<td valign="top">its tough to distinguish what exactly is rusty with this mono-toned image. i dont really see the focal point of this photo either, cause you have bright white lettering or number, which is cut off and isnt distinguishable as any form of word or number, and a bolt with a streak running down from it. i am assuming that the bolt is the rusty part along with the streak, but its hard to tell. maybe if you had zoomed in a little on the bolt and made it your main subject and left the photo with natural colors it would have been easier to tell. 5</td>', 'its tough to distinguish what exactly is rusty with this mono-toned image. i dont really see the focal point of this photo either, cause you have bright white lettering or number, which is cut off and isnt distinguishable as any form of word or number, and a bolt with a streak running down from it. i am assuming that the bolt is the rusty part along with the streak, but its hard to tell. maybe if you had zoomed in a little on the bolt and made it your main subject and left the photo with natural colors it would have been easier to tell. 5', '2004-04-01 13:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(648233, 67643, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really love the overall effect of this image - it really makes you think. You really captured the essence of a mood, a personality, a time and place, etc. The overall composition is wonderful and this boy''s eyes are amazing. This is very National Geographic quality.</td>', 'Really love the overall effect of this image - it really makes you think. You really captured the essence of a mood, a personality, a time and place, etc. The overall composition is wonderful and this boy''s eyes are amazing. This is very National Geographic quality.', '2004-04-01 13:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(648235, 67392, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really love your subject and overall compsotion. I just love that little boy with the straw hat and his hands in his pockets. Really captivating image - 9</td>', 'Really love your subject and overall compsotion. I just love that little boy with the straw hat and his hands in his pockets. Really captivating image - 9', '2004-04-01 13:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
