(648397, 67650, 14614, '<td valign="top">ooo I like this - quite unique and creative.  there''s something funky about the left side of the smaller shot... i''m not quite sure if it''s that it goes all the way to the edge -- don''t think you need the ? imho.  as presented, an interestingly different effort</td>', 'ooo I like this - quite unique and creative.  there''s something funky about the left side of the smaller shot... i''m not quite sure if it''s that it goes all the way to the edge -- don''t think you need the ? imho.  as presented, an interestingly different effort', '2004-04-01 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(648401, 64781, 327, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t feel as it you spent much time composing the shot. The strings hanging down really bother the over all shot for me. Also the light and focus is spoty at best. I will say the pose and the coloring I like very much. I don''t want to sound as if I''m totally trashing this shot.....I''m not. Just giving my 2cents on a few areas I feel need improvement.</td>', 'This doesn''t feel as it you spent much time composing the shot. The strings hanging down really bother the over all shot for me. Also the light and focus is spoty at best. I will say the pose and the coloring I like very much. I don''t want to sound as if I''m totally trashing this shot.....I''m not. Just giving my 2cents on a few areas I feel need improvement.', '2004-04-01 14:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(648402, 65510, 9964, '<td valign="top">this is wonderful portrait work. may we all be blessed to have the ability to capture the special moments that our lives have to offer. best of luck jjbeuin in the challenge :)<br/>                                      Sean</td>', 'this is wonderful portrait work. may we all be blessed to have the ability to capture the special moments that our lives have to offer. best of luck jjbeuin in the challenge :)                                      Sean', '2004-04-01 14:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(648404, 67091, 14614, '<td valign="top">see you''ve tried a unique pov here... perfect dof.  i find my eye stopping at the bright flowers -- nothing pulls my eye through the frame until I get to the blue sky.  while back there, there is nothing interesting to see (imho)</td>', 'see you''ve tried a unique pov here... perfect dof.  i find my eye stopping at the bright flowers -- nothing pulls my eye through the frame until I get to the blue sky.  while back there, there is nothing interesting to see (imho)', '2004-04-01 14:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(648407, 65577, 11897, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, may look better with a tighter crop to the right of the girl,<br/>Great picture, should do well.</td>', 'I love the lighting, may look better with a tighter crop to the right of the girl,Great picture, should do well.', '2004-04-01 14:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(648410, 65453, 327, '<td valign="top">Technically-color, focus, light are all good. I do think this has a snap shot feel to it. That isn''t always a bad thing, but for this challenge I think it will hurt your score. Over all I like this entry.</td>', 'Technically-color, focus, light are all good. I do think this has a snap shot feel to it. That isn''t always a bad thing, but for this challenge I think it will hurt your score. Over all I like this entry.', '2004-04-01 14:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(648411, 66591, 11897, '<td valign="top">Great picture, just slightly crooked....I think :)</td>', 'Great picture, just slightly crooked....I think :)', '2004-04-01 14:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(648413, 67486, 11897, '<td valign="top">too small.</td>', 'too small.', '2004-04-01 14:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(648415, 67758, 327, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit too smoothed out, painterly feel and not so photo like. I don''t dislike the technique. Buzz filters do the same type of look. I like the feel of this shot, evening, the people, it''s really nice to look at.</td>', 'Seems a bit too smoothed out, painterly feel and not so photo like. I don''t dislike the technique. Buzz filters do the same type of look. I like the feel of this shot, evening, the people, it''s really nice to look at.', '2004-04-01 14:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(648416, 67683, 327, '<td valign="top">Might of been better if you could of controlled that harsh light. It takes away from the  good parts of the shot.</td>', 'Might of been better if you could of controlled that harsh light. It takes away from the  good parts of the shot.', '2004-04-01 14:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(648417, 66971, 7889, '<td valign="top">WOW! Stunning photo, amazing colours. Maybe crop some of the bottom off? Maybe not, great shot though. 9</td>', 'WOW! Stunning photo, amazing colours. Maybe crop some of the bottom off? Maybe not, great shot though. 9', '2004-04-01 14:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(648418, 65352, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the DOF but wish your subject was a bit larger in the frame and wish you had used a portrait format.</td>', 'Love the colors and the DOF but wish your subject was a bit larger in the frame and wish you had used a portrait format.', '2004-04-01 14:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(648420, 65510, 11897, '<td valign="top">wonderful image, I feel it transmits the happiness on the boy''s face, even the old guy is smiling..love it. 10<br/>good luck.</td>', 'wonderful image, I feel it transmits the happiness on the boy''s face, even the old guy is smiling..love it. 10good luck.', '2004-04-01 14:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(648421, 67801, 7889, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and the pattern of the sand and the position of the palms. 8</td>', 'Love the angle and the pattern of the sand and the position of the palms. 8', '2004-04-01 14:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(648422, 67258, 7889, '<td valign="top">Simple and simply wonderful photo. Its my type of image though maybe not everyone''s cup of tea, as they say. well done = 8</td>', 'Simple and simply wonderful photo. Its my type of image though maybe not everyone''s cup of tea, as they say. well done = 8', '2004-04-01 14:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(648423, 67260, 11897, '<td valign="top">nice picture but the wood going throuh his head spoils it slightly.<br/>maybe a lower viewpoint.</td>', 'nice picture but the wood going throuh his head spoils it slightly.maybe a lower viewpoint.', '2004-04-01 14:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(648425, 67775, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice moment in time. Maybe a little more contrast or saturation. Good work.</td>', 'Nice moment in time. Maybe a little more contrast or saturation. Good work.', '2004-04-01 14:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(648426, 64731, 7889, '<td valign="top">Very original and unusual photo. Like the dof, great shot - 9</td>', 'Very original and unusual photo. Like the dof, great shot - 9', '2004-04-01 14:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(648428, 67726, 327, '<td valign="top">Light looks harsh on the hat and part of the face. Sun can really wash shots out..maybe shoot at different time of the day.</td>', 'Light looks harsh on the hat and part of the face. Sun can really wash shots out..maybe shoot at different time of the day.', '2004-04-01 14:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
