(648437, 64189, 327, '<td valign="top">Too much softness for me. Neat image or what ever...I don''t care for that look.  Technically this is a good shot I''m sure and would love to see the original without the soft affect. The blue is done well.</td>', 'Too much softness for me. Neat image or what ever...I don''t care for that look.  Technically this is a good shot I''m sure and would love to see the original without the soft affect. The blue is done well.', '2004-04-01 14:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
