(648481, 65815, 19338, '<td valign="top">nice photo, great use of lighting.</td>', 'nice photo, great use of lighting.', '2004-04-01 14:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(648482, 67527, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good composition on this one.  Branch and squirrel work well in this framing.  Nice definition of course.  In my opinion, border is a touch heavy, but not bad.  (That''s just a comment, I don''t base a vote on borders or titles)  In all, really nice.  Looks as if one could reach out and stroke that good looking fur.</td>', 'Good composition on this one.  Branch and squirrel work well in this framing.  Nice definition of course.  In my opinion, border is a touch heavy, but not bad.  (That''s just a comment, I don''t base a vote on borders or titles)  In all, really nice.  Looks as if one could reach out and stroke that good looking fur.', '2004-04-01 14:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(648483, 67801, 9964, '<td valign="top">~<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-28 22:01:32.</i></td>', '~', '2004-04-01 14:45:51.000000', '2004-07-28 23:01:32.000000', 1),
(648484, 67258, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good seeing on this one.  Excellent composition and nicely original as well.</td>', 'Good seeing on this one.  Excellent composition and nicely original as well.', '2004-04-01 14:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(648485, 64384, 14476, '<td valign="top">Cana''t help trotting out the old cliche: "Majesticly beautiful."  Once in a while"magestically beautiful" fits and this is one of those times.  Perfect for b&amp;w and all the technicals work well.  Congratulations on a fine image.</td>', 'Cana''t help trotting out the old cliche: "Majesticly beautiful."  Once in a while"magestically beautiful" fits and this is one of those times.  Perfect for b&w and all the technicals work well.  Congratulations on a fine image.', '2004-04-01 14:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(648486, 67723, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice, moody photograph.  Good subject for B&amp;W.  Well composed.  Just a thought.  If it was mine, I''d also try this image without those faint white verticals at the horizon and the one reflected in the water.  They don''t seem to be part of the story and one spends time puzzling over them instead of enjoying the picture.  Not a problem, just a thought.</td>', 'Nice, moody photograph.  Good subject for B&W.  Well composed.  Just a thought.  If it was mine, I''d also try this image without those faint white verticals at the horizon and the one reflected in the water.  They don''t seem to be part of the story and one spends time puzzling over them instead of enjoying the picture.  Not a problem, just a thought.', '2004-04-01 14:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(648487, 65815, 11738, '<td valign="top">Poor girl is gonna get dust all over her equipment:)  Great minimalistic apeal to the shot.  The colours of the dry lakebed, the model''s hair and the clear blue sky work wonders together.  Great work and once again, very appealing model.</td>', 'Poor girl is gonna get dust all over her equipment:)  Great minimalistic apeal to the shot.  The colours of the dry lakebed, the model''s hair and the clear blue sky work wonders together.  Great work and once again, very appealing model.', '2004-04-01 14:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(648488, 64731, 14603, '<td valign="top">Well constructed image..9</td>', 'Well constructed image..9', '2004-04-01 14:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(648491, 67728, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is such a good image. Fine composition and even a catchlight in the creature''s eye.  So many stories can be read into it.   I suppose slightly more area in focus would make this guy''s environment stand out more, but still, a good "story picture" well told.</td>', 'This is such a good image. Fine composition and even a catchlight in the creature''s eye.  So many stories can be read into it.   I suppose slightly more area in focus would make this guy''s environment stand out more, but still, a good "story picture" well told.', '2004-04-01 14:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(648493, 66886, 14476, '<td valign="top">This reminded me of an Edward Hopper painting.  Excellent colors, lighting and control over your technicals.  Good seeing.</td>', 'This reminded me of an Edward Hopper painting.  Excellent colors, lighting and control over your technicals.  Good seeing.', '2004-04-01 14:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(648494, 66161, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good shot of a bird of paradise.  Nicely composed, good color, sharp.  What more can one ask!  Good luck.</td>', 'Good shot of a bird of paradise.  Nicely composed, good color, sharp.  What more can one ask!  Good luck.', '2004-04-01 14:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
