(648516, 66177, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot jaggies here--over sharpened?  or Compression? The action is very nice, and the view is okay. I think composition could use some help or some more tighter cropping.  Sometimes we try to include too much in a single shot.</td>', 'Looks like a lot jaggies here--over sharpened?  or Compression? The action is very nice, and the view is okay. I think composition could use some help or some more tighter cropping.  Sometimes we try to include too much in a single shot.', '2004-04-01 15:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(648518, 66692, 14603, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition...really like this image.<br/>Would love to see how it looks in B/W....can`t make my mind up on whether I would prefer it without the tree.<br/>A true work of art...10</td>', 'Fantastic composition...really like this image.Would love to see how it looks in B/W....can`t make my mind up on whether I would prefer it without the tree.A true work of art...10', '2004-04-01 15:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
