(648783, 67355, 8286, '<td valign="top">Wow, great macro.  I only wish that little piece of petal lower left were not there.  It''s a tiny bit distracing.  Nice work.</td>', 'Wow, great macro.  I only wish that little piece of petal lower left were not there.  It''s a tiny bit distracing.  Nice work.', '2004-04-01 17:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(648784, 65984, 18913, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject matter.  Dignified composition.</td>', 'Beautiful subject matter.  Dignified composition.', '2004-04-01 17:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(648786, 64436, 18191, '<td valign="top">cropping all the way down tot he flower would have been effective</td>', 'cropping all the way down tot he flower would have been effective', '2004-04-01 17:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(648788, 67437, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s very obvious that the background was chopped out after the fact (as opposed to shooting this against a white background).</td>', 'It''s very obvious that the background was chopped out after the fact (as opposed to shooting this against a white background).', '2004-04-01 17:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(648789, 67203, 8286, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  The foreground reads a little dark.</td>', 'Pretty.  The foreground reads a little dark.', '2004-04-01 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(648790, 66971, 18913, '<td valign="top">A masterpiece of impressionism on this subject matter.  Amazing contrast and color study.  Where did you snap this?</td>', 'A masterpiece of impressionism on this subject matter.  Amazing contrast and color study.  Where did you snap this?', '2004-04-01 17:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(648793, 67312, 18913, '<td valign="top">I see an optical illusion.  I don''t know if that was intended but if it was then brilliant!</td>', 'I see an optical illusion.  I don''t know if that was intended but if it was then brilliant!', '2004-04-01 17:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(648795, 67061, 8286, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell if it is a flower or fabric.  Interesting concept.</td>', 'Hard to tell if it is a flower or fabric.  Interesting concept.', '2004-04-01 17:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(648799, 64189, 18913, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but I think a more heart felt or somber expression from the model would add power to this mood piece.</td>', 'Interesting idea but I think a more heart felt or somber expression from the model would add power to this mood piece.', '2004-04-01 17:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(648800, 66692, 8286, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and lighing.</td>', 'Lovely tones and lighing.', '2004-04-01 17:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(648801, 64270, 18913, '<td valign="top">I wish I had a lens like that!  Clearly you are a pro!</td>', 'I wish I had a lens like that!  Clearly you are a pro!', '2004-04-01 17:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(648805, 66008, 8286, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of sepia, but somehow distracting.  Is the tone the subject or the picture or the clouds or the waves?</td>', 'Interesting use of sepia, but somehow distracting.  Is the tone the subject or the picture or the clouds or the waves?', '2004-04-01 17:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(648809, 64157, 18913, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully playful narrative piece!  I love it!</td>', 'Wonderfully playful narrative piece!  I love it!', '2004-04-01 17:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(648810, 67725, 3102, '<td valign="top">Quite the unnatural sky color...?</td>', 'Quite the unnatural sky color...?', '2004-04-01 17:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(648813, 66505, 18913, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s happening in this photo but it''s very interesting.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s happening in this photo but it''s very interesting.', '2004-04-01 17:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(648816, 64015, 18913, '<td valign="top">Very sensitive photo.</td>', 'Very sensitive photo.', '2004-04-01 17:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(648817, 67683, 16663, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred more focus on the stop cock or valve. There are some interesting textures here, which could have been emphasised by a tighter crop</td>', 'I would have preferred more focus on the stop cock or valve. There are some interesting textures here, which could have been emphasised by a tighter crop', '2004-04-01 17:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(648818, 65670, 8286, '<td valign="top">Pretty but no real context.  I didn''t see the bee until the second or third look.</td>', 'Pretty but no real context.  I didn''t see the bee until the second or third look.', '2004-04-01 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(648821, 67015, 16663, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think the water droplets work better on a vibrant coloured flower.</td>', 'Nice, but I think the water droplets work better on a vibrant coloured flower.', '2004-04-01 17:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(648822, 66702, 16663, '<td valign="top">Great detail</td>', 'Great detail', '2004-04-01 17:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(648823, 67067, 18913, '<td valign="top">A technical marvel.  You''ve succeeded in making this appear like a historic photo.</td>', 'A technical marvel.  You''ve succeeded in making this appear like a historic photo.', '2004-04-01 17:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(648825, 64449, 8286, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but for some reason the birds are distracting.</td>', 'Pretty, but for some reason the birds are distracting.', '2004-04-01 17:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(648826, 67071, 8286, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but a little softly focused.</td>', 'Pretty, but a little softly focused.', '2004-04-01 17:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(648829, 64520, 18913, '<td valign="top">Great eye and great subject matter.</td>', 'Great eye and great subject matter.', '2004-04-01 17:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(648830, 65705, 8286, '<td valign="top">This is just creepy to me for some reason.  Maybe it''s the saturation with the light.</td>', 'This is just creepy to me for some reason.  Maybe it''s the saturation with the light.', '2004-04-01 17:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(648832, 67771, 16663, '<td valign="top">The flowers are beautiful together and show a good contrast, but the windmill is a little distracting.</td>', 'The flowers are beautiful together and show a good contrast, but the windmill is a little distracting.', '2004-04-01 17:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(648834, 65984, 8286, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The color is amazing.  The frame is good.  I might have cropped just a touch closer (to the tail and on the right)</td>', 'Wow!  The color is amazing.  The frame is good.  I might have cropped just a touch closer (to the tail and on the right)', '2004-04-01 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(648836, 64948, 18913, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you''ve done some image editing with this.  The idea is extraordinary but the bird''s neck looks a little odd in places.</td>', 'I''m assuming you''ve done some image editing with this.  The idea is extraordinary but the bird''s neck looks a little odd in places.', '2004-04-01 17:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(648838, 67488, 18913, '<td valign="top">I see a marvel!</td>', 'I see a marvel!', '2004-04-01 17:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(648839, 67723, 16663, '<td valign="top">The toning is superb; the reflections are great and so is the pose. But I find that its slightly too much. Just my opinion and I''d be interested to see what others think.</td>', 'The toning is superb; the reflections are great and so is the pose. But I find that its slightly too much. Just my opinion and I''d be interested to see what others think.', '2004-04-01 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(648844, 67067, 8286, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia effect here, though it could be a little more saturatied.  It looks as if the boat is sitting on sand not water.  Love the topic.</td>', 'I like the sepia effect here, though it could be a little more saturatied.  It looks as if the boat is sitting on sand not water.  Love the topic.', '2004-04-01 17:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(648845, 63536, 18913, '<td valign="top">With studio lighting the true color of the tulips do not seem to come through.  The subject''s stance is excellent though as is its juxtaposition with the background!</td>', 'With studio lighting the true color of the tulips do not seem to come through.  The subject''s stance is excellent though as is its juxtaposition with the background!', '2004-04-01 17:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(648847, 64384, 16663, '<td valign="top">Almost unreal - just superb, especially that raft of light on the slopes.</td>', 'Almost unreal - just superb, especially that raft of light on the slopes.', '2004-04-01 17:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(648849, 67754, 18913, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully evocative and imaginative.</td>', 'Wonderfully evocative and imaginative.', '2004-04-01 17:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(648850, 65664, 3102, '<td valign="top">I might have tried including her head and the horse''s feet... seems a bit tightly cropped to me.</td>', 'I might have tried including her head and the horse''s feet... seems a bit tightly cropped to me.', '2004-04-01 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(648852, 67567, 8286, '<td valign="top">Interesing shot.  It makes me wonder where this is.</td>', 'Interesing shot.  It makes me wonder where this is.', '2004-04-01 17:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(648853, 67671, 18913, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know how you did this.  I want to play with blue dyes too.</td>', 'I''d love to know how you did this.  I want to play with blue dyes too.', '2004-04-01 17:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(648855, 66157, 8286, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is almost unreal, like a movie set.</td>', 'Wow.  This is almost unreal, like a movie set.', '2004-04-01 17:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(648856, 66469, 18913, '<td valign="top">The sky looks a little artificial but that could be my monitor.</td>', 'The sky looks a little artificial but that could be my monitor.', '2004-04-01 17:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(648858, 67202, 8286, '<td valign="top">Nice saturation.</td>', 'Nice saturation.', '2004-04-01 17:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(648860, 63265, 16663, '<td valign="top">"Nice", but needs a bit more focus to be something a bit more special. I don''t think the rocks are strong enough here - perhaps if there was a well lit solitary one in the foreground it might have worked better.</td>', '"Nice", but needs a bit more focus to be something a bit more special. I don''t think the rocks are strong enough here - perhaps if there was a well lit solitary one in the foreground it might have worked better.', '2004-04-01 17:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(648861, 67788, 3102, '<td valign="top">Might have been a little stronger with a blurred-out background to showcase the horse/rider a little better.  I know this isn''t easy with a lot of cameras, but it would have made for a little better image, I think.</td>', 'Might have been a little stronger with a blurred-out background to showcase the horse/rider a little better.  I know this isn''t easy with a lot of cameras, but it would have made for a little better image, I think.', '2004-04-01 17:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(648862, 67677, 8286, '<td valign="top">Love the topic.  I dig industiral topics.  The color of the knob and the back ground is almost too close.  LIke the angle and DOF, it''s differnet.</td>', 'Love the topic.  I dig industiral topics.  The color of the knob and the back ground is almost too close.  LIke the angle and DOF, it''s differnet.', '2004-04-01 17:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
