(649049, 67126, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely mood image.   You captured the fog beautifully.   I thought fog was the specialty of only us San Franciscans :&gt;)  Seriously, it''s a really good photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'Lovely mood image.   You captured the fog beautifully.   I thought fog was the specialty of only us San Franciscans :>)  Seriously, it''s a really good photo.  Good luck.', '2004-04-01 19:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
