(649052, 67754, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good subject for black and white.  I wonder if it''s a bit heavy on the aging technique in the border.  But looking past that, I enjoy the image very much.  Nice.</td>', 'Good subject for black and white.  I wonder if it''s a bit heavy on the aging technique in the border.  But looking past that, I enjoy the image very much.  Nice.', '2004-04-01 19:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(649054, 67203, 14476, '<td valign="top">Wonder if we were in the same desert last week.  (I was in Joshua Trees)  Anyhow, this is a good rendition of the mountains and trees.  You had a good sky too.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wonder if we were in the same desert last week.  (I was in Joshua Trees)  Anyhow, this is a good rendition of the mountains and trees.  You had a good sky too.  Nice job.', '2004-04-01 19:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(649056, 67521, 4285, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF would work better if the front bottle was in focus. Also the lighting is a little uneven. In my opinion the bottle on the right is exposed very well while the other two are a little washed out (maybe because they are empty). I do like the tones though.</td>', 'The shallow DOF would work better if the front bottle was in focus. Also the lighting is a little uneven. In my opinion the bottle on the right is exposed very well while the other two are a little washed out (maybe because they are empty). I do like the tones though.', '2004-04-01 19:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(649059, 63265, 14476, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus throughout and fine contrast between the greens in foreground and the crisp mountain background.  Beautifully composed.  Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent focus throughout and fine contrast between the greens in foreground and the crisp mountain background.  Beautifully composed.  Good luck.', '2004-04-01 19:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(649060, 66980, 14476, '<td valign="top">I can see why you would want to submit this to the March study. Those rich colors and good composition just ask to be admired.  Good job.</td>', 'I can see why you would want to submit this to the March study. Those rich colors and good composition just ask to be admired.  Good job.', '2004-04-01 19:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(649063, 67266, 4285, '<td valign="top">"Security....security...there''s a pervert in the lady''s washroom with a camera...security..."   Cool infinity mirror effect. Could have been even better if one of the ladies would have agreed to shine a flashlight for you. Cheers and goodluck. :)</td>', '"Security....security...there''s a pervert in the lady''s washroom with a camera...security..."   Cool infinity mirror effect. Could have been even better if one of the ladies would have agreed to shine a flashlight for you. Cheers and goodluck. :)', '2004-04-01 19:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(649065, 67740, 14476, '<td valign="top">Delightful.  Nothing is out of place; all the technicals work and it''s fun to look at.  What more can anyone want!  10</td>', 'Delightful.  Nothing is out of place; all the technicals work and it''s fun to look at.  What more can anyone want!  10', '2004-04-01 19:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
