(649068, 67412, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, you have bird photography down pat.  Hope you have a long lens or fast fingers.  This guy wouldn''t mind having them for a snack.  Of course it is a beautiful job.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well, you have bird photography down pat.  Hope you have a long lens or fast fingers.  This guy wouldn''t mind having them for a snack.  Of course it is a beautiful job.  Good luck.', '2004-04-01 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
