(649075, 67035, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good definition in the fur and quite good blurring of the background so we can focus on the face.  Wish you could have gotten a catchlight in the eye, but still, a very nice image.</td>', 'Good definition in the fur and quite good blurring of the background so we can focus on the face.  Wish you could have gotten a catchlight in the eye, but still, a very nice image.', '2004-04-01 19:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
