(649289, 67355, 14476, '<td valign="top">Excellent definition on this pollen covered bee!  I rather like the muted colors of the flowers.  It adds to the enormous attraction of the bee.  I looked at the cropping and decided it''s just fine in my book.  I''m excited for you that you got such a great image of that bee.  Those wings.  Okay, I''ll stop now...</td>', 'Excellent definition on this pollen covered bee!  I rather like the muted colors of the flowers.  It adds to the enormous attraction of the bee.  I looked at the cropping and decided it''s just fine in my book.  I''m excited for you that you got such a great image of that bee.  Those wings.  Okay, I''ll stop now...', '2004-04-01 21:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
