(649417, 63735, 12661, '<td valign="top">I realize there is little you can do about it (well, nothing legal) but the posts on the bridge are taller than the skyscraper and really take away from its grandeur. However, if you have enough zoom and enough room behind you, by increasing the distance to the posts and zooming in, you can reduce their height in relation to the building.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-07 23:27:55.</i></td>', 'I realize there is little you can do about it (well, nothing legal) but the posts on the bridge are taller than the skyscraper and really take away from its grandeur. However, if you have enough zoom and enough room behind you, by increasing the distance to the posts and zooming in, you can reduce their height in relation to the building.', '2004-04-01 22:05:16.000000', '2008-03-07 23:27:55.000000', 1),
