(649435, 66505, 12661, '<td valign="top">There is too much of an extreme in lighting. The combination of the dark shades under the bridge and the bright direct light is too much for cameras to handle properly. As a result, the bright area is blown out. The subject itself is quite nice as an urban theme. Consider reshooting it on an overcast day.</td>', 'There is too much of an extreme in lighting. The combination of the dark shades under the bridge and the bright direct light is too much for cameras to handle properly. As a result, the bright area is blown out. The subject itself is quite nice as an urban theme. Consider reshooting it on an overcast day.', '2004-04-01 22:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
