(650078, 67567, 17300, '<td valign="top">Nice one. Maybe even more interesting composition if you''d rethink the shot and place the bird in the right upper corner quadrant - thus eliminating the snow mound, which is the least interesting in the photo... There is clearly enough clouds to make it an interesting picture. But then again -it''s also about taking the shot. The bird is not a stationary object.</td>', 'Nice one. Maybe even more interesting composition if you''d rethink the shot and place the bird in the right upper corner quadrant - thus eliminating the snow mound, which is the least interesting in the photo... There is clearly enough clouds to make it an interesting picture. But then again -it''s also about taking the shot. The bird is not a stationary object.', '2004-04-02 05:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(650079, 67546, 17300, '<td valign="top">Nice one...</td>', 'Nice one...', '2004-04-02 05:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(650081, 67729, 17300, '<td valign="top">...and I''m hungry.</td>', '...and I''m hungry.', '2004-04-02 05:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(650082, 67801, 17300, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and textures.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and textures.', '2004-04-02 05:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(650095, 64384, 17300, '<td valign="top">Toooooo small... Want it bigger.... But really nice how the light reflects of the snowy mountains... 10</td>', 'Toooooo small... Want it bigger.... But really nice how the light reflects of the snowy mountains... 10', '2004-04-02 05:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(650097, 65811, 17300, '<td valign="top">looks like he wants to spank somebody. Funny picture. Like the simplicity in colours as well. 9</td>', 'looks like he wants to spank somebody. Funny picture. Like the simplicity in colours as well. 9', '2004-04-02 05:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(650103, 65638, 15407, '<td valign="top">I believe that If this photo were presented with what I perceive as filterd light I would have liked it even more.... The lighting on the rocks in the foreground are the indicator to me, otherwise very nicely composed.</td>', 'I believe that If this photo were presented with what I perceive as filterd light I would have liked it even more.... The lighting on the rocks in the foreground are the indicator to me, otherwise very nicely composed.', '2004-04-02 05:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(650152, 67776, 16126, '<td valign="top">Focus should have been on head instead of on back of the bird. Good colors and lighting. Maybe also putting the head slightly off-center?</td>', 'Focus should have been on head instead of on back of the bird. Good colors and lighting. Maybe also putting the head slightly off-center?', '2004-04-02 07:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(650154, 65815, 9913, '<td valign="top">her breast looks like a pancake..<br/> <br/>I dont think this pose works...</td>', 'her breast looks like a pancake.. I dont think this pose works...', '2004-04-02 07:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(650156, 67266, 16126, '<td valign="top">Without the photographer in it, I would even consider hanging this in my living room!</td>', 'Without the photographer in it, I would even consider hanging this in my living room!', '2004-04-02 07:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(650161, 67659, 16126, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have lots of color shifts and unsharpness here. Composition would have improved with the walk way off-center.</td>', 'Looks like you have lots of color shifts and unsharpness here. Composition would have improved with the walk way off-center.', '2004-04-02 07:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(650162, 67405, 16126, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see his eyes in focus</td>', 'Would have liked to see his eyes in focus', '2004-04-02 07:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(650163, 67704, 16126, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2004-04-02 07:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(650166, 67650, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nicely executed. Maybe a little bit more light from the left? And the question mark on the left edge is distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea, nicely executed. Maybe a little bit more light from the left? And the question mark on the left edge is distracting.', '2004-04-02 07:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(650170, 67527, 16126, '<td valign="top">Great catch, great colors. Cropping could be better, although I realise you want the whole tail in there. Maybe vertical frame?</td>', 'Great catch, great colors. Cropping could be better, although I realise you want the whole tail in there. Maybe vertical frame?', '2004-04-02 07:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(650181, 67715, 16126, '<td valign="top">Unsharp! Should have taken this without the ugly gates. I know that''s hardly possible, but there''s much more interesting to see and photograph around Rome without offending constructing work.</td>', 'Unsharp! Should have taken this without the ugly gates. I know that''s hardly possible, but there''s much more interesting to see and photograph around Rome without offending constructing work.', '2004-04-02 07:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(650183, 67768, 16126, '<td valign="top">Incredible! Great capture, great lighting, great focus (you can actually count his feathers!).</td>', 'Incredible! Great capture, great lighting, great focus (you can actually count his feathers!).', '2004-04-02 07:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(650186, 67726, 16126, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed on the hat. Nice composition, good DOF.</td>', 'A bit overexposed on the hat. Nice composition, good DOF.', '2004-04-02 07:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(650188, 67574, 10350, '<td valign="top">really big and blue eyes</td>', 'really big and blue eyes', '2004-04-02 07:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(650190, 67481, 10350, '<td valign="top">damn this is a good picture.....10</td>', 'damn this is a good picture.....10', '2004-04-02 08:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(650192, 66469, 18191, '<td valign="top">There''s something about the color in this that makes me SMILE!</td>', 'There''s something about the color in this that makes me SMILE!', '2004-04-02 08:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(650193, 67488, 10350, '<td valign="top">I love it. its rotated clockwise right?</td>', 'I love it. its rotated clockwise right?', '2004-04-02 08:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(650195, 67754, 10350, '<td valign="top">kúl border</td>', 'kúl border', '2004-04-02 08:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(650196, 67798, 10350, '<td valign="top">hehe</td>', 'hehe', '2004-04-02 08:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(650197, 67658, 16126, '<td valign="top">Cropping out the house and fence would be beter. Great colors</td>', 'Cropping out the house and fence would be beter. Great colors', '2004-04-02 08:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(650202, 66971, 12998, '<td valign="top">great detail</td>', 'great detail', '2004-04-02 08:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(650203, 65221, 12998, '<td valign="top">awesome detail</td>', 'awesome detail', '2004-04-02 08:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(650213, 65811, 14614, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to read the details on this one!  Orginal, fresh and clever.</td>', 'Can''t wait to read the details on this one!  Orginal, fresh and clever.', '2004-04-02 08:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(650218, 66635, 14614, '<td valign="top">quite an unusal take on the flower theme  -- I like the painting-like quality you''ve achieved.  I''m wondering what impact moving the brightest flower off center would have?  As presented, well done</td>', 'quite an unusal take on the flower theme  -- I like the painting-like quality you''ve achieved.  I''m wondering what impact moving the brightest flower off center would have?  As presented, well done', '2004-04-02 09:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(650223, 66553, 14614, '<td valign="top">great color combination -- wondering what this would look like with a  portrait orientation -- minor nits: I''d clone out the bluish thing on the side of the building lower right and crop out the window frames on the floor below</td>', 'great color combination -- wondering what this would look like with a  portrait orientation -- minor nits: I''d clone out the bluish thing on the side of the building lower right and crop out the window frames on the floor below', '2004-04-02 09:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(650225, 65510, 14614, '<td valign="top">such a great way to tell the story -- good use of b&amp;w, nice composition and lighting</td>', 'such a great way to tell the story -- good use of b&w, nice composition and lighting', '2004-04-02 09:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(650226, 67788, 14614, '<td valign="top">excellent framing of your subject -- background competes for attention a bit too much</td>', 'excellent framing of your subject -- background competes for attention a bit too much', '2004-04-02 09:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(650227, 66469, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the graduated blue of the sky - something about the proportions is a bit off (static?)</td>', 'I like the graduated blue of the sky - something about the proportions is a bit off (static?)', '2004-04-02 09:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(650228, 66993, 14614, '<td valign="top">like the gritty treatment (small nit - wondering why you''ve left in that yellow button thing?  draws my eye to an uninteresting part of the image)  overall nice composition -- tells the story well</td>', 'like the gritty treatment (small nit - wondering why you''ve left in that yellow button thing?  draws my eye to an uninteresting part of the image)  overall nice composition -- tells the story well', '2004-04-02 09:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(650231, 63870, 4543, '<td valign="top">You did a job here using PWL. A 9 for me, good luck!</td>', 'You did a job here using PWL. A 9 for me, good luck!', '2004-04-02 09:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(650234, 67658, 4543, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful catch and the sunset is nice.  Did you use any fish eye lens or something? 10!</td>', 'This is a wonderful catch and the sunset is nice.  Did you use any fish eye lens or something? 10!', '2004-04-02 09:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(650259, 65811, 4338, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2004-04-02 09:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(650260, 67355, 4338, '<td valign="top">nice capture, the bee has a lot of detail and is in good focus</td>', 'nice capture, the bee has a lot of detail and is in good focus', '2004-04-02 09:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(650288, 66008, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of tone. Giving the sky the greatest amount of image real estate is perfect for this image. The hot spot in the upper right corner is a slight distraction to this outstanding shot.</td>', 'Interesting use of tone. Giving the sky the greatest amount of image real estate is perfect for this image. The hot spot in the upper right corner is a slight distraction to this outstanding shot.', '2004-04-02 10:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(650289, 67412, 19010, '<td valign="top">I''m not a member and still felt obligated to comment. WOW! I love it.</td>', 'I''m not a member and still felt obligated to comment. WOW! I love it.', '2004-04-02 10:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(650290, 67642, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice motion blur. The best part of this one is the baton in clearest focus. Capturing the exchange is the main theme of this image. Good capture.</td>', 'Nice motion blur. The best part of this one is the baton in clearest focus. Capturing the exchange is the main theme of this image. Good capture.', '2004-04-02 10:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(650297, 67781, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like this....to me it has great dramatic appeal.  I like the soft darkness surrounding the lighter flower which is the place your eye travels to first....</td>', 'I like this....to me it has great dramatic appeal.  I like the soft darkness surrounding the lighter flower which is the place your eye travels to first....', '2004-04-02 10:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(650301, 67517, 14593, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo....I would have never connected  this photo with a beach either without the title....the placement and use of the rocks with the old wood is a different concept.  I think this would be a difficult thing to photograph to convey to the observer of your photograph what it actually is...I think you did a good job!</td>', 'An interesting photo....I would have never connected  this photo with a beach either without the title....the placement and use of the rocks with the old wood is a different concept.  I think this would be a difficult thing to photograph to convey to the observer of your photograph what it actually is...I think you did a good job!', '2004-04-02 10:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(650306, 65670, 14593, '<td valign="top">a little busy for me....the colors are nice, but I almost missed the bee!  yet, still a good photo overall</td>', 'a little busy for me....the colors are nice, but I almost missed the bee!  yet, still a good photo overall', '2004-04-02 10:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(650308, 67244, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting subject....a little too busy for me....great building!  I wish the sign had been more of your focus in this photo, but that is only my opinion.</td>', 'interesting subject....a little too busy for me....great building!  I wish the sign had been more of your focus in this photo, but that is only my opinion.', '2004-04-02 10:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(650309, 65567, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice photo.....it catches the eye.  I love the colors too.  I like the composition too.</td>', 'nice photo.....it catches the eye.  I love the colors too.  I like the composition too.', '2004-04-02 10:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(650314, 66615, 14593, '<td valign="top">funny photo!  I love the colors too.....vibrant greens &amp; oranges.....well photographed!</td>', 'funny photo!  I love the colors too.....vibrant greens & oranges.....well photographed!', '2004-04-02 10:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(650318, 67650, 14593, '<td valign="top">a very interesting photo....I like the idea and well as the final result.  The lighting is very good....the alignment of the photo against your face is great!  Very creative work!  I am giving this a high score!!</td>', 'a very interesting photo....I like the idea and well as the final result.  The lighting is very good....the alignment of the photo against your face is great!  Very creative work!  I am giving this a high score!!', '2004-04-02 10:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(650320, 67692, 16520, '<td valign="top">Very nice sharp the detail of the pin feathers is awesome...</td>', 'Very nice sharp the detail of the pin feathers is awesome...', '2004-04-02 10:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(650338, 67546, 5792, '<td valign="top">A dramatic sky aways enhances a good image. This is a nice capture, especially the birds. Under advanced rules you have several options available to reduce the overexposed areas in the upper and middle portion of the image (using Photoshop). An adjustment level would work well for that. A 50% overlay greyscale level could be added to bring out highlights in the light streaks to make them more dramatic.  Be careful, it is easy to overdo that. My personal preference would be to either make this image "more" sepia or go totally greyscale with it. In any regard, I like this shot a lot.</td>', 'A dramatic sky aways enhances a good image. This is a nice capture, especially the birds. Under advanced rules you have several options available to reduce the overexposed areas in the upper and middle portion of the image (using Photoshop). An adjustment level would work well for that. A 50% overlay greyscale level could be added to bring out highlights in the light streaks to make them more dramatic.  Be careful, it is easy to overdo that. My personal preference would be to either make this image "more" sepia or go totally greyscale with it. In any regard, I like this shot a lot.', '2004-04-02 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(650341, 67521, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent, excellent tones in this image. Good clarity and technical quality. Low DOF that leaves the center bottle out-of-focus does not work well for me, but might with the other voters. I might have smoothed out the dark area at the very bottom just right of the center of the image.</td>', 'Excellent, excellent tones in this image. Good clarity and technical quality. Low DOF that leaves the center bottle out-of-focus does not work well for me, but might with the other voters. I might have smoothed out the dark area at the very bottom just right of the center of the image.', '2004-04-02 11:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(650344, 67657, 5792, '<td valign="top">Decent lighting and composition. You know springtime has arrived in the desert when cactus come out to bloom. I''ve also started my collection of cactus blooms and desert wildflowers.</td>', 'Decent lighting and composition. You know springtime has arrived in the desert when cactus come out to bloom. I''ve also started my collection of cactus blooms and desert wildflowers.', '2004-04-02 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(650346, 66886, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m unconvinced about the processing here - sure, it''s a legitimate entry, and all legal and everything, but it takes what would appear to me to have been rather a fine photograph into the realms of something else. I see a connection between the subject and the treatment too, but don''t find it holds much appeal.</td>', 'I''m unconvinced about the processing here - sure, it''s a legitimate entry, and all legal and everything, but it takes what would appear to me to have been rather a fine photograph into the realms of something else. I see a connection between the subject and the treatment too, but don''t find it holds much appeal.', '2004-04-02 11:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(650350, 67324, 6999, '<td valign="top">Tonally excellent - the blue/green and the contrasting earthy tones of the animal and the stone are well caught. Some detail lacking - just don''t get that feeling of real fine detail - and the light and cropping perhaps leave something to be desired.</td>', 'Tonally excellent - the blue/green and the contrasting earthy tones of the animal and the stone are well caught. Some detail lacking - just don''t get that feeling of real fine detail - and the light and cropping perhaps leave something to be desired.', '2004-04-02 11:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(650355, 65352, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail, colour, focus. I like the balance too, of the foreground horizontal and the vertical subject. Highly competent, though a bit dull perhaps - lacking anything extraordinary. Woould make a successful stock shot I''d think - even room for some text :-)</td>', 'Wonderful detail, colour, focus. I like the balance too, of the foreground horizontal and the vertical subject. Highly competent, though a bit dull perhaps - lacking anything extraordinary. Woould make a successful stock shot I''d think - even room for some text :-)', '2004-04-02 11:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(650358, 67725, 5792, '<td valign="top">I''ll be very curious to see how this image is accepted by voters. It may cross over to digital art for many. I did not submit the image I prepared for this challenge specifically because of that.  I liked my image, though, and created this forum thread to show and explain it:  //www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=80288</td>', 'I''ll be very curious to see how this image is accepted by voters. It may cross over to digital art for many. I did not submit the image I prepared for this challenge specifically because of that.  I liked my image, though, and created this forum thread to show and explain it:  //www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=80288', '2004-04-02 11:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(650360, 67313, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very very nice. I think this would be a good black and white, too. Great balance.</td>', 'Very very nice. I think this would be a good black and white, too. Great balance.', '2004-04-02 11:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(650361, 65638, 6999, '<td valign="top">Done well to capture this light and still to blur the water - ND, or exceptionally low ISO? Good capture of a quite wide dynamic range too. Neatly composed too, so all round a competent image. Doesn''t excite me much beyond on that technicl front however.</td>', 'Done well to capture this light and still to blur the water - ND, or exceptionally low ISO? Good capture of a quite wide dynamic range too. Neatly composed too, so all round a competent image. Doesn''t excite me much beyond on that technicl front however.', '2004-04-02 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(650367, 67765, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good use of ROT. Would have been nice if you could have captured this one on one of the nights a planet was nearby. I think there might have been one of those slightly rare moments this past month.</td>', 'Good use of ROT. Would have been nice if you could have captured this one on one of the nights a planet was nearby. I think there might have been one of those slightly rare moments this past month.', '2004-04-02 11:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(650368, 67643, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good solid portrait, interesting and touching face. Like the sense of his emerging from hiding, and the edge of concern in his look. Not convinced by the neg space right of frame - think I would have cropped it more, as I don''t see what it adds, and the brightness draws my eye there a little and there isn''t anything there that seems to help the story.</td>', 'Good solid portrait, interesting and touching face. Like the sense of his emerging from hiding, and the edge of concern in his look. Not convinced by the neg space right of frame - think I would have cropped it more, as I don''t see what it adds, and the brightness draws my eye there a little and there isn''t anything there that seems to help the story.', '2004-04-02 11:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(650371, 67574, 5792, '<td valign="top">I hope not many folks think this is more digital art than digital photography and vote it lower. You will know if you have an excessive number of 1s, 2s and 3s.Your method to highlight the baby''s face is very creative. I''d have cropped off most everything right of the baby since there is little of interest there and you could have applied the rule of thirds.</td>', 'I hope not many folks think this is more digital art than digital photography and vote it lower. You will know if you have an excessive number of 1s, 2s and 3s.Your method to highlight the baby''s face is very creative. I''d have cropped off most everything right of the baby since there is little of interest there and you could have applied the rule of thirds.', '2004-04-02 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(650372, 67620, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo, I love the feeling of depth to it.  Nice composition and I like how the background tree is subdued.  I also apreciate that it is not a ,common subject/view.  Well done!</td>', 'This is a very nice photo, I love the feeling of depth to it.  Nice composition and I like how the background tree is subdued.  I also apreciate that it is not a ,common subject/view.  Well done!', '2004-04-02 11:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(650376, 67793, 7969, '<td valign="top">I will be checking to see how this one does in the end, I find the texture and the light wonderful,  it is a creative shot which is refreshing and well executed IMO,  this is the kind of shot I want to come back to to look at again and again.  Very nice work!</td>', 'I will be checking to see how this one does in the end, I find the texture and the light wonderful,  it is a creative shot which is refreshing and well executed IMO,  this is the kind of shot I want to come back to to look at again and again.  Very nice work!', '2004-04-02 11:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(650377, 67761, 7969, '<td valign="top">This image pops off the screen, focusing ones eye on this magnificent and vibrant creature. Not only is the beast itself well captured, but the black background makes it stand out as a creative shot vs. ''just another bird'' .  Well done!</td>', 'This image pops off the screen, focusing ones eye on this magnificent and vibrant creature. Not only is the beast itself well captured, but the black background makes it stand out as a creative shot vs. ''just another bird'' .  Well done!', '2004-04-02 11:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(650379, 65811, 326, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! 10</td>', 'Wonderful shot! 10', '2004-04-02 11:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(650381, 67708, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is an odd, yet very appealling scene, the black and white tones are good, the composition is very inviting, the snow falling adds to the ''quietness of scene''.  An artsy and well executed shot.</td>', 'This is an odd, yet very appealling scene, the black and white tones are good, the composition is very inviting, the snow falling adds to the ''quietness of scene''.  An artsy and well executed shot.', '2004-04-02 11:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(650382, 65815, 5792, '<td valign="top">I believe I recognize this model. Like all your nudes this is fantastic work. I''m curious about two things: Is this done in the studio? If so it is an amazing job. Did you use Neat Image or some other tool to bring out a smooth appearance to your model''s skin?  The bottom line is that this image has great lighting, it has good color tones, it effectively applies the rule of thirds and you captured a good pose. Kudos to you for one fine image.</td>', 'I believe I recognize this model. Like all your nudes this is fantastic work. I''m curious about two things: Is this done in the studio? If so it is an amazing job. Did you use Neat Image or some other tool to bring out a smooth appearance to your model''s skin?  The bottom line is that this image has great lighting, it has good color tones, it effectively applies the rule of thirds and you captured a good pose. Kudos to you for one fine image.', '2004-04-02 11:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(650383, 64308, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Wonderful tones.</td>', 'Nice shot! Wonderful tones.', '2004-04-02 11:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(650385, 67488, 7969, '<td valign="top">This really looks like one too, well done.  It is a creative idea, i like that the one side is a bit more blurred than the other.</td>', 'This really looks like one too, well done.  It is a creative idea, i like that the one side is a bit more blurred than the other.', '2004-04-02 11:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(650386, 64384, 326, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work!</td>', 'Beautiful work!', '2004-04-02 12:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(650387, 67784, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Normally I would not encourage this, but effect use of TITLE on this shot. :) Makes me feel the wind in my face.</td>', 'Nice image. Normally I would not encourage this, but effect use of TITLE on this shot. :) Makes me feel the wind in my face.', '2004-04-02 12:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(650388, 63536, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot with fabulous light and composition.  Maybe would of cropped a lil more off bottom but can see would of cut off tulip which would be worse.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot with fabulous light and composition.  Maybe would of cropped a lil more off bottom but can see would of cut off tulip which would be worse.', '2004-04-02 12:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(650392, 67032, 326, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I live it!</td>', 'Great shot! I live it!', '2004-04-02 12:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(650393, 64821, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice Black &amp; White! Good job</td>', 'Nice Black & White! Good job', '2004-04-02 12:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(650394, 67781, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. The bright area of the flower surrounded by a darkened background gives image the feeling of a Stephen King novel. Great job.</td>', 'Very interesting composition. The bright area of the flower surrounded by a darkened background gives image the feeling of a Stephen King novel. Great job.', '2004-04-02 12:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
