(650418, 66561, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective. Sure looks like Mexican Poppies to me and could that be greened up desert there in the backgound? You have inspired me. I''ve started a desert wildflower photo gallery and will try to capture a similar perspective to add to my collection.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective. Sure looks like Mexican Poppies to me and could that be greened up desert there in the backgound? You have inspired me. I''ve started a desert wildflower photo gallery and will try to capture a similar perspective to add to my collection.', '2004-04-02 12:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(650422, 67574, 13136, '<td valign="top">This one is freakin'' me out. Outstanding concept, quirkily executed. Looking at it several times before I vote. In the end, I think the brightness of the face is the major down to this. Still good and not taking vote down for photoshopping. This one catches the attention for sure.</td>', 'This one is freakin'' me out. Outstanding concept, quirkily executed. Looking at it several times before I vote. In the end, I think the brightness of the face is the major down to this. Still good and not taking vote down for photoshopping. This one catches the attention for sure.', '2004-04-02 12:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(650423, 64035, 326, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a very pretty place!</td>', 'Wow this is a very pretty place!', '2004-04-02 12:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(650425, 67757, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work. You, unlike most people who use this method, know when and what to desaturate to one color for proper effect. The lighting, shadows, composition and technical quality of this image is outstanding.<br/> <br/>I''ll be really curious to see what you submitted for the out-of-place challenge. :)</td>', 'Wonderful work. You, unlike most people who use this method, know when and what to desaturate to one color for proper effect. The lighting, shadows, composition and technical quality of this image is outstanding. I''ll be really curious to see what you submitted for the out-of-place challenge. :)', '2004-04-02 12:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
