(650445, 67268, 17148, '<td valign="top">Looks very pixalated, don''t know if it''s your camera and you mega pixles or your resizing of the picture for the submission, look into whatever it is and try to work on how to make it better other wise you are going to continue with these less than par pictures, don''t get discouraged though, just take more time in preparing your photo</td>', 'Looks very pixalated, don''t know if it''s your camera and you mega pixles or your resizing of the picture for the submission, look into whatever it is and try to work on how to make it better other wise you are going to continue with these less than par pictures, don''t get discouraged though, just take more time in preparing your photo', '2004-04-02 12:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
