(650510, 66694, 5792, '<td valign="top">What an concept! The expression is great, the perspective is great and the RR trakes for a backgound works adds a great deal of interest to this image. How do you think of stuff like that? Wish you had darken the area to the right of your model just a touch more in post processing. This is fine work!</td>', 'What an concept! The expression is great, the perspective is great and the RR trakes for a backgound works adds a great deal of interest to this image. How do you think of stuff like that? Wish you had darken the area to the right of your model just a touch more in post processing. This is fine work!', '2004-04-02 13:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(650513, 67739, 5822, '<td valign="top">Compositionally I would have preferred if you got closer to the bus and cropped out about an inch off the left side.  I think the bus should be more prominent and it would help to raise the bus''s roof above the level of the distant mountains. I do like the scene and the tones you''ve captured.</td>', 'Compositionally I would have preferred if you got closer to the bus and cropped out about an inch off the left side.  I think the bus should be more prominent and it would help to raise the bus''s roof above the level of the distant mountains. I do like the scene and the tones you''ve captured.', '2004-04-02 13:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
