(650520, 66667, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautifully rich and saturated colors that stand out so well against the black background. Some hot areas, but very small and don''t detract. Well done and good luck.</td>', 'Beautifully rich and saturated colors that stand out so well against the black background. Some hot areas, but very small and don''t detract. Well done and good luck.', '2004-04-02 13:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
