(650525, 67659, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene that must have been quite dark to shoot in. Not sure I like the color balance here...Were the walkway and trees a lavender color in the real scene or was that there color from shooting in the shade? I wish there was a little more detail in the shadowed rock and also would have preferred if the walkway weren''t so centered, although it appears that if you would have been standing in water if you had gotten off the walkway.  Focus appears soft.</td>', 'Beautiful scene that must have been quite dark to shoot in. Not sure I like the color balance here...Were the walkway and trees a lavender color in the real scene or was that there color from shooting in the shade? I wish there was a little more detail in the shadowed rock and also would have preferred if the walkway weren''t so centered, although it appears that if you would have been standing in water if you had gotten off the walkway.  Focus appears soft.', '2004-04-02 13:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(650527, 67510, 16126, '<td valign="top">The edge of the roof of the Van Gogh museum (left) is a bit distracting, and the museum itself seems a bit overexposed. Nice sky.</td>', 'The edge of the roof of the Van Gogh museum (left) is a bit distracting, and the museum itself seems a bit overexposed. Nice sky.', '2004-04-02 13:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(650530, 67796, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the low key tones of this photo, as well as, the captured expression of this ape, but think it could have more impact with a lightening of the eyes and some catch light there.  Still, very well done.</td>', 'I love the low key tones of this photo, as well as, the captured expression of this ape, but think it could have more impact with a lightening of the eyes and some catch light there.  Still, very well done.', '2004-04-02 13:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(650531, 67202, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and you''ve captured  the color and atmospheric perspective especially well.  I would have preferred the cactus in less shadow. Maybe some fill light? Nice job, nonetheless.</td>', 'Beautiful scene and you''ve captured  the color and atmospheric perspective especially well.  I would have preferred the cactus in less shadow. Maybe some fill light? Nice job, nonetheless.', '2004-04-02 13:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(650533, 67488, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What an interesting composition.  I would never have thought to rotate this shot in such a way.  But it really adds a uniqueness to the image.  Very interesting vision.</td>', 'Wow!  What an interesting composition.  I would never have thought to rotate this shot in such a way.  But it really adds a uniqueness to the image.  Very interesting vision.', '2004-04-02 13:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(650535, 65321, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the way yo''uve captured the well saturated and almost iridescent colors of this plant.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the way yo''uve captured the well saturated and almost iridescent colors of this plant.  Nicely done.', '2004-04-02 13:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(650536, 65510, 5728, '<td valign="top">This can only be our friend Mr. JJ! Another quality shot from the man himself :) I gotta say you have an amazing eye, you can see ordinary things and turn them into a wonder. My hat off to you (10)</td>', 'This can only be our friend Mr. JJ! Another quality shot from the man himself :) I gotta say you have an amazing eye, you can see ordinary things and turn them into a wonder. My hat off to you (10)', '2004-04-02 13:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(650539, 67061, 4564, '<td valign="top">Gorgous composition!  One of the best flower shot I have ever seen!  And I admit, I am not too keen on flower shots...  But this one talks to me a lot!  Bravo!  My only negative comment is that I wish there was more visible and in focus texture on the petals from middle to top of the photo, like the texture we see from middle to bottom.  But appart from that nick, just great!  8</td>', 'Gorgous composition!  One of the best flower shot I have ever seen!  And I admit, I am not too keen on flower shots...  But this one talks to me a lot!  Bravo!  My only negative comment is that I wish there was more visible and in focus texture on the petals from middle to top of the photo, like the texture we see from middle to bottom.  But appart from that nick, just great!  8', '2004-04-02 13:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(650541, 66980, 4564, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. Nice capture of the general atmosphere.  Seems to me like an overuse of Neat Image (missing textures on the pillars?).  Nice shot overall and above average. Works for me. 7</td>', 'Lovely composition. Nice capture of the general atmosphere.  Seems to me like an overuse of Neat Image (missing textures on the pillars?).  Nice shot overall and above average. Works for me. 7', '2004-04-02 14:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(650542, 65217, 4564, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous use of textures and colors!  Great use of close-up.  Simple yet effective subject. One of my bests this challenge. 8</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous use of textures and colors!  Great use of close-up.  Simple yet effective subject. One of my bests this challenge. 8', '2004-04-02 14:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(650544, 67768, 4564, '<td valign="top">Very cute (in a positive way!). :-)  I like the b&amp;w.  7</td>', 'Very cute (in a positive way!). :-)  I like the b&w.  7', '2004-04-02 14:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(650546, 65567, 4564, '<td valign="top">Great colors and curves in this shot!  I think the composition works very well.  Excellent shot. 8</td>', 'Great colors and curves in this shot!  I think the composition works very well.  Excellent shot. 8', '2004-04-02 14:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(650547, 64871, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition but I think it could use maybe another 1/3rd of a stop of exposure as I would like to see a bit more of the background valley, which appears to have lost detail in the shadows.</td>', 'Very nice composition but I think it could use maybe another 1/3rd of a stop of exposure as I would like to see a bit more of the background valley, which appears to have lost detail in the shadows.', '2004-04-02 14:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(650548, 67498, 4564, '<td valign="top">This photos is what capturing the moment is all about!  Excellent use of blue around the subject to add movement.  Great story to the photo. 8</td>', 'This photos is what capturing the moment is all about!  Excellent use of blue around the subject to add movement.  Great story to the photo. 8', '2004-04-02 14:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(650549, 67754, 4564, '<td valign="top">The old effect works very well.  Composition is good too.  Missing that little something for me to make it an exceptional shot.  7 never the less.   Good shot!</td>', 'The old effect works very well.  Composition is good too.  Missing that little something for me to make it an exceptional shot.  7 never the less.   Good shot!', '2004-04-02 14:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(650550, 66991, 4564, '<td valign="top">Works like a charm!  Nice angle, nice crop, and of course great capture of the moment! I''m sure you had fun reshooting this one over and over again... LOL! 8</td>', 'Works like a charm!  Nice angle, nice crop, and of course great capture of the moment! I''m sure you had fun reshooting this one over and over again... LOL! 8', '2004-04-02 14:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(650552, 67643, 4564, '<td valign="top">Those eyes... those eyes... must... look... away....    aaaaarrrrrrrr.....    ;-)  great shot! 7</td>', 'Those eyes... those eyes... must... look... away....    aaaaarrrrrrrr.....    ;-)  great shot! 7', '2004-04-02 14:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(650554, 67032, 4564, '<td valign="top">superb bird shot!  Colors are magnificient and the textures are stunning.  8</td>', 'superb bird shot!  Colors are magnificient and the textures are stunning.  8', '2004-04-02 14:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(650555, 67805, 4564, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition.  simple yet effective subject.  Love the lines from the hills.  excellent choice of color to convey emotion of nostalgia.  I feel there is somewhat of a blue on the vehicule, but I beleive it was intentional.  Missing some textuers in the grass for me though.  Overall a geat shot! 7</td>', 'Lovely composition.  simple yet effective subject.  Love the lines from the hills.  excellent choice of color to convey emotion of nostalgia.  I feel there is somewhat of a blue on the vehicule, but I beleive it was intentional.  Missing some textuers in the grass for me though.  Overall a geat shot! 7', '2004-04-02 14:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(650556, 67192, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this high-key photograph but find the dress to have some hot spots that are distracting and need to be toned down. Maybe the lighting was too intense or close to the subject?  I''m very interested to see your exposure settings for this. Also, it seems to be a blue/green color imbalance.</td>', 'I like this high-key photograph but find the dress to have some hot spots that are distracting and need to be toned down. Maybe the lighting was too intense or close to the subject?  I''m very interested to see your exposure settings for this. Also, it seems to be a blue/green color imbalance.', '2004-04-02 14:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(650558, 67792, 5822, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture! I love the different hues of the water and the stop action.  Very well done.</td>', 'Outstanding capture! I love the different hues of the water and the stop action.  Very well done.', '2004-04-02 14:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(650561, 66539, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but wish the entire fencepost in the foreground was entirely in the photo. Also, colors appear weak and need more saturation.  This may be the result of overexposure and correcting that would intensify the colors and also make more prominent the shadows, which are an important part of this image.</td>', 'I like the composition but wish the entire fencepost in the foreground was entirely in the photo. Also, colors appear weak and need more saturation.  This may be the result of overexposure and correcting that would intensify the colors and also make more prominent the shadows, which are an important part of this image.', '2004-04-02 14:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(650566, 65221, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wow, what color and detail !!! Excellent DOF as well. Very very well done.</td>', 'Wow, what color and detail !!! Excellent DOF as well. Very very well done.', '2004-04-02 14:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(650573, 67585, 10867, '<td valign="top">I really like the true white you''ve captured on the lily and the detail on the yellow stamen(?).  Unfortunately, though, I think that the bright area near the top of the image on the left is quite distracting.  You might think about cropping down from the top and in a compensating amount from both sides to eliminate most of the distraction.</td>', 'I really like the true white you''ve captured on the lily and the detail on the yellow stamen(?).  Unfortunately, though, I think that the bright area near the top of the image on the left is quite distracting.  You might think about cropping down from the top and in a compensating amount from both sides to eliminate most of the distraction.', '2004-04-02 14:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(650574, 67481, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though I like the composition, the contrast appears too extreme rusulting in loss of detail in both shadows and hightlights and what looks like posterization.</td>', 'Though I like the composition, the contrast appears too extreme rusulting in loss of detail in both shadows and hightlights and what looks like posterization.', '2004-04-02 14:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(650576, 66615, 10867, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of subject and background, your composition and the bright, glowing colours of the phone.  I find the background just a tiny bit muddy looking.  I think I''d like it to seem a bit sharper.  Still, this is a very effective image in my view!</td>', 'I like your choice of subject and background, your composition and the bright, glowing colours of the phone.  I find the background just a tiny bit muddy looking.  I think I''d like it to seem a bit sharper.  Still, this is a very effective image in my view!', '2004-04-02 14:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(650579, 67248, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition a bit too busy and lighting is somewhat too hot resulting in some blown out hightlights but color is nicely saturated.  Also, focus should be much deeper to include the whole of this salad, and not just the area of the fork and leaf above the fork.</td>', 'Composition a bit too busy and lighting is somewhat too hot resulting in some blown out hightlights but color is nicely saturated.  Also, focus should be much deeper to include the whole of this salad, and not just the area of the fork and leaf above the fork.', '2004-04-02 14:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(650582, 64384, 6405, '<td valign="top">Too much photoshop,not enough photography! Can''t tell what is the subject here! 2</td>', 'Too much photoshop,not enough photography! Can''t tell what is the subject here! 2', '2004-04-02 14:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(650583, 67510, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautifully clear photo that could have had more impact if you moved closer so that the foreground shadows were eliminated.  As it is now, the background building, which is your subject is overexposed and too small in the scene. Moving closer would have solved both of those issues.</td>', 'Beautifully clear photo that could have had more impact if you moved closer so that the foreground shadows were eliminated.  As it is now, the background building, which is your subject is overexposed and too small in the scene. Moving closer would have solved both of those issues.', '2004-04-02 14:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(650584, 66509, 10867, '<td valign="top">Good, sharp detail in this image!  To my eye (or perhaps it''s just my monitor that''s problematic), the sky seems to have a bit of a reddish or magenta cast.  Perhaps it was near sunset when you took the photo, and that would explain the colour.  The image needs just a little bit of rotation to the right to straighten it.</td>', 'Good, sharp detail in this image!  To my eye (or perhaps it''s just my monitor that''s problematic), the sky seems to have a bit of a reddish or magenta cast.  Perhaps it was near sunset when you took the photo, and that would explain the colour.  The image needs just a little bit of rotation to the right to straighten it.', '2004-04-02 14:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(650587, 67364, 10867, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image a lot, but I find the colours perhaps a bit too saturated.  The redness of the trees, given that the sky is so dark seems a bit unnatural to my eye, I''m afraid.  Also, I''m not sure about the effectiveness of the very bright, white area hear the centre (the moon).</td>', 'I like the composition of this image a lot, but I find the colours perhaps a bit too saturated.  The redness of the trees, given that the sky is so dark seems a bit unnatural to my eye, I''m afraid.  Also, I''m not sure about the effectiveness of the very bright, white area hear the centre (the moon).', '2004-04-02 14:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(650589, 65934, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love this composition with the way you''ve capatured the eagle''s profile with the American flag in the background.  I think the white feathers are a bit lacking in detail, but still, very nice job.</td>', 'Love this composition with the way you''ve capatured the eagle''s profile with the American flag in the background.  I think the white feathers are a bit lacking in detail, but still, very nice job.', '2004-04-02 14:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(650590, 67657, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful natural colors,8 !</td>', 'Beautiful natural colors,8 !', '2004-04-02 14:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(650591, 66787, 6405, '<td valign="top">Very sharp shot,you have good lens 8 !</td>', 'Very sharp shot,you have good lens 8 !', '2004-04-02 14:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(650592, 67619, 6405, '<td valign="top">If bridge was little lower I would like it better,7 !</td>', 'If bridge was little lower I would like it better,7 !', '2004-04-02 14:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
