(650594, 66986, 6405, '<td valign="top">Is //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=65700 this the same person?<br/>Well done but I like the other one better!7 !</td>', 'Is //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=65700 this the same person?Well done but I like the other one better!7 !', '2004-04-02 14:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(650596, 65815, 5822, '<td valign="top">I''m in love!<br/>Nice contrast here between the scorched earth and soft supple skin of your beautiful model. Her skin tones are exquisite. I also love the lock of flaming red hair, but wish her left arm wasn''t blcoking most of it.  I like the way her body is positioned and that her head does not rise much abve the horizon, which creates a nice contrast with the distant mountains.</td>', 'I''m in love!Nice contrast here between the scorched earth and soft supple skin of your beautiful model. Her skin tones are exquisite. I also love the lock of flaming red hair, but wish her left arm wasn''t blcoking most of it.  I like the way her body is positioned and that her head does not rise much abve the horizon, which creates a nice contrast with the distant mountains.', '2004-04-02 14:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(650601, 64187, 15129, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit out of focus (perhaps from being too close??--one of my favorite mistakes) and I''d have liked to have seen the fly at one of the "Rule of Thirds" junctions.</td>', 'It seems a bit out of focus (perhaps from being too close??--one of my favorite mistakes) and I''d have liked to have seen the fly at one of the "Rule of Thirds" junctions.', '2004-04-02 14:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
