(650792, 66986, 8860, '<td valign="top">This looks familiar! ;)<br/> <br/>In this case I would say that the sky is oversaturated compared to the lighter reflections of sky in the water. If one masks the sky from view the scene does not have much impact, but it is more natural. A more subtle depth of blue and graduation would have been more sensitive.</td>', 'This looks familiar! ;) In this case I would say that the sky is oversaturated compared to the lighter reflections of sky in the water. If one masks the sky from view the scene does not have much impact, but it is more natural. A more subtle depth of blue and graduation would have been more sensitive.', '2004-04-02 17:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(650793, 66535, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Beautifully clear.</td>', 'Lovely. Beautifully clear.', '2004-04-02 17:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
