(650930, 67521, 9331, '<td valign="top">Since the centre bottle is the one out of line with the others, my eye was instantly drawn to it. But it''s out of focus, which distracts from the photo. Maybe experiment by placing the uncapped bottle in the middle instead and keeping focus on it, while blurring the background more. Good luck with the challenge</td>', 'Since the centre bottle is the one out of line with the others, my eye was instantly drawn to it. But it''s out of focus, which distracts from the photo. Maybe experiment by placing the uncapped bottle in the middle instead and keeping focus on it, while blurring the background more. Good luck with the challenge', '2004-04-02 19:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(650932, 63899, 2170, '<td valign="top">i would almost like to see more noise in this, but it''s a great shot.</td>', 'i would almost like to see more noise in this, but it''s a great shot.', '2004-04-02 19:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
