(650949, 67715, 9331, '<td valign="top">When you take a shot of something that''s been a 1000 times before, you should try and make it your own. As such, there''s nothing much to set this apart, and the clutter of the fences, fire hydrant, car and tourists detract from the shot. Its still a great shot though, but a new look at an old favourite could have added more interest</td>', 'When you take a shot of something that''s been a 1000 times before, you should try and make it your own. As such, there''s nothing much to set this apart, and the clutter of the fences, fire hydrant, car and tourists detract from the shot. Its still a great shot though, but a new look at an old favourite could have added more interest', '2004-04-02 19:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
