(651085, 65325, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though this image appears to have focus problems, I love the grain and subject matter, as well as, the limited contrast range.  The black in the windows is very black and helps to give the picture an eerie feel.  I think a different crop and focal length to zoom in on the owl and capture the texture of the wood would have been even better, but I think this is a really cool picture. 8.</td>', 'Though this image appears to have focus problems, I love the grain and subject matter, as well as, the limited contrast range.  The black in the windows is very black and helps to give the picture an eerie feel.  I think a different crop and focal length to zoom in on the owl and capture the texture of the wood would have been even better, but I think this is a really cool picture. 8.', '2004-04-02 21:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
