(651313, 66661, 19460, '<td valign="top">The water conveys the feeling of serenity and calmness! The beautiful setting on the other side of the water is just beautiful, calling for you to lay down on that green grass, kick back and relax.</td>', 'The water conveys the feeling of serenity and calmness! The beautiful setting on the other side of the water is just beautiful, calling for you to lay down on that green grass, kick back and relax.', '2004-04-03 00:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
