(651329, 67738, 18833, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I thought the image was pretty good. But upon further examination decided that I like the composition as a whole. I think the border really helps this image. It makes the blooms pop a little more and adds a nice edge to diffused background. The dimensions make this seem like a really nice bookmark.</td>', 'At first glance, I thought the image was pretty good. But upon further examination decided that I like the composition as a whole. I think the border really helps this image. It makes the blooms pop a little more and adds a nice edge to diffused background. The dimensions make this seem like a really nice bookmark.', '2004-04-03 01:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(651330, 66961, 19460, '<td valign="top">Such a unique persepctive!  Mesmerizing!</td>', 'Such a unique persepctive!  Mesmerizing!', '2004-04-03 01:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(651331, 64270, 18833, '<td valign="top">I wish all of the frog was in focus.</td>', 'I wish all of the frog was in focus.', '2004-04-03 01:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
