(651368, 67035, 8891, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the effort this takes, people and animals ar beyound me for now. But I think that this image needed a lot of post to get it to this state which, though i Could easily be wrong....It just is not as crisp and natural looking as I would like it to be.</td>', 'I appreciate the effort this takes, people and animals ar beyound me for now. But I think that this image needed a lot of post to get it to this state which, though i Could easily be wrong....It just is not as crisp and natural looking as I would like it to be.', '2004-04-03 01:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(651372, 67794, 8891, '<td valign="top">Having been through this when I was this age (Back in the Punic Wars) I like the photograph and what it represents for youth and arts....It''ll rate higher for the subject matter than the quality with me. The orchestra members are a bit to bright, and the conductrix motion and form are great from the waist up, I just which both her legs were showing.</td>', 'Having been through this when I was this age (Back in the Punic Wars) I like the photograph and what it represents for youth and arts....It''ll rate higher for the subject matter than the quality with me. The orchestra members are a bit to bright, and the conductrix motion and form are great from the waist up, I just which both her legs were showing.', '2004-04-03 01:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(651374, 64262, 8891, '<td valign="top">The moon and the clouds are a bit too blurry for my tastes though I like the reflection very much.</td>', 'The moon and the clouds are a bit too blurry for my tastes though I like the reflection very much.', '2004-04-03 01:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(651375, 64384, 8891, '<td valign="top">My interests lay in the lower half of this image wiithe clouds skirting the finely lit mountains....the source of the lighting and the top half I am not thrilled with but It is damn fine none the less.</td>', 'My interests lay in the lower half of this image wiithe clouds skirting the finely lit mountains....the source of the lighting and the top half I am not thrilled with but It is damn fine none the less.', '2004-04-03 01:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
