(651423, 67447, 17300, '<td valign="top">Hmmm - I think you''ll average scores for this one. I like it, though, because it a great snapshot of a reflection of urban reality.  It''s far from perfect, but I think you are on the right track of capturing something interesting.</td>', 'Hmmm - I think you''ll average scores for this one. I like it, though, because it a great snapshot of a reflection of urban reality.  It''s far from perfect, but I think you are on the right track of capturing something interesting.', '2004-04-03 03:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
