(651427, 67481, 17300, '<td valign="top">That''s one dramatic sky...The only thing I think I would have done differently is to change the direction of the road/two rows. Diagonal from bottom left to the rigth side of the picture....</td>', 'That''s one dramatic sky...The only thing I think I would have done differently is to change the direction of the road/two rows. Diagonal from bottom left to the rigth side of the picture....', '2004-04-03 03:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
