(651430, 67781, 17300, '<td valign="top">Simplistic, but very good.</td>', 'Simplistic, but very good.', '2004-04-03 04:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(651431, 67802, 18833, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. This is a picky comment, but it seems a little tilted to the left. Maybe it is just the way the shadow is cast.</td>', 'Very nice image. This is a picky comment, but it seems a little tilted to the left. Maybe it is just the way the shadow is cast.', '2004-04-03 04:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(651432, 67761, 18833, '<td valign="top">Where are his feet?</td>', 'Where are his feet?', '2004-04-03 04:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(651433, 65815, 17300, '<td valign="top">Nice one. Her skin tones the match the colours of the ground. And if I stretch it a bit I could say that her makeup/eyeshadow picks up the blue the sky... Good perspective as well as a lovely model. Can''t decide if you should crop the sky a little bit and put even more emphasis on the model. 9, bordering on a 10</td>', 'Nice one. Her skin tones the match the colours of the ground. And if I stretch it a bit I could say that her makeup/eyeshadow picks up the blue the sky... Good perspective as well as a lovely model. Can''t decide if you should crop the sky a little bit and put even more emphasis on the model. 9, bordering on a 10', '2004-04-03 04:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(651436, 63536, 18833, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of the tulips but I think you should have a diiferent background color. The greens look ok with it, a little yellow, but the purples are dulled. I think more of a blue light would help as well.</td>', 'I love the composition of the tulips but I think you should have a diiferent background color. The greens look ok with it, a little yellow, but the purples are dulled. I think more of a blue light would help as well.', '2004-04-03 04:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(651437, 66505, 13602, '<td valign="top">this is such a beautiful diagonal lines shot, too bad that its too much light in the bottom right corner it would of been perfect without it. I''m not one of those obsessing with the word "overexposed" but it''s too distracting. Verry well seen otherways.</td>', 'this is such a beautiful diagonal lines shot, too bad that its too much light in the bottom right corner it would of been perfect without it. I''m not one of those obsessing with the word "overexposed" but it''s too distracting. Verry well seen otherways.', '2004-04-03 04:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(651438, 63735, 17300, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Colours are great. <br/>Comment # 2 :Gave it an 8, but looking at i again, II bumped it up to 9.<br/>Comment # 3: OK, a 10, then...</td>', 'Very nice. Colours are great. Comment # 2 :Gave it an 8, but looking at i again, II bumped it up to 9.Comment # 3: OK, a 10, then...', '2004-04-03 04:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(651441, 67767, 13602, '<td valign="top">Superbe portrait, too bad you didn''t put this in the portrait challenge it would been 100% a ribbon. Anyways good luck here too.</td>', 'Superbe portrait, too bad you didn''t put this in the portrait challenge it would been 100% a ribbon. Anyways good luck here too.', '2004-04-03 04:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(651459, 67806, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and DOF is right on. I just think you''ve lost a bit too much detail in the birds belly side which could have benefited from a bit more exposure. Still, a good photo.</td>', 'Beautiful color and DOF is right on. I just think you''ve lost a bit too much detail in the birds belly side which could have benefited from a bit more exposure. Still, a good photo.', '2004-04-03 05:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(651460, 64552, 5822, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture with very dramatic lighting.  You also get a feeling of the grand scale of things here. Well done.</td>', 'Stunning capture with very dramatic lighting.  You also get a feeling of the grand scale of things here. Well done.', '2004-04-03 05:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(651462, 66800, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though quiet a busy picture I''m glad you decided to shoot it with a deep DOF as this market is very interesting.  Colors and tones are equisite and rich and I like the way the image is composed, as you can see clearly the 4 major people in the photo, as noe of them have been blocked out by the main subject.  Only neg I can see is that you cut off the load on the top of her head. A very interesting Nat''l Geo type picture. Well done.</td>', 'Though quiet a busy picture I''m glad you decided to shoot it with a deep DOF as this market is very interesting.  Colors and tones are equisite and rich and I like the way the image is composed, as you can see clearly the 4 major people in the photo, as noe of them have been blocked out by the main subject.  Only neg I can see is that you cut off the load on the top of her head. A very interesting Nat''l Geo type picture. Well done.', '2004-04-03 05:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(651463, 67061, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and texture.</td>', 'Beautiful color and texture.', '2004-04-03 05:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(651465, 65638, 5822, '<td valign="top">I Like the way you''ve captured the waterfall with the long exposure, but the major patch of blown out water is quite distracting. Maybe a bit less exposure would have taken care of that problem?</td>', 'I Like the way you''ve captured the waterfall with the long exposure, but the major patch of blown out water is quite distracting. Maybe a bit less exposure would have taken care of that problem?', '2004-04-03 05:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(651466, 67791, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors but I think this image could have benefited from a bit less exposure as you have a large patch of blown out sky in the lower left and the trees could have benefited in being more silhouetted.</td>', 'Beautiful colors but I think this image could have benefited from a bit less exposure as you have a large patch of blown out sky in the lower left and the trees could have benefited in being more silhouetted.', '2004-04-03 05:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(651468, 63365, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very difficult lighting conditions. Judging by your title it would appear the clown on the stand is your subject, but it''s hard to tell what to really look at in this picture as it''s too busy and there are other distracting elements within the scene. In addition, your subject is blurred which further confuses the issue. I think it could have been improved by focusing on your subject and blurring the background some to help isolate your subject and also metering on the portion of the image in shadow to help narrow your range of contrast.</td>', 'Very difficult lighting conditions. Judging by your title it would appear the clown on the stand is your subject, but it''s hard to tell what to really look at in this picture as it''s too busy and there are other distracting elements within the scene. In addition, your subject is blurred which further confuses the issue. I think it could have been improved by focusing on your subject and blurring the background some to help isolate your subject and also metering on the portion of the image in shadow to help narrow your range of contrast.', '2004-04-03 05:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(651471, 65374, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich and saturated color but I think the lighting is a bit strong as the yellow flower is almost to the point of some hot spots.  Still, the color is equisite and I like the image.</td>', 'Beautiful rich and saturated color but I think the lighting is a bit strong as the yellow flower is almost to the point of some hot spots.  Still, the color is equisite and I like the image.', '2004-04-03 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(651472, 63735, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity and lighting really makes this photo for me.  The path and center building are a bit too centered but still a remarkable image. Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful clarity and lighting really makes this photo for me.  The path and center building are a bit too centered but still a remarkable image. Well done.', '2004-04-03 06:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(651474, 67621, 5822, '<td valign="top">Spectacular image with very dramatic lighting.  Composition is also very well done as I like the perspective here and the way your eye is led from the foreground stones to the tuft of golden grass and then on to the lighthouse.  Richly colored sky as well...done with a polarizer? My only nitpick would be that the horizon line is too centered. Picture perfect post card image. Very well done.</td>', 'Spectacular image with very dramatic lighting.  Composition is also very well done as I like the perspective here and the way your eye is led from the foreground stones to the tuft of golden grass and then on to the lighthouse.  Richly colored sky as well...done with a polarizer? My only nitpick would be that the horizon line is too centered. Picture perfect post card image. Very well done.', '2004-04-03 06:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(651475, 64035, 5822, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning and very dramatic image with the way you''ve captured the lighting and the blowing snow/mist.  I like the way you included the trees at the bottom to give a sense of scale and the image is also very well balanced compositionally.  I love it...very welll done. Bravo.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning and very dramatic image with the way you''ve captured the lighting and the blowing snow/mist.  I like the way you included the trees at the bottom to give a sense of scale and the image is also very well balanced compositionally.  I love it...very welll done. Bravo.', '2004-04-03 06:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(651476, 66635, 5822, '<td valign="top">The colors are good and I like the haunted and eerie feel to this image, as well as, the silhouetted tree in the background and the way it helps to frame the flowers.  I do however think the lighting is too strong on the top most flower and the top of the tree is lit up with detail and disrupts the silhouette effect.  Still, a very compelling and artistic expressive photo. Well done.</td>', 'The colors are good and I like the haunted and eerie feel to this image, as well as, the silhouetted tree in the background and the way it helps to frame the flowers.  I do however think the lighting is too strong on the top most flower and the top of the tree is lit up with detail and disrupts the silhouette effect.  Still, a very compelling and artistic expressive photo. Well done.', '2004-04-03 06:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(651477, 67035, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lighting is quite harsh and it looks a bit overexposed to me with some small hot spots. Also the image appears to suffer from soft focus (subject movement?) and too narrow DOF.  I think a bit less exposure with a smaller aperature could have benefited the image. Would be very curious to see your exposure settings.</td>', 'Lighting is quite harsh and it looks a bit overexposed to me with some small hot spots. Also the image appears to suffer from soft focus (subject movement?) and too narrow DOF.  I think a bit less exposure with a smaller aperature could have benefited the image. Would be very curious to see your exposure settings.', '2004-04-03 06:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(651478, 66014, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the starkness of this scene set against a detailless sky.</td>', 'I love the starkness of this scene set against a detailless sky.', '2004-04-03 06:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(651479, 67312, 5822, '<td valign="top">Almost my pic exactly without the rose (see my parrallel lines submission "Flamenco).  Not sure I like the square format for this subject but I do like the lighting (much better than mine) as well as the color.  Overall, I think an improvement compared to my submission.</td>', 'Almost my pic exactly without the rose (see my parrallel lines submission "Flamenco).  Not sure I like the square format for this subject but I do like the lighting (much better than mine) as well as the color.  Overall, I think an improvement compared to my submission.', '2004-04-03 06:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(651480, 66886, 5822, '<td valign="top">This image has such a painterly feel to it that I almost think it''s a photograph of a painting or you applied a filter in PS.  Did you?  I like the color and the perspective showing all the windows of the gallery.</td>', 'This image has such a painterly feel to it that I almost think it''s a photograph of a painting or you applied a filter in PS.  Did you?  I like the color and the perspective showing all the windows of the gallery.', '2004-04-03 06:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(651515, 67541, 6630, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I want milk....if it tastes like a martini!!! I like it.</td>', 'Yeah, I want milk....if it tastes like a martini!!! I like it.', '2004-04-03 08:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
