(651546, 67480, 14620, '<td valign="top">This shot is so crisp.  Nice symmetry and use of light.  Very interesting subject.  Can''t tell if you''re looking up or down.  Interesting perspective.</td>', 'This shot is so crisp.  Nice symmetry and use of light.  Very interesting subject.  Can''t tell if you''re looking up or down.  Interesting perspective.', '2004-04-03 09:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(651549, 65352, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF.  I love the colors and contrast here.  Very pleasing.</td>', 'Very nice DOF.  I love the colors and contrast here.  Very pleasing.', '2004-04-03 09:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(651555, 66874, 14620, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting.  Very nice color, contrast and detail.</td>', 'Excellent lighting.  Very nice color, contrast and detail.', '2004-04-03 09:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(651560, 67373, 7908, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this. But, the horizon is really tilted.</td>', 'I like the feel of this. But, the horizon is really tilted.', '2004-04-03 09:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(651580, 64308, 10402, '<td valign="top">I love this. So simple--just a boot in a stirrup, but at the same time so complex--lots of shapes, forms, and above all textures. Monochrome was a good choice; colors would be distracting. And the sepia color is great.</td>', 'I love this. So simple--just a boot in a stirrup, but at the same time so complex--lots of shapes, forms, and above all textures. Monochrome was a good choice; colors would be distracting. And the sepia color is great.', '2004-04-03 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(651584, 64270, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Everything in the image leads the viewer''s eye to the frog''s face: the lines of the frog itself, the shallow DOF, and the leaf on the right that acts as a frame.</td>', 'Great composition. Everything in the image leads the viewer''s eye to the frog''s face: the lines of the frog itself, the shallow DOF, and the leaf on the right that acts as a frame.', '2004-04-03 10:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(651589, 66553, 342, '<td valign="top">IMO, I might have cropped this a little differntly with less or no sky and more window,  but that is one person''s opinion.</td>', 'IMO, I might have cropped this a little differntly with less or no sky and more window,  but that is one person''s opinion.', '2004-04-03 11:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(651590, 67738, 6008, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant red of the ''flowers'' with good overall colors throughout. Nice background, great use of DOF, good composition, and nicely sharp. I dont see much there that I would change.</td>', 'Nice vibrant red of the ''flowers'' with good overall colors throughout. Nice background, great use of DOF, good composition, and nicely sharp. I dont see much there that I would change.', '2004-04-03 11:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(651594, 67441, 10402, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tonal range in a beautiful image. The lightest areas may be slightly burned out, but not distractingly so.</td>', 'Wonderful tonal range in a beautiful image. The lightest areas may be slightly burned out, but not distractingly so.', '2004-04-03 11:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(651595, 67565, 6008, '<td valign="top">The sky seems a little over processed, which brings down the quality a little. I can see you were trying to make the clouds more storm-like, but the white areas look overexposed and are the first things you notice when looking at the image, as the eyes are usually drawn to the lightest area of an image first. The processing has also affected the trees and given them ''halos'' around the branches. The color of the grass is good and green. The placement of the truck is good.</td>', 'The sky seems a little over processed, which brings down the quality a little. I can see you were trying to make the clouds more storm-like, but the white areas look overexposed and are the first things you notice when looking at the image, as the eyes are usually drawn to the lightest area of an image first. The processing has also affected the trees and given them ''halos'' around the branches. The color of the grass is good and green. The placement of the truck is good.', '2004-04-03 11:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(651598, 66787, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good composition and nice textures and colors. A bit of distracting glare on his comb.</td>', 'Good composition and nice textures and colors. A bit of distracting glare on his comb.', '2004-04-03 11:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(651599, 66014, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the toning and the mood presented. The minimalism of a tree and a bench is good and the toning compliments it. At first the angle of the bench was a little odd to me, but the more I look at it the more I like it. The one thing that does stand out to me is the white ''blob'' in the lower right and the curb. Cloning that out to be a continuation of the grass would have probably given it a more uniform and continuous feel and not so much of a distraction.</td>', 'I like the toning and the mood presented. The minimalism of a tree and a bench is good and the toning compliments it. At first the angle of the bench was a little odd to me, but the more I look at it the more I like it. The one thing that does stand out to me is the white ''blob'' in the lower right and the curb. Cloning that out to be a continuation of the grass would have probably given it a more uniform and continuous feel and not so much of a distraction.', '2004-04-03 11:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(651601, 67673, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great lighting; the shadows are as interesting as the spines themselves.</td>', 'Great lighting; the shadows are as interesting as the spines themselves.', '2004-04-03 11:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(651603, 67767, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like how you have filled the frame with her face, which is very fresh and pretty. Her eyes are nicely sharp and have a good light, the skin tones are good with just a little flush of red. Very nicely captured.</td>', 'I like how you have filled the frame with her face, which is very fresh and pretty. Her eyes are nicely sharp and have a good light, the skin tones are good with just a little flush of red. Very nicely captured.', '2004-04-03 11:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(651607, 63735, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice shot; the wood looks great. my only criticism is the white lights are harsh and digital<br/></td>', 'nice shot; the wood looks great. my only criticism is the white lights are harsh and digital', '2004-04-03 11:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(651609, 67244, 12611, '<td valign="top">a little too purple tinged for me. the composition is pretty good - but your eyes tend to go away from the focal point of the skylight, and then there is just dizziness and nausea,</td>', 'a little too purple tinged for me. the composition is pretty good - but your eyes tend to go away from the focal point of the skylight, and then there is just dizziness and nausea,', '2004-04-03 11:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(651619, 66535, 10402, '<td valign="top">Outstanding detail and a nice background.</td>', 'Outstanding detail and a nice background.', '2004-04-03 11:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(651624, 64384, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, though just a bit dark.</td>', 'Very dramatic, though just a bit dark.', '2004-04-03 11:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(651626, 67527, 10402, '<td valign="top">Cute pose and nice color. I think a vertical format would have worked better. And I don''t really care for the thick border.</td>', 'Cute pose and nice color. I think a vertical format would have worked better. And I don''t really care for the thick border.', '2004-04-03 11:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(651638, 67385, 2125, '<td valign="top">i just want to swim out and climb that ladder and stand there soaking in the sunset! nice capture, composition and mood love the birds taking in the sunset  9</td>', 'i just want to swim out and climb that ladder and stand there soaking in the sunset! nice capture, composition and mood love the birds taking in the sunset  9', '2004-04-03 12:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(651639, 66167, 2125, '<td valign="top">i like this the dof is great and the composition seems a bit ''mid-day ish'' so not crazy about the lighting but 9 none the less...</td>', 'i like this the dof is great and the composition seems a bit ''mid-day ish'' so not crazy about the lighting but 9 none the less...', '2004-04-03 12:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
