(651644, 66157, 2125, '<td valign="top">clean and simple like the stairs going up and the composition  is it a bit mid dayish? maybe dusk or dawn would make this have more of an impact 8</td>', 'clean and simple like the stairs going up and the composition  is it a bit mid dayish? maybe dusk or dawn would make this have more of an impact 8', '2004-04-03 12:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
