(651678, 67516, 19177, '<td valign="top">How cute, this is the first photo I have seen of little baby bunnies.... very enjoyable</td>', 'How cute, this is the first photo I have seen of little baby bunnies.... very enjoyable', '2004-04-03 12:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(651680, 67658, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space. The "fish-eyed" building and fence is a great frame of reference for the viewer, and accentuates the biker''s feat. The peaceful sunset colors are beautiful, but aren''t really consistent with the action of the photo, so I think the overall impact would be greater with a black and white image.</td>', 'Great use of negative space. The "fish-eyed" building and fence is a great frame of reference for the viewer, and accentuates the biker''s feat. The peaceful sunset colors are beautiful, but aren''t really consistent with the action of the photo, so I think the overall impact would be greater with a black and white image.', '2004-04-03 12:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(651684, 66986, 19177, '<td valign="top">beautiful<br/></td>', 'beautiful', '2004-04-03 12:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(651689, 67781, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like how the daffodil pops out of the image with the light highlighting the flower and the background not being completely black. The toning and texture of the tree is great too. I like this!</td>', 'I like how the daffodil pops out of the image with the light highlighting the flower and the background not being completely black. The toning and texture of the tree is great too. I like this!', '2004-04-03 12:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(651691, 67409, 10402, '<td valign="top">My 9-year-old daughter just passed by and said "Cute duck!". I concur. Great composition, good focus, nice color, overall a pleasing image. A bit overexposed, so unfortunately some detail is lost.</td>', 'My 9-year-old daughter just passed by and said "Cute duck!". I concur. Great composition, good focus, nice color, overall a pleasing image. A bit overexposed, so unfortunately some detail is lost.', '2004-04-03 12:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(651692, 67258, 18191, '<td valign="top">I really likes this, although for some reason I would have liked to see longer shadow on the bench.</td>', 'I really likes this, although for some reason I would have liked to see longer shadow on the bench.', '2004-04-03 12:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(651693, 63194, 18191, '<td valign="top">A little too overdone (the idea that is) but still a good shot...Could have been over exposed a little bit more.</td>', 'A little too overdone (the idea that is) but still a good shot...Could have been over exposed a little bit more.', '2004-04-03 12:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(651696, 67521, 18191, '<td valign="top">I do not like the choice of DOF. You stil could have focused ont he from one and left the left with the top off.</td>', 'I do not like the choice of DOF. You stil could have focused ont he from one and left the left with the top off.', '2004-04-03 12:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(651697, 67678, 6008, '<td valign="top">Just to make sure I''m seeing this correctly - it''s a bottle upside down on the ground with a sunset in the background and the image flipped so it looks like the bottle is hanging there. Oooooooooook. A very odd image, and I''m wondering if there is a message that I''m not seeing or just trying to be different. I like the gradient and colors in the sunset, the silhoueted ''ground'' is not overbearing, the bottle is just weird. It''s not a bad picture, it makes me stop and think, but I just dont come to many conclusions.</td>', 'Just to make sure I''m seeing this correctly - it''s a bottle upside down on the ground with a sunset in the background and the image flipped so it looks like the bottle is hanging there. Oooooooooook. A very odd image, and I''m wondering if there is a message that I''m not seeing or just trying to be different. I like the gradient and colors in the sunset, the silhoueted ''ground'' is not overbearing, the bottle is just weird. It''s not a bad picture, it makes me stop and think, but I just dont come to many conclusions.', '2004-04-03 12:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(651699, 64157, 18191, '<td valign="top">What a great shot. I didnt get it at first but it is a really good concept. It looks a little pixelated though. 7.</td>', 'What a great shot. I didnt get it at first but it is a really good concept. It looks a little pixelated though. 7.', '2004-04-03 12:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(651702, 65646, 18191, '<td valign="top">I dont get the selective desaturation/.</td>', 'I dont get the selective desaturation/.', '2004-04-03 12:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(651713, 65321, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great colors and shapes, but this seems rather flat. Although the petals are obviously curved, a more specular and directional light source would show off the nice forms better.</td>', 'Great colors and shapes, but this seems rather flat. Although the petals are obviously curved, a more specular and directional light source would show off the nice forms better.', '2004-04-03 12:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(651730, 65934, 10402, '<td valign="top">A great idea that is well executed. Focus is great and acceptably sharp, although I personally would prefer it slightly sharper.</td>', 'A great idea that is well executed. Focus is great and acceptably sharp, although I personally would prefer it slightly sharper.', '2004-04-03 13:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(651731, 67768, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and DOF but the composition leaves something to be desired.  Your subject is too centered. Also the image could use some brighening..</td>', 'I like the tones and DOF but the composition leaves something to be desired.  Your subject is too centered. Also the image could use some brighening..', '2004-04-03 13:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(651734, 63159, 2223, '<td valign="top">Strange perspective, the dog does look happy.</td>', 'Strange perspective, the dog does look happy.', '2004-04-03 13:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(651735, 65705, 19201, '<td valign="top">Wow, that photo makes me think of a million different things at once. Bold use of shadow.</td>', 'Wow, that photo makes me think of a million different things at once. Bold use of shadow.', '2004-04-03 13:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(651737, 65352, 2223, '<td valign="top">nice depth! colors are bright and beautiful.</td>', 'nice depth! colors are bright and beautiful.', '2004-04-03 13:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(651739, 67798, 2223, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHAHA!! How adorable!</td>', 'HAHAHAHAHA!! How adorable!', '2004-04-03 13:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(651743, 67673, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting patterned image, but just wish the lighting was more even throughout entire photo and your DOF was deeper as well.</td>', 'Interesting patterned image, but just wish the lighting was more even throughout entire photo and your DOF was deeper as well.', '2004-04-03 13:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(651747, 64040, 2223, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, natural?</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, natural?', '2004-04-03 13:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(651749, 67268, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very compelling subject matter and your composition is very good, but the image suffers from bad pixelation and being out of focus.  It also appears overexposed as there are some hot spots in some areas.</td>', 'Very compelling subject matter and your composition is very good, but the image suffers from bad pixelation and being out of focus.  It also appears overexposed as there are some hot spots in some areas.', '2004-04-03 13:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(651773, 67313, 19489, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tone, texture and clean composition.</td>', 'Beautiful tone, texture and clean composition.', '2004-04-03 13:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(651787, 66661, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections in the water</td>', 'I like the reflections in the water', '2004-04-03 13:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(651789, 64384, 2223, '<td valign="top">Stunning image! 10</td>', 'Stunning image! 10', '2004-04-03 13:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(651791, 67745, 14593, '<td valign="top">I wish this photo were sharper.....looks like digital zoom....good compositon and exposure</td>', 'I wish this photo were sharper.....looks like digital zoom....good compositon and exposure', '2004-04-03 13:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(651794, 66913, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice close-up work.....great detail on the insect.....I wish had been photographed on a different background without so much texture and detail of it''s own....I find the background takes away from the impact of the insect</td>', 'nice close-up work.....great detail on the insect.....I wish had been photographed on a different background without so much texture and detail of it''s own....I find the background takes away from the impact of the insect', '2004-04-03 13:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(651795, 67778, 14593, '<td valign="top">pretty colors on the trees....</td>', 'pretty colors on the trees....', '2004-04-03 13:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(651800, 64436, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting behind the flower......a little over-exposed with the bright light from behind in the one area....a little too dark around the rest of the flower....I like the general idea, but feel a more even exposure would have helped this photograph more.....yet, I like the idea and concept very much!</td>', 'interesting lighting behind the flower......a little over-exposed with the bright light from behind in the one area....a little too dark around the rest of the flower....I like the general idea, but feel a more even exposure would have helped this photograph more.....yet, I like the idea and concept very much!', '2004-04-03 13:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(651802, 67790, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice capture...great subjects</td>', 'nice capture...great subjects', '2004-04-03 13:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(651805, 66038, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice photo.....love the beautiful blue sky!</td>', 'nice photo.....love the beautiful blue sky!', '2004-04-03 13:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(651807, 67516, 14593, '<td valign="top">oh....it is that time of year again!   Nice detail here....great colors....I like the composition too....</td>', 'oh....it is that time of year again!   Nice detail here....great colors....I like the composition too....', '2004-04-03 13:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(651811, 66806, 14593, '<td valign="top">This could easily be my favorite coastline too!  very pretty...I like the colors and the fine details.....</td>', 'This could easily be my favorite coastline too!  very pretty...I like the colors and the fine details.....', '2004-04-03 13:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(651813, 67452, 14593, '<td valign="top">wow....what a beautiful sky and rainbow!   love the way the tree is lit up too from the sun...</td>', 'wow....what a beautiful sky and rainbow!   love the way the tree is lit up too from the sun...', '2004-04-03 13:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(651814, 64384, 4482, '<td valign="top">I may give quite a few 9s but I always only give one 10. And you''re my winner this time! Great B&amp;W. I can see to postprocessing, lots of dodging &amp; buring here and it all fits in nicely. It''s dramatic and well balanced.  This will go in my favs! Keep on inpiring!</td>', 'I may give quite a few 9s but I always only give one 10. And you''re my winner this time! Great B&W. I can see to postprocessing, lots of dodging & buring here and it all fits in nicely. It''s dramatic and well balanced.  This will go in my favs! Keep on inpiring!', '2004-04-03 13:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(651822, 67796, 4482, '<td valign="top">Yes, this shot is just wonderful. The choice of B&amp;W gives it more drama. He seems wise and thoughtful. Great capture indeed! Personally, I would like to see deeper contrasts but that''s just personal taste. ;-)  9</td>', 'Yes, this shot is just wonderful. The choice of B&W gives it more drama. He seems wise and thoughtful. Great capture indeed! Personally, I would like to see deeper contrasts but that''s just personal taste. ;-)  9', '2004-04-03 13:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(651825, 67196, 4482, '<td valign="top">Fantabulous night shot! I love the slight color saturation. Warm and cool at the same time. I wouldn''t change a thing in the composition either. I''m glad you kept all of the water reflections. 9</td>', 'Fantabulous night shot! I love the slight color saturation. Warm and cool at the same time. I wouldn''t change a thing in the composition either. I''m glad you kept all of the water reflections. 9', '2004-04-03 14:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(651829, 66917, 4482, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture  and NI was perfectly used. NO hotspots and the contrasts are spot on! good one! 9</td>', 'This is a great capture  and NI was perfectly used. NO hotspots and the contrasts are spot on! good one! 9', '2004-04-03 14:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(651833, 67658, 4482, '<td valign="top">Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee! Nice use of wide angle here! I wish I had a lens like that! ;-)  I''m glad you kept part of the groud to give this more persective. Color saturation wasn''t overdone. Just a beautiful shot! The crop might be just a little tight for me but that''s personal not technical. :-)  9</td>', 'Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee! Nice use of wide angle here! I wish I had a lens like that! ;-)  I''m glad you kept part of the groud to give this more persective. Color saturation wasn''t overdone. Just a beautiful shot! The crop might be just a little tight for me but that''s personal not technical. :-)  9', '2004-04-03 14:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(651837, 65815, 15751, '<td valign="top">haha, this is HOT, and a very good picture too</td>', 'haha, this is HOT, and a very good picture too', '2004-04-03 14:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(651838, 67643, 4482, '<td valign="top">I could see this in an NG magazine any day! Just a perfect portrait shot. Color saturation and contrasts are perfect. I wouldn''t change a thing with the composition either. I love his expresion. Would this be Manuel??? 9</td>', 'I could see this in an NG magazine any day! Just a perfect portrait shot. Color saturation and contrasts are perfect. I wouldn''t change a thing with the composition either. I love his expresion. Would this be Manuel??? 9', '2004-04-03 14:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(651839, 65954, 15751, '<td valign="top">GO Georgia Tech Yellow Jackets!! final four game tonight!..</td>', 'GO Georgia Tech Yellow Jackets!! final four game tonight!..', '2004-04-03 14:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(651840, 66098, 5822, '<td valign="top">This could be a very beautiful photograph, but I feel it''s contrast range was set too high. The colors are deeply saturated but maybe too much so.</td>', 'This could be a very beautiful photograph, but I feel it''s contrast range was set too high. The colors are deeply saturated but maybe too much so.', '2004-04-03 14:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(651841, 67801, 4482, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''ve been looking at this shot for a while now. I just love the composition and its simplicity. The angle chosen is original. I would have brightened it just slightly but then angain evey monitor sees it differently. :-P a fat 8 from me.</td>', 'Ok, I''ve been looking at this shot for a while now. I just love the composition and its simplicity. The angle chosen is original. I would have brightened it just slightly but then angain evey monitor sees it differently. :-P a fat 8 from me.', '2004-04-03 14:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(651844, 67311, 15751, '<td valign="top">oo...would''ve been a good submission for the road signs challenge</td>', 'oo...would''ve been a good submission for the road signs challenge', '2004-04-03 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(651847, 66535, 4482, '<td valign="top">OK you guys with your SLRs and zoom lenses are making me more and more jealous!!!  ;-)  Exellent composition and sharpness. The eye color makes the shot jumt from a 7 to a 9 in my book. Goos one!!!</td>', 'OK you guys with your SLRs and zoom lenses are making me more and more jealous!!!  ;-)  Exellent composition and sharpness. The eye color makes the shot jumt from a 7 to a 9 in my book. Goos one!!!', '2004-04-03 14:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(651849, 64035, 4482, '<td valign="top">Mystic... love it! Is that my cottage that I see there?? I wish! The contrasts are spot on and I''m glad you didn''t over saturate the blue. Great composition! 9</td>', 'Mystic... love it! Is that my cottage that I see there?? I wish! The contrasts are spot on and I''m glad you didn''t over saturate the blue. Great composition! 9', '2004-04-03 14:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(651850, 65221, 15751, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful bird! excellent job of capturing the texture, i only wish this picture had a little more personality and the lighting wasnt so flat.</td>', 'what a beautiful bird! excellent job of capturing the texture, i only wish this picture had a little more personality and the lighting wasnt so flat.', '2004-04-03 14:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(651853, 65355, 4482, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see where this was taken! Simple.. yes. But works for me! One of my tops! Great composition. 9</td>', 'I can''t wait to see where this was taken! Simple.. yes. But works for me! One of my tops! Great composition. 9', '2004-04-03 14:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(651855, 67637, 4482, '<td valign="top">My top flower shot of the challenge! Was it Gaussian blur used?? Or diffuse glow?? Anyways! Superbe composition and contrasts. The only thing I would change is the frame color as I find it distracting. 9</td>', 'My top flower shot of the challenge! Was it Gaussian blur used?? Or diffuse glow?? Anyways! Superbe composition and contrasts. The only thing I would change is the frame color as I find it distracting. 9', '2004-04-03 14:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(651857, 64731, 4482, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this shot a 9 and I still don''t know why!! Just a general love for the shot I guess. Maybe because it does bring up many questions.... it seems to have a story to tell. These shots inspire me!</td>', 'I''m giving this shot a 9 and I still don''t know why!! Just a general love for the shot I guess. Maybe because it does bring up many questions.... it seems to have a story to tell. These shots inspire me!', '2004-04-03 14:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(651861, 67708, 5822, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful photograph with wonderful stark tonal contrasts.  The photo has a Stieglitz feel to it. I love it, it speaks to me! 10</td>', 'A very beautiful photograph with wonderful stark tonal contrasts.  The photo has a Stieglitz feel to it. I love it, it speaks to me! 10', '2004-04-03 14:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(651863, 67703, 15920, '<td valign="top">I think this is a wonderful shot.  The only things that might make it better are a little sharper focus on the body feathers and a little detail just above the beak.  The blurred background is simply perfect. -9</td>', 'I think this is a wonderful shot.  The only things that might make it better are a little sharper focus on the body feathers and a little detail just above the beak.  The blurred background is simply perfect. -9', '2004-04-03 14:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(651871, 65815, 15920, '<td valign="top">Everyone else will love this, so take this for what this is worth: her face looks so perfect that it is almost fake looking (not a single line.)  A little more texture on the cracked desert floor would also have helped.  Other than that, this is tremendous, and the composition is perfect. -8</td>', 'Everyone else will love this, so take this for what this is worth: her face looks so perfect that it is almost fake looking (not a single line.)  A little more texture on the cracked desert floor would also have helped.  Other than that, this is tremendous, and the composition is perfect. -8', '2004-04-03 14:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(651879, 64035, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-04-03 14:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(651881, 67126, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the composition you''ve got going here.  The benches lead the viever right into the image.  One thing with fog is it plays tricks on your camera''s meter.  It appears that the image is a little under exposed.</td>', 'I like the composition you''ve got going here.  The benches lead the viever right into the image.  One thing with fog is it plays tricks on your camera''s meter.  It appears that the image is a little under exposed.', '2004-04-03 14:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(651883, 63742, 18191, '<td valign="top">Of the ones that I saw you added to your portfolio (hehehe_)...this was my favorite..more than the touched by light one...good choice! 7.</td>', 'Of the ones that I saw you added to your portfolio (hehehe_)...this was my favorite..more than the touched by light one...good choice! 7.', '2004-04-03 14:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(651884, 67658, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice stopping of motion.</td>', 'Nice stopping of motion.', '2004-04-03 14:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(651885, 67723, 18191, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot that makes you step back and reflect on things.</td>', 'A really nice shot that makes you step back and reflect on things.', '2004-04-03 14:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(651886, 67603, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very cool macro with interesting intricate details.</td>', 'Very cool macro with interesting intricate details.', '2004-04-03 14:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(651889, 67083, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, and at first i really liked the idea, but the more i thought about it, the less it made sense to me. Still a 7 cause i am not going to spend any more timel ooking at it.</td>', 'I like the shot, and at first i really liked the idea, but the more i thought about it, the less it made sense to me. Still a 7 cause i am not going to spend any more timel ooking at it.', '2004-04-03 14:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(651891, 67649, 18191, '<td valign="top">Ahhh....Very nice shot. I cant give you anything higher than a seven though for in the free study challenge, originality is key and ihave seen this too many times before.</td>', 'Ahhh....Very nice shot. I cant give you anything higher than a seven though for in the free study challenge, originality is key and ihave seen this too many times before.', '2004-04-03 14:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(651892, 67415, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very interesting! 7. Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Very interesting! 7. Nice use of negative space.', '2004-04-03 14:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(651894, 67650, 18191, '<td valign="top">Dont quite understand it so much, but still a very unique and cool shot. 7.</td>', 'Dont quite understand it so much, but still a very unique and cool shot. 7.', '2004-04-03 14:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(651895, 63735, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good location find.</td>', 'Good location find.', '2004-04-03 14:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(651897, 67454, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the eyes seem out of focus and to me they are the focus of the shot.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the eyes seem out of focus and to me they are the focus of the shot.', '2004-04-03 14:48:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(651898, 66553, 12253, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea--it could perhaps be improved by a slight perspective adjustment, some added contrast, and maybe adjusting the light for a less washed-out  sky (especially bottom right)</td>', 'An interesting idea--it could perhaps be improved by a slight perspective adjustment, some added contrast, and maybe adjusting the light for a less washed-out  sky (especially bottom right)', '2004-04-03 14:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(651899, 64948, 18191, '<td valign="top">I find the leaf distracting and unnecessary.</td>', 'I find the leaf distracting and unnecessary.', '2004-04-03 14:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(651902, 63735, 7743, '<td valign="top">Wonderful leading lines, clouds and boardwalk.  The exposure is just right.   Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful leading lines, clouds and boardwalk.  The exposure is just right.   Well done.', '2004-04-03 14:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(651903, 67657, 18191, '<td valign="top">I had a similar shot to submit but i chickened out. Great minds think alike 7.</td>', 'I had a similar shot to submit but i chickened out. Great minds think alike 7.', '2004-04-03 14:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(651904, 66561, 18191, '<td valign="top">This could have been cropped to disclude all of the dirt in the right corner.</td>', 'This could have been cropped to disclude all of the dirt in the right corner.', '2004-04-03 14:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(651907, 67409, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good clarity contrast and composition</td>', 'Good clarity contrast and composition', '2004-04-03 14:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(651915, 66555, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and composition.  This shot appears to have had it''s DOF and background adjusted in photoshop, which is fine, except that it perhaps was not done carefully enough.  The animals back ear looks like a gradient  or fill is over it, and parts of the background don''t look natural.  My apologies in advance if this is just my misperceptiion.</td>', 'Nice shot and composition.  This shot appears to have had it''s DOF and background adjusted in photoshop, which is fine, except that it perhaps was not done carefully enough.  The animals back ear looks like a gradient  or fill is over it, and parts of the background don''t look natural.  My apologies in advance if this is just my misperceptiion.', '2004-04-03 14:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
