(652584, 67412, 4007, '<td valign="top">The detail really is great here, but something seems just a touch off.  Maybe it''s just a little overcropped or over sharpened or unsharp masked.  Or maybe I''m just being obnoxiously picky.  Regardless, good work.</td>', 'The detail really is great here, but something seems just a touch off.  Maybe it''s just a little overcropped or over sharpened or unsharp masked.  Or maybe I''m just being obnoxiously picky.  Regardless, good work.', '2004-04-04 04:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(652585, 67480, 4007, '<td valign="top">This shot is incredible.  The sahpes and perspective are wonderful.  The light gradient is perfect.  Symetry works perfectly.  Congrats on a great shot.  Hope this finished in the top few.</td>', 'This shot is incredible.  The sahpes and perspective are wonderful.  The light gradient is perfect.  Symetry works perfectly.  Congrats on a great shot.  Hope this finished in the top few.', '2004-04-04 04:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
