(652661, 67650, 18709, '<td valign="top">A strange image.  Both faces have character and the superimposition seems <br/>odd.   But well done.</td>', 'A strange image.  Both faces have character and the superimposition seems odd.   But well done.', '2004-04-04 10:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(652662, 65592, 18709, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that the chair can hold enough interest for he centre of the picture.<br/>Pehap if you painted it yellow.    Good try.</td>', 'I don''t think that the chair can hold enough interest for he centre of the picture.Pehap if you painted it yellow.    Good try.', '2004-04-04 10:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(652663, 66835, 18709, '<td valign="top">The heron always has such a determined look in its eye, it''s hard to imagine it doing something as domestic as nest-building, but that is what birds do.  and you have caught this one very well indeed.  The trailing legs and the gimlet eyes are characteristic.</td>', 'The heron always has such a determined look in its eye, it''s hard to imagine it doing something as domestic as nest-building, but that is what birds do.  and you have caught this one very well indeed.  The trailing legs and the gimlet eyes are characteristic.', '2004-04-04 10:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(652664, 67723, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is good.. Like something out of a film-noir.    Looking into the distance always draws the eye of the viewer.  Very good.</td>', 'This is good.. Like something out of a film-noir.    Looking into the distance always draws the eye of the viewer.  Very good.', '2004-04-04 10:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(652666, 67765, 12827, '<td valign="top">Rules are ment to be broken, I would have broken them here.  I don''t think that <br/>rule of thirds did this justice!</td>', 'Rules are ment to be broken, I would have broken them here.  I don''t think that rule of thirds did this justice!', '2004-04-04 10:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(652667, 67274, 18709, '<td valign="top">You should aways try to edit out  any sign of wires or cages.   It detracts  from the wildness of the creature and make it look like a sitting target for your camera...   a bit too easy.</td>', 'You should aways try to edit out  any sign of wires or cages.   It detracts  from the wildness of the creature and make it look like a sitting target for your camera...   a bit too easy.', '2004-04-04 10:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(652672, 64085, 18709, '<td valign="top">This must be a State Capital; which one?    It has all the ingredients.    Even the Venetian type campanile.  It  is a well-taken night shot, using the floodlighting and the street-lighting to the best advantage</td>', 'This must be a State Capital; which one?    It has all the ingredients.    Even the Venetian type campanile.  It  is a well-taken night shot, using the floodlighting and the street-lighting to the best advantage', '2004-04-04 10:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(652675, 67798, 12827, '<td valign="top">LOL gotta love kinds!</td>', 'LOL gotta love kinds!', '2004-04-04 10:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(652677, 66661, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a peaceful image with, I think, just the right amount of head-room over the trees and just about the right amount of reflection in the water.   When I say ''right''... what I mean is, it is the way I would like to have done it. (I''m not sure if that is ''right'')</td>', 'This is a peaceful image with, I think, just the right amount of head-room over the trees and just about the right amount of reflection in the water.   When I say ''right''... what I mean is, it is the way I would like to have done it. (I''m not sure if that is ''right'')', '2004-04-04 10:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(652680, 66672, 18709, '<td valign="top">Do you mean, a ''slender'' grip on life, or  perhaps ''slender'' reeds.  Whichever, I''m a bit doubtful about the purple tinge (although it adds a bit of interest) and I think this is a bit too messy.  I don''t mean that ina derogatory sense, just that there is too much rather untidy detail.. a little bit of ''order'' might have helped .  Nevertheless, it has something.</td>', 'Do you mean, a ''slender'' grip on life, or  perhaps ''slender'' reeds.  Whichever, I''m a bit doubtful about the purple tinge (although it adds a bit of interest) and I think this is a bit too messy.  I don''t mean that ina derogatory sense, just that there is too much rather untidy detail.. a little bit of ''order'' might have helped .  Nevertheless, it has something.', '2004-04-04 10:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(652681, 65567, 18709, '<td valign="top">Some pictures are hard to interpret.  I can''t make this one out, but I like the colour and the glass textures.</td>', 'Some pictures are hard to interpret.  I can''t make this one out, but I like the colour and the glass textures.', '2004-04-04 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
