(652723, 67708, 18709, '<td valign="top">There is nothing as desolate as a summer scene in the winter.   But it isn''t grim. quite the contrary,  it looks as if the chairs could hold a conference on their own.<br/>Who needs people?</td>', 'There is nothing as desolate as a summer scene in the winter.   But it isn''t grim. quite the contrary,  it looks as if the chairs could hold a conference on their own.Who needs people?', '2004-04-04 10:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
