(652835, 67679, 12475, '<td valign="top">Nice detail; but there''s no real subject to the shot, and colors are a bit dull for an aquarium.</td>', 'Nice detail; but there''s no real subject to the shot, and colors are a bit dull for an aquarium.', '2004-04-04 11:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(652837, 67486, 12475, '<td valign="top">Interesting O''Keefish abstract--but I''d like to see it larger! It''s hard to appreciate at this size.</td>', 'Interesting O''Keefish abstract--but I''d like to see it larger! It''s hard to appreciate at this size.', '2004-04-04 11:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(652869, 66448, 12962, '<td valign="top">I am ambivalent about this photograph because of the haze in the background.  But it is such a beautifully and difficult captured photograph that I keep on going back to it.  Certainly, the composition is balanced, the placement of the head is very appropriate for the title and I like the fact that the parachute or parasail or whatever it is that suspends the person is cut off and out of the frame.  It appears then that the person is suspended from the frame of the picture.  I like that quirk.</td>', 'I am ambivalent about this photograph because of the haze in the background.  But it is such a beautifully and difficult captured photograph that I keep on going back to it.  Certainly, the composition is balanced, the placement of the head is very appropriate for the title and I like the fact that the parachute or parasail or whatever it is that suspends the person is cut off and out of the frame.  It appears then that the person is suspended from the frame of the picture.  I like that quirk.', '2004-04-04 13:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(652870, 67729, 12962, '<td valign="top">Feline curiosity represented in a photograph.  I like the shadows surrounding the cat.  It adds to the mystery.</td>', 'Feline curiosity represented in a photograph.  I like the shadows surrounding the cat.  It adds to the mystery.', '2004-04-04 13:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(652875, 66098, 15413, '<td valign="top">I love the color and detail...great shot!</td>', 'I love the color and detail...great shot!', '2004-04-04 13:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
