(653051, 67736, 14593, '<td valign="top">I am on a diet, and this looks good!  nicely photographed too!  I like the white plate as a background...great colors and great sharpness</td>', 'I am on a diet, and this looks good!  nicely photographed too!  I like the white plate as a background...great colors and great sharpness', '2004-04-04 15:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(653055, 67638, 14593, '<td valign="top">great macro shot!  sharp details too....the flower is great!  I wonder what type of lighting you used with this photo....looks harsh.</td>', 'great macro shot!  sharp details too....the flower is great!  I wonder what type of lighting you used with this photo....looks harsh.', '2004-04-04 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(653075, 65811, 12809, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Not quite sure how you pulled this one off, but this is terrific!  Nice job!</td>', 'Wow!  Not quite sure how you pulled this one off, but this is terrific!  Nice job!', '2004-04-04 16:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(653084, 67715, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the point of view and perspective here. I suppose  you could never get this without people and cars present. See the little grid-like pattern that is all over your image? This is due to overprocessing or oversharpening. Just get a larger view of your image as you do things, and you can tell when it shows up much easier. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I love the point of view and perspective here. I suppose  you could never get this without people and cars present. See the little grid-like pattern that is all over your image? This is due to overprocessing or oversharpening. Just get a larger view of your image as you do things, and you can tell when it shows up much easier. Keep up the good work.', '2004-04-04 16:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(653085, 67266, 6870, '<td valign="top">Funky, edgy and interesting shot. I like that the photog here is out of focus. 8</td>', 'Funky, edgy and interesting shot. I like that the photog here is out of focus. 8', '2004-04-04 16:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(653087, 67758, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely view and colors. The friends in the foreground are well placed and in good positions. You may have used Neatimage a bit too much here, as some of the details have been lost.</td>', 'Lovely view and colors. The friends in the foreground are well placed and in good positions. You may have used Neatimage a bit too much here, as some of the details have been lost.', '2004-04-04 16:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(653088, 67781, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition choice to center everything, which givest this flower and tree supreme importance. I like how you''ve used light (or burning). Nice work. It works for me! 9</td>', 'Very interesting composition choice to center everything, which givest this flower and tree supreme importance. I like how you''ve used light (or burning). Nice work. It works for me! 9', '2004-04-04 16:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(653089, 65638, 6870, '<td valign="top">This may have been slightly overexposed for my tastes, but it is still a lovely composition, and the motion blur of the water works so nicely.</td>', 'This may have been slightly overexposed for my tastes, but it is still a lovely composition, and the motion blur of the water works so nicely.', '2004-04-04 16:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(653090, 67627, 6870, '<td valign="top">The glorification of oil! SIllhouette was a good choice.</td>', 'The glorification of oil! SIllhouette was a good choice.', '2004-04-04 16:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(653091, 67726, 6870, '<td valign="top">The light here is just a bit harsh, but you manage to bring out details very nicely. Interesting subject hoice, too.</td>', 'The light here is just a bit harsh, but you manage to bring out details very nicely. Interesting subject hoice, too.', '2004-04-04 16:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(653092, 66476, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cool point of view!</td>', 'Cool point of view!', '2004-04-04 16:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
