(653096, 66469, 6870, '<td valign="top">So simple and so clear. I love it. One of my favorites for this challenge. Keep up this, shall we say experimental (?) work! 10</td>', 'So simple and so clear. I love it. One of my favorites for this challenge. Keep up this, shall we say experimental (?) work! 10', '2004-04-04 16:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
