(653129, 67744, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Your use of light is terrific. This might be just a bit sharper, but a very nice photo.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Your use of light is terrific. This might be just a bit sharper, but a very nice photo.', '2004-04-04 16:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(653130, 67708, 6870, '<td valign="top">Such an interesting composition and lovely tones. The whole scene is very engaging.</td>', 'Such an interesting composition and lovely tones. The whole scene is very engaging.', '2004-04-04 16:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(653131, 64262, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pwetty! Super use of exposure and reflection. Composition is just right. One of my faves! 9</td>', 'Pwetty! Super use of exposure and reflection. Composition is just right. One of my faves! 9', '2004-04-04 16:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(653134, 67367, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting sunset, a nice assortment of colours. The composition seems a bit haphazard though, I''d have looked for some strong shapes to silhouette and expoited rule of thirds.</td>', 'Interesting sunset, a nice assortment of colours. The composition seems a bit haphazard though, I''d have looked for some strong shapes to silhouette and expoited rule of thirds.', '2004-04-04 16:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(653135, 66917, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, very sharp, good dof. Great colours, very effective composition. Spot on.</td>', 'Wonderful, very sharp, good dof. Great colours, very effective composition. Spot on.', '2004-04-04 16:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(653136, 65085, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset. I''d have made everything other than a sky a complete silhouette though, and spot edited out those lights. NeatImage would have helped the slight noise levels as well.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset. I''d have made everything other than a sky a complete silhouette though, and spot edited out those lights. NeatImage would have helped the slight noise levels as well.', '2004-04-04 16:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(653138, 65076, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of tree in frame. Lovely blue sky. Have you tried this in b/w? The tones are such that it might work well, and the colors, other than the sky, seem to not play a huge role in the shot. Nice work! 8</td>', 'Nice placement of tree in frame. Lovely blue sky. Have you tried this in b/w? The tones are such that it might work well, and the colors, other than the sky, seem to not play a huge role in the shot. Nice work! 8', '2004-04-04 16:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(653139, 67527, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice character shot, nice and sharp, effective dof. Some great textures. Composition works well. Tricky shot to expose for, nicely handled here. Not entirely sure about your border, I think a better one could have bumped this up a mark for me.</td>', 'Nice character shot, nice and sharp, effective dof. Some great textures. Composition works well. Tricky shot to expose for, nicely handled here. Not entirely sure about your border, I think a better one could have bumped this up a mark for me.', '2004-04-04 16:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(653140, 67735, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cute coots!</td>', 'Cute coots!', '2004-04-04 16:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(653141, 63789, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful point of view. Colors and tones are very lovely. 9</td>', 'Wonderful point of view. Colors and tones are very lovely. 9', '2004-04-04 16:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(653144, 64821, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, effective exposure. Very effective dof. Some great textures in here. Not 100% sure about the crop, the ratio of foreground to background seems a little off. I''d have liked more background I think.</td>', 'Nice shot, effective exposure. Very effective dof. Some great textures in here. Not 100% sure about the crop, the ratio of foreground to background seems a little off. I''d have liked more background I think.', '2004-04-04 16:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(653159, 63735, 15574, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2004-04-04 17:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(653178, 65646, 18709, '<td valign="top">I find this kind of picture a bit disconcerting, when the skin tones are in black and white, and everything else in colour.   But it is good all  the same.</td>', 'I find this kind of picture a bit disconcerting, when the skin tones are in black and white, and everything else in colour.   But it is good all  the same.', '2004-04-04 17:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(653180, 67409, 18709, '<td valign="top">The colours here are very good.  The blue of the water, the orange of the duck''s bill and the pure white of its plumage make a good image.  The reflection enhances it.  I would have shown a bit more headroom myself, but I expect that would result in a bit of head-scratching to balance the reflection and keep it all in the frame.</td>', 'The colours here are very good.  The blue of the water, the orange of the duck''s bill and the pure white of its plumage make a good image.  The reflection enhances it.  I would have shown a bit more headroom myself, but I expect that would result in a bit of head-scratching to balance the reflection and keep it all in the frame.', '2004-04-04 17:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(653182, 66991, 17037, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot!  Were you lying on your back to take this?  Great angle.</td>', 'Outstanding shot!  Were you lying on your back to take this?  Great angle.', '2004-04-04 17:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(653183, 65815, 17037, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for beatiful naked women parched in the desert.  Very creative, and the shadow of the late sun adds to the effect.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for beatiful naked women parched in the desert.  Very creative, and the shadow of the late sun adds to the effect.', '2004-04-04 17:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(653184, 67658, 17037, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was taken at the same place as "I See You" but obviously not.  The is an attractive photo, but I ranked the other one higher because the rider was looking at the camera and the lighting is better.</td>', 'At first I thought this was taken at the same place as "I See You" but obviously not.  The is an attractive photo, but I ranked the other one higher because the rider was looking at the camera and the lighting is better.', '2004-04-04 17:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(653186, 67792, 17037, '<td valign="top">I am sure this was hard to get.  Nice capture.  Sharp and clear.  - 8 (Would have preferred the subject to surfing into the picture instead of going out.</td>', 'I am sure this was hard to get.  Nice capture.  Sharp and clear.  - 8 (Would have preferred the subject to surfing into the picture instead of going out.', '2004-04-04 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(653187, 65221, 17037, '<td valign="top">Sharpness, detail, and color are excellent - 9</td>', 'Sharpness, detail, and color are excellent - 9', '2004-04-04 17:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(653188, 67412, 17037, '<td valign="top">Excellent closup.  Very sharp.  Eye in engaging. -8</td>', 'Excellent closup.  Very sharp.  Eye in engaging. -8', '2004-04-04 17:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(653189, 67703, 17037, '<td valign="top">Veru well done.   Focus on the head is sharp. DOF a little weak, but still an excellent photo. - 8</td>', 'Veru well done.   Focus on the head is sharp. DOF a little weak, but still an excellent photo. - 8', '2004-04-04 17:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(653190, 66555, 17037, '<td valign="top">8- nice tight shot, excellent focus, no distracting background.  Very realisitic.</td>', '8- nice tight shot, excellent focus, no distracting background.  Very realisitic.', '2004-04-04 17:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(653191, 64040, 17037, '<td valign="top">8 - lighting and sharpaness are excellent.</td>', '8 - lighting and sharpaness are excellent.', '2004-04-04 17:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(653192, 67741, 18709, '<td valign="top">All those beautiful classical forms in a woodland setting.  What could be nicer. On closer inspection, it looks as if it is funerary architecture.   Of a very high order.<br/>The picture is about as good as you can make this sort of thing.</td>', 'All those beautiful classical forms in a woodland setting.  What could be nicer. On closer inspection, it looks as if it is funerary architecture.   Of a very high order.The picture is about as good as you can make this sort of thing.', '2004-04-04 17:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(653194, 67773, 17037, '<td valign="top">8 - tough shot to take.  Well done.  I''ve been there and this feels "real."</td>', '8 - tough shot to take.  Well done.  I''ve been there and this feels "real."', '2004-04-04 17:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(653196, 67586, 18709, '<td valign="top">This looks very carefree.  The boats, the bay, the houses marching up the hiilside,<br/>Everything you ned for relaxing.  (Except for the people who live there)?</td>', 'This looks very carefree.  The boats, the bay, the houses marching up the hiilside,Everything you ned for relaxing.  (Except for the people who live there)?', '2004-04-04 17:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
