(653198, 67566, 18709, '<td valign="top">This looks very exotic.   The purple sac looks as if it might catch flies, if all else failed.   It''s a good picturre, although the diagonal brickwork is a bit off-putting</td>', 'This looks very exotic.   The purple sac looks as if it might catch flies, if all else failed.   It''s a good picturre, although the diagonal brickwork is a bit off-putting', '2004-04-04 17:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(653199, 67408, 17037, '<td valign="top">7 - excellent lighting ... nice shot.</td>', '7 - excellent lighting ... nice shot.', '2004-04-04 17:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(653200, 67480, 17037, '<td valign="top">9- great angle, dramatic shot,  excellent lighting and tone</td>', '9- great angle, dramatic shot,  excellent lighting and tone', '2004-04-04 17:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(653201, 66980, 17037, '<td valign="top">7  - good eye for the form and and tone.  Nicely exposed.</td>', '7  - good eye for the form and and tone.  Nicely exposed.', '2004-04-04 17:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(653202, 67067, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photograph.  The strong shadow under the bow deck give the ship character, and the grain elevator, out of use, is a familiar(but not cliched) picture of industrial blight.    There is a deserted feel to the place.</td>', 'This is a very good photograph.  The strong shadow under the bow deck give the ship character, and the grain elevator, out of use, is a familiar(but not cliched) picture of industrial blight.    There is a deserted feel to the place.', '2004-04-04 17:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(653203, 66971, 17037, '<td valign="top">8 - If this Toucan You Can!  Nice shot!</td>', '8 - If this Toucan You Can!  Nice shot!', '2004-04-04 17:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(653204, 65815, 2923, '<td valign="top">DrJones, right? :-)  What time of the day did you shoot this?  The lighting is just perfect, but I know you probably used fill flash as well and possibly reflectors.  Good work. 10</td>', 'DrJones, right? :-)  What time of the day did you shoot this?  The lighting is just perfect, but I know you probably used fill flash as well and possibly reflectors.  Good work. 10', '2004-04-04 17:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(653205, 63194, 18709, '<td valign="top">You should be so lucky.   The cards all look so clean, and freshly made.  I like this.</td>', 'You should be so lucky.   The cards all look so clean, and freshly made.  I like this.', '2004-04-04 17:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(653206, 65352, 2923, '<td valign="top">Is this Gordon? :)  Nice background.</td>', 'Is this Gordon? :)  Nice background.', '2004-04-04 17:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(653207, 64871, 2923, '<td valign="top">Nice location.  Could you have gotten down to the sand dunes instead of from top view?  I think it''d be more effective.</td>', 'Nice location.  Could you have gotten down to the sand dunes instead of from top view?  I think it''d be more effective.', '2004-04-04 17:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(653208, 67202, 2923, '<td valign="top">Nice location, woudl like to see it in afternoon/evening/early morning lights...</td>', 'Nice location, woudl like to see it in afternoon/evening/early morning lights...', '2004-04-04 17:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(653209, 63789, 2923, '<td valign="top">the colors might be a bit off for the time of day... is this shot with Auto white balance?  Try CLOUDY balance next time on sunrise/sunsets, you''ll find it to be a better and warmer results.</td>', 'the colors might be a bit off for the time of day... is this shot with Auto white balance?  Try CLOUDY balance next time on sunrise/sunsets, you''ll find it to be a better and warmer results.', '2004-04-04 17:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(653210, 64040, 18709, '<td valign="top">This proves that even the humble dandelion can have its day.  And what a day.<br/>I don''t  think a single seed is missing, so you must have caught it just right. The lighting is crucial and it is good.</td>', 'This proves that even the humble dandelion can have its day.  And what a day.I don''t  think a single seed is missing, so you must have caught it just right. The lighting is crucial and it is good.', '2004-04-04 17:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(653214, 63789, 11843, '<td valign="top">IMO - I would have removed the bottom half of this. Its too dark to make anything out. I love the colors of the sky and the reflection of those colors in the water. Beautiful! 8</td>', 'IMO - I would have removed the bottom half of this. Its too dark to make anything out. I love the colors of the sky and the reflection of those colors in the water. Beautiful! 8', '2004-04-04 17:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(653217, 65510, 18709, '<td valign="top">The young man looks happy.  The picture is fine, except for some distortion of the windows on the left.   Very good atmosphere.</td>', 'The young man looks happy.  The picture is fine, except for some distortion of the windows on the left.   Very good atmosphere.', '2004-04-04 18:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(653219, 66679, 18709, '<td valign="top">This looks cold, but inviting.  The trees, with their branches loaded with snow, <br/>and the tracks leading who knows where.  There is a little bit of mystery about it.</td>', 'This looks cold, but inviting.  The trees, with their branches loaded with snow, and the tracks leading who knows where.  There is a little bit of mystery about it.', '2004-04-04 18:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(653220, 67091, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a very unusual viewpoint.  With the subject so close to the camera and the long vista behind.   I''m not sure if it works but I find it intriguing.</td>', 'This is a very unusual viewpoint.  With the subject so close to the camera and the long vista behind.   I''m not sure if it works but I find it intriguing.', '2004-04-04 18:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(653221, 67619, 18709, '<td valign="top">Tis is a nice study.  I think I would  have liked to see a bit further up the slope but perhaps that would have cut down on the river in the foreground, which is well<br/>pictured.</td>', 'Tis is a nice study.  I think I would  have liked to see a bit further up the slope but perhaps that would have cut down on the river in the foreground, which is wellpictured.', '2004-04-04 18:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(653222, 66635, 18709, '<td valign="top">Lots of editing here.  I think I like the outcome but it''s all a bit  diagonal.</td>', 'Lots of editing here.  I think I like the outcome but it''s all a bit  diagonal.', '2004-04-04 18:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(653223, 67800, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is indeed ''cozy'' but it looks a bit like a sickroom, and hence is a bit downbeat.<br/>I like the room with all its classical contents.</td>', 'This is indeed ''cozy'' but it looks a bit like a sickroom, and hence is a bit downbeat.I like the room with all its classical contents.', '2004-04-04 18:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(653228, 67560, 18709, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would have been improved if it had more sky, and less of the rather barren foreground.. But that is just an opinion.  The buttes themselves are very majestic but  I don''t think you have quite caught that majesty.</td>', 'I think this picture would have been improved if it had more sky, and less of the rather barren foreground.. But that is just an opinion.  The buttes themselves are very majestic but  I don''t think you have quite caught that majesty.', '2004-04-04 18:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(653230, 64308, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture, but the whole (rodeo) scene is so far from my experience, that I don''t quite know what to say about it except that it is perfectly balanced and really works well just as a picture. never mind the subject.</td>', 'This is a great picture, but the whole (rodeo) scene is so far from my experience, that I don''t quite know what to say about it except that it is perfectly balanced and really works well just as a picture. never mind the subject.', '2004-04-04 18:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(653232, 67365, 18709, '<td valign="top">The shadows of the off-picture palms make this interesting. Otherwise, it is a bit flat, in the literal sense.</td>', 'The shadows of the off-picture palms make this interesting. Otherwise, it is a bit flat, in the literal sense.', '2004-04-04 18:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(653233, 67126, 18709, '<td valign="top">This looks really desolate.  What are you doing out on a day like this?</td>', 'This looks really desolate.  What are you doing out on a day like this?', '2004-04-04 18:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(653238, 64942, 18709, '<td valign="top">So many people grumble about pylons marching across the landscape, but I have always found them most impressive.  I could have done with a few moe in this picture.</td>', 'So many people grumble about pylons marching across the landscape, but I have always found them most impressive.  I could have done with a few moe in this picture.', '2004-04-04 18:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(653239, 65934, 18709, '<td valign="top">Freedom endangered; not as long as this one is on guard. Very patriotic.</td>', 'Freedom endangered; not as long as this one is on guard. Very patriotic.', '2004-04-04 18:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(653242, 67355, 18709, '<td valign="top">The early bee catches the pollen, or something like that.  Well taken close-up.</td>', 'The early bee catches the pollen, or something like that.  Well taken close-up.', '2004-04-04 18:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(653244, 67415, 18709, '<td valign="top">The shape of an egg is a very satisfying one.  Your title implies that there may be some straight ones.  I don''t think  so.   If you come across any, let me know.  <br/>I Like this picture.</td>', 'The shape of an egg is a very satisfying one.  Your title implies that there may be some straight ones.  I don''t think  so.   If you come across any, let me know.  I Like this picture.', '2004-04-04 18:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(653246, 67797, 18709, '<td valign="top">I think you just about get away with all that green.  The strong shadows give some relief, and the central spike has an almost 3-D effect.</td>', 'I think you just about get away with all that green.  The strong shadows give some relief, and the central spike has an almost 3-D effect.', '2004-04-04 18:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(653249, 66800, 18709, '<td valign="top">This lady is managing to look flirty even under that load. Bully for her. This is a good picture, which shows the brilliant colours that look so good in the African sun.</td>', 'This lady is managing to look flirty even under that load. Bully for her. This is a good picture, which shows the brilliant colours that look so good in the African sun.', '2004-04-04 18:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(653253, 67481, 18709, '<td valign="top">This seems to go on for ever.  Is it a paddy-field?   The cloudscape is very dramatic and contrasts with the orderly rows of the planting.  Very good.</td>', 'This seems to go on for ever.  Is it a paddy-field?   The cloudscape is very dramatic and contrasts with the orderly rows of the planting.  Very good.', '2004-04-04 18:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(653254, 64262, 18709, '<td valign="top">Sometimes a reflection can be TOO much like the original making it look like a mirror<br/>image,  Not your fault.  Just a trick of the light.</td>', 'Sometimes a reflection can be TOO much like the original making it look like a mirrorimage,  Not your fault.  Just a trick of the light.', '2004-04-04 18:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(653256, 67517, 18709, '<td valign="top">A far cry from the Pavillion.   Why are all those stones stuffed into the gap[? I wonder. The old, weatherworn planks make a good picture.</td>', 'A far cry from the Pavillion.   Why are all those stones stuffed into the gap[? I wonder. The old, weatherworn planks make a good picture.', '2004-04-04 18:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(653260, 67510, 18709, '<td valign="top">The shadow on the lawn, and the green of he lawn itself, almost overpower the pale brickwork of the Museum.  However, you have given it a very <br/>Dutch skyscape to counterbalance, but I''m not sure that it succeeds totally.</td>', 'The shadow on the lawn, and the green of he lawn itself, almost overpower the pale brickwork of the Museum.  However, you have given it a very Dutch skyscape to counterbalance, but I''m not sure that it succeeds totally.', '2004-04-04 18:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(653266, 67692, 18709, '<td valign="top">I want to do t his sometimes.    The plumage on the head is beautifully caught and the sn owy white of the back and wings  look good.</td>', 'I want to do t his sometimes.    The plumage on the head is beautifully caught and the sn owy white of the back and wings  look good.', '2004-04-04 19:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(653270, 67137, 18709, '<td valign="top">He looks quite dignified, even with his half-grown antlers.  This is just a little bit out of focus, but it is a really nice picture.</td>', 'He looks quite dignified, even with his half-grown antlers.  This is just a little bit out of focus, but it is a really nice picture.', '2004-04-04 19:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(653303, 67310, 15880, '<td valign="top">Title of this photo perfect - I''m waiting for the seed pods to shoot out of my monitor!</td>', 'Title of this photo perfect - I''m waiting for the seed pods to shoot out of my monitor!', '2004-04-04 19:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(653306, 67747, 15880, '<td valign="top">I love this composition and color contrast!</td>', 'I love this composition and color contrast!', '2004-04-04 20:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(653337, 67575, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but the background is really distracting.  Next time try shooting against a plain wall.</td>', 'Nice portrait, but the background is really distracting.  Next time try shooting against a plain wall.', '2004-04-04 21:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
