(653488, 67777, 8970, '<td valign="top">The sun is too strong in this shot.  I understand that you are probably going for a silhoette effect but the sun distracts too much.</td>', 'The sun is too strong in this shot.  I understand that you are probably going for a silhoette effect but the sun distracts too much.', '2004-04-04 23:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
