(653498, 66555, 8970, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the spit dripping out of its mouth<br/></td>', 'Nice effect with the spit dripping out of its mouth', '2004-04-05 00:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(653503, 63899, 5822, '<td valign="top">I do like very much the moodyness of this image and the fog effect, but I''m not sure I like your angle of view since the forground is not all that interesting and, imo, does not add to the shot, especially given that fact that it appears too dark.  Also, I find your subject to be too centered, making for a static image.</td>', 'I do like very much the moodyness of this image and the fog effect, but I''m not sure I like your angle of view since the forground is not all that interesting and, imo, does not add to the shot, especially given that fact that it appears too dark.  Also, I find your subject to be too centered, making for a static image.', '2004-04-05 00:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(653514, 63742, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenic with wonderful color and depth but exposure is off, as your foreground is too dark and has lost detail.</td>', 'Beautiful scenic with wonderful color and depth but exposure is off, as your foreground is too dark and has lost detail.', '2004-04-05 00:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(653520, 67650, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting concept and the effect has been carried out well, but there are two improvements I think could be made to make it more believeable. First, the white edge of the foam board the picture is pasted on is showing and gives away the effect easily. Secondly, I would have cropped the picture at the base of the finger so that you couldn''t see that it''s a picture.</td>', 'This is a very interesting concept and the effect has been carried out well, but there are two improvements I think could be made to make it more believeable. First, the white edge of the foam board the picture is pasted on is showing and gives away the effect easily. Secondly, I would have cropped the picture at the base of the finger so that you couldn''t see that it''s a picture.', '2004-04-05 00:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(653537, 66177, 10055, '<td valign="top">Captureing birds isn''t easy..good attempt here and better than I had any luck with. Perhaps a another angle to shoot from as they blend into the backgraound and hard to see. Hope to see other shots of these maybe.</td>', 'Captureing birds isn''t easy..good attempt here and better than I had any luck with. Perhaps a another angle to shoot from as they blend into the backgraound and hard to see. Hope to see other shots of these maybe.', '2004-04-05 00:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(653538, 66532, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle with rich color and a feeling of wide open space. You could have cloned out the white object next to the flag pole.</td>', 'Nice wide angle with rich color and a feeling of wide open space. You could have cloned out the white object next to the flag pole.', '2004-04-05 00:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(653539, 67546, 10055, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of rays from the sun. I bet it was better in person to see it. Not knocking the image, it''s just that it always is better in life than on film sometimes. :) Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot of rays from the sun. I bet it was better in person to see it. Not knocking the image, it''s just that it always is better in life than on film sometimes. :) Good luck.', '2004-04-05 00:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(653540, 67685, 18686, '<td valign="top">evokes a particular place and time.</td>', 'evokes a particular place and time.', '2004-04-05 00:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(653542, 64157, 10055, '<td valign="top">A double meaning in this shot. Great work and eye. Very nice and it as a message within the photo.</td>', 'A double meaning in this shot. Great work and eye. Very nice and it as a message within the photo.', '2004-04-05 00:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(653543, 66886, 18686, '<td valign="top">Nice job</td>', 'Nice job', '2004-04-05 00:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(653546, 67367, 18686, '<td valign="top">Fine study</td>', 'Fine study', '2004-04-05 00:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(653549, 67091, 10055, '<td valign="top">It has potential, perhaps shoot these flowers in the early am or late afternoon. For better lighting, mood, and warmth. One rule is to not shoot a photo with direct sunlight. Try to advoid as much as possiable. It causes the photo to look and feel harsh and blown out....unless this is what you wanted. Good luck!</td>', 'It has potential, perhaps shoot these flowers in the early am or late afternoon. For better lighting, mood, and warmth. One rule is to not shoot a photo with direct sunlight. Try to advoid as much as possiable. It causes the photo to look and feel harsh and blown out....unless this is what you wanted. Good luck!', '2004-04-05 00:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(653556, 64948, 11487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Shot.  The color is awesome against the black background.  Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful Shot.  The color is awesome against the black background.  Great job.', '2004-04-05 00:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
