(653859, 67768, 17300, '<td valign="top">Nice dof, excellent shot of the bird, and like the B&amp;W. Too bad about the bird showing us his behind... Normally I don''t rate bird photos very high, but this gets a 7. If the bird had been more in profile, then you''d get an 8 or 9...</td>', 'Nice dof, excellent shot of the bird, and like the B&W. Too bad about the bird showing us his behind... Normally I don''t rate bird photos very high, but this gets a 7. If the bird had been more in profile, then you''d get an 8 or 9...', '2004-04-05 03:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
