(653862, 67621, 17300, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours. Is that snow on the left? Maybe the house is slightly off if you look at how to dived the photo into different sections (rule of 3rds and so on...) Also maybe the horizon is a little to much in the center. As a photo I still rank it as very interesting.  7 from me. With another composition / cropping, an 8 or a 9</td>', 'Very nice colours. Is that snow on the left? Maybe the house is slightly off if you look at how to dived the photo into different sections (rule of 3rds and so on...) Also maybe the horizon is a little to much in the center. As a photo I still rank it as very interesting.  7 from me. With another composition / cropping, an 8 or a 9', '2004-04-05 04:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
