(653964, 66980, 5792, '<td valign="top">I would consider this a top three image in this outstanding challenge if not for the cement support on the right side of the image. I''d have liked it better if it had been cropped out. As it is the lighting is perfect. It is a great image.</td>', 'I would consider this a top three image in this outstanding challenge if not for the cement support on the right side of the image. I''d have liked it better if it had been cropped out. As it is the lighting is perfect. It is a great image.', '2004-04-05 06:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
