(655174, 64124, 6999, '<td valign="top">Something looks slightly wrong with the red building, to my eye - and possibly with the black one bbeside it - the colour seems almost fake, too regular. It may only be that it''s a weird colour for an office building though. Like the shot - the sense of menace there is in those towers, the sense of oddness.</td>', 'Something looks slightly wrong with the red building, to my eye - and possibly with the black one bbeside it - the colour seems almost fake, too regular. It may only be that it''s a weird colour for an office building though. Like the shot - the sense of menace there is in those towers, the sense of oddness.', '2004-04-06 05:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
