(655474, 67192, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Perfect. 10<br/>Superb exposure, nice high-key effect. Good model. Effective background. Nice composition. I like the colours and saturation.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Perfect. 10Superb exposure, nice high-key effect. Good model. Effective background. Nice composition. I like the colours and saturation.', '2004-04-06 12:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(655476, 66722, 9073, '<td valign="top">The centred branch detracts from what is, IHO, a truly great image. The  sea texture, the gulls, the ice, the whole works so well. I''d have this on my wall. Maybe the tree in the foreground could have more character, on further viewing. 9</td>', 'The centred branch detracts from what is, IHO, a truly great image. The  sea texture, the gulls, the ice, the whole works so well. I''d have this on my wall. Maybe the tree in the foreground could have more character, on further viewing. 9', '2004-04-06 12:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(655477, 67637, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting. Great clarity Wonderful muted colours. 10</td>', 'Superb lighting. Great clarity Wonderful muted colours. 10', '2004-04-06 12:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(655478, 67585, 17296, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting in this, feels like a chilly morning to me.</td>', 'Love the lighting in this, feels like a chilly morning to me.', '2004-04-06 12:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(655481, 66986, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, effective choice of shutter speed. Good composition. I like the mood in this shot. The graduated sky works well. 10</td>', 'Great shot, effective choice of shutter speed. Good composition. I like the mood in this shot. The graduated sky works well. 10', '2004-04-06 12:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(655482, 67541, 9073, '<td valign="top">The great quality on the bottom of the glass isn''t matched on the top, which is a pity. You were brave to choose a textured backing paper rather than the more traditional (and better?) smooth one which might have blended with the smooth glass better. 5</td>', 'The great quality on the bottom of the glass isn''t matched on the top, which is a pity. You were brave to choose a textured backing paper rather than the more traditional (and better?) smooth one which might have blended with the smooth glass better. 5', '2004-04-06 12:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(655483, 65811, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very striking, high-impact image. Well put together, I hope you let us all know how you did this. 10</td>', 'Very striking, high-impact image. Well put together, I hope you let us all know how you did this. 10', '2004-04-06 12:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(655485, 67745, 9073, '<td valign="top">The textures aren''t that clear. The colours are washed out. There''s little sharpness. Overall, this photo could be improved in many ways. 2</td>', 'The textures aren''t that clear. The colours are washed out. There''s little sharpness. Overall, this photo could be improved in many ways. 2', '2004-04-06 12:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
