(655719, 67741, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Glad to see someone else with an interest in mosoleums. Love the gray tones. My only comment: Might have cropped out more of the ore ground. While there is not too much you can do with all the tree limbs I think a tighter crop my bring more deserved attention to the building itself. Good luck.<br/> <br/>What is the light source for the columns?</td>', 'Very nice.  Glad to see someone else with an interest in mosoleums. Love the gray tones. My only comment: Might have cropped out more of the ore ground. While there is not too much you can do with all the tree limbs I think a tighter crop my bring more deserved attention to the building itself. Good luck. What is the light source for the columns?', '2004-04-06 16:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
