(655766, 66505, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very exciting point of view! The leading lines really suck me in. The very bright corner down right distracts me just a little, but I still really enjoy the image.</td>', 'Very exciting point of view! The leading lines really suck me in. The very bright corner down right distracts me just a little, but I still really enjoy the image.', '2004-04-06 17:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
