(655771, 67560, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like your placement of the horizon. The tree down center distracts me a little. Lovely blue sky. You were lucky to have just the right amount of clouds.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like your placement of the horizon. The tree down center distracts me a little. Lovely blue sky. You were lucky to have just the right amount of clouds.', '2004-04-06 17:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
