(655774, 66158, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super work. Lighting is wonderful. My only nitpicky thing would be that the portrait format kind of squeezes things a bit. Have you tried square or landscape? Really fine job. 9</td>', 'Super work. Lighting is wonderful. My only nitpicky thing would be that the portrait format kind of squeezes things a bit. Have you tried square or landscape? Really fine job. 9', '2004-04-06 17:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
