(655787, 65815, 6870, '<td valign="top">I was just here! I didn''t see her though. i just saw the big cement tree. nice tones and composition.</td>', 'I was just here! I didn''t see her though. i just saw the big cement tree. nice tones and composition.', '2004-04-06 17:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(655789, 67755, 6870, '<td valign="top">For some reason, the slightly soft quality and graininess of this image really makes it pop for me. Very nice work! 10</td>', 'For some reason, the slightly soft quality and graininess of this image really makes it pop for me. Very nice work! 10', '2004-04-06 17:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(655790, 67682, 9763, '<td valign="top">I have a shot very similar to this taken on my 35mm camera.  www.mirdonamy.com Outside / Photos / Color / Inanimate / Misc if you want to see it.  I really like these types of shots.  The cropping on the top blue one is a tight, but the background is beautiful, the focus is nice, and the lighting is pretty good (though a little bright on top)</td>', 'I have a shot very similar to this taken on my 35mm camera.  www.mirdonamy.com Outside / Photos / Color / Inanimate / Misc if you want to see it.  I really like these types of shots.  The cropping on the top blue one is a tight, but the background is beautiful, the focus is nice, and the lighting is pretty good (though a little bright on top)', '2004-04-06 17:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(655793, 64634, 9763, '<td valign="top">It''s so nice to see the house is not silhouetted in black or grey!  Most sunset shots are backlit and the subject is faded or gone.  I really love that you can see color.  How''d you do it?</td>', 'It''s so nice to see the house is not silhouetted in black or grey!  Most sunset shots are backlit and the subject is faded or gone.  I really love that you can see color.  How''d you do it?', '2004-04-06 17:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(655794, 66971, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous work. To get rid of the slight haze, try an unsharp mask at a high threshold, a high pixel radius, and a low percentage. Super point of view and framing. 9</td>', 'Marvelous work. To get rid of the slight haze, try an unsharp mask at a high threshold, a high pixel radius, and a low percentage. Super point of view and framing. 9', '2004-04-06 17:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(655796, 67626, 9763, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very odd.  It would be nice to not notice the lighting in this photo, as if it were all around, but I do like the shadow of the lamp.</td>', 'The lighting is very odd.  It would be nice to not notice the lighting in this photo, as if it were all around, but I do like the shadow of the lamp.', '2004-04-06 17:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(655797, 67637, 6870, '<td valign="top">This image oozes with vibrancy and fluidity. Wow. Just wow. 10</td>', 'This image oozes with vibrancy and fluidity. Wow. Just wow. 10', '2004-04-06 17:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(655798, 67794, 9763, '<td valign="top">Wow, incredible shot!  The crop is tight at the top, but this is impressive!  Did you do this during the motion challenge?</td>', 'Wow, incredible shot!  The crop is tight at the top, but this is impressive!  Did you do this during the motion challenge?', '2004-04-06 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(655800, 66038, 6870, '<td valign="top">Next time you go, invite me! nice composition and clear colors and sky.</td>', 'Next time you go, invite me! nice composition and clear colors and sky.', '2004-04-06 17:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(655801, 65370, 9763, '<td valign="top">Wow, I have the same title on my cat photo for "off screen expectation" and the same looking cat!  You should go see it under my profile!  I love the look in the cats eyes.  The color is a bit blue, the lighting is a bit harsh, but the clarity is beautiful.</td>', 'Wow, I have the same title on my cat photo for "off screen expectation" and the same looking cat!  You should go see it under my profile!  I love the look in the cats eyes.  The color is a bit blue, the lighting is a bit harsh, but the clarity is beautiful.', '2004-04-06 17:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(655802, 66008, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of duotone. I like the effect and the gradation from dark to light.</td>', 'Interesting choice of duotone. I like the effect and the gradation from dark to light.', '2004-04-06 17:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(655803, 67032, 6870, '<td valign="top">A bird shot that really works for me. Lovely clarity and colors! 10</td>', 'A bird shot that really works for me. Lovely clarity and colors! 10', '2004-04-06 17:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
