(655980, 67757, 6667, '<td valign="top">This is a unique photo.  However, I actually saw a hiker in Utah wearing a black spaghetti strap and black high heels.  Thought it was totally odd till I was climbing in California and down the path comes a young lady with. . .  black dress and black high heels. Haven''t come across a lady in red yet!!  BOL on a very neat, sharp an snappy shot.</td>', 'This is a unique photo.  However, I actually saw a hiker in Utah wearing a black spaghetti strap and black high heels.  Thought it was totally odd till I was climbing in California and down the path comes a young lady with. . .  black dress and black high heels. Haven''t come across a lady in red yet!!  BOL on a very neat, sharp an snappy shot.', '2004-04-06 20:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
