(656154, 67767, 1847, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.  Wonderful skin tones.  Did you use neatimage or some other smoothing algorithm to get that "porcelain doll" look?  Very nice.</td>', 'Great portrait.  Wonderful skin tones.  Did you use neatimage or some other smoothing algorithm to get that "porcelain doll" look?  Very nice.', '2004-04-06 23:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
