(656166, 65934, 1847, '<td valign="top">Crystal clear photo.  Very nicely exposed.  Have to admit that I cringe at the overwrought, "patriotic" title, but I certainly won''t mark down a great photo for that.</td>', 'Crystal clear photo.  Very nicely exposed.  Have to admit that I cringe at the overwrought, "patriotic" title, but I certainly won''t mark down a great photo for that.', '2004-04-06 23:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(656167, 63742, 14355, '<td valign="top">I think you should have taken some artistic exception and used PS to eliminate the houses on this photo.  I would deffinitly re-visit this site and take other pictures with the sun a little higher - and PS the houses out on that picture.  Just to make a better picture.  The colors are fantastic, the rock formations wonderful, and the haze background very inspiring. Rated 6.</td>', 'I think you should have taken some artistic exception and used PS to eliminate the houses on this photo.  I would deffinitly re-visit this site and take other pictures with the sun a little higher - and PS the houses out on that picture.  Just to make a better picture.  The colors are fantastic, the rock formations wonderful, and the haze background very inspiring. Rated 6.', '2004-04-06 23:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(656168, 64085, 1847, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Not sure if the noise is due to the long exposure, or a high ISO.  Wouldvn''t been nice to not have that, obviously.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Not sure if the noise is due to the long exposure, or a high ISO.  Wouldvn''t been nice to not have that, obviously.', '2004-04-06 23:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(656172, 63224, 1847, '<td valign="top">Great water!</td>', 'Great water!', '2004-04-06 23:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(656175, 67642, 14355, '<td valign="top">Considering the amount of blur in the picture, and, the amount of noise in the background........ this picure appears to be heavily enlarged or your camera lens was not effecient for the light available.  I would be hard pressed to make a picture look this bad with my 10D and the lenses I own.  This pic would have benefited from Photo Shop using the Noise&gt;despeckle filter and working the unsharp mask in shapern.  Or, invest in a better more effecient lens F1.4-F2.2 to help your camera along.   Hope this helps.</td>', 'Considering the amount of blur in the picture, and, the amount of noise in the background........ this picure appears to be heavily enlarged or your camera lens was not effecient for the light available.  I would be hard pressed to make a picture look this bad with my 10D and the lenses I own.  This pic would have benefited from Photo Shop using the Noise>despeckle filter and working the unsharp mask in shapern.  Or, invest in a better more effecient lens F1.4-F2.2 to help your camera along.   Hope this helps.', '2004-04-06 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(656183, 67511, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image and good DOF. The lighting is a bit harsh however; Im not a big fan of onboard flash photography. I wonder how this would look if you set the doll next to a window for lighting?</td>', 'Nice sharp image and good DOF. The lighting is a bit harsh however; Im not a big fan of onboard flash photography. I wonder how this would look if you set the doll next to a window for lighting?', '2004-04-06 23:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(656185, 67390, 1135, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, a little catch light in those beautiful eyes would draw more attention to them. Try fill flash or even just reflecting some light from a white foam board.</td>', 'Lovely portrait, a little catch light in those beautiful eyes would draw more attention to them. Try fill flash or even just reflecting some light from a white foam board.', '2004-04-07 00:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
