(656781, 67480, 12569, '<td valign="top">WOW, this is amazing, you captured this room in a real surrealistic way, as if it comes straight from star trek or the fifth element:D! When i saw it the first time i couldn''t tell what was left, right, up or down, great job!</td>', 'WOW, this is amazing, you captured this room in a real surrealistic way, as if it comes straight from star trek or the fifth element:D! When i saw it the first time i couldn''t tell what was left, right, up or down, great job!', '2004-04-07 07:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(656783, 64731, 12569, '<td valign="top">What a great photo, why is it validated, does that mean it''s outside the challenge period? The ticket is captured in a great way! Really dramatic. It expresses loneliness and being forgotten in a beautiful way.</td>', 'What a great photo, why is it validated, does that mean it''s outside the challenge period? The ticket is captured in a great way! Really dramatic. It expresses loneliness and being forgotten in a beautiful way.', '2004-04-07 07:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
