(656785, 67786, 12569, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great composition and use of colors! the shape of the church makes the picture almost as if it was taken on a different planet:). If i got this picture as a postcard in my mailbox i would say this was sent straight from paradise.</td>', 'Wow, what a great composition and use of colors! the shape of the church makes the picture almost as if it was taken on a different planet:). If i got this picture as a postcard in my mailbox i would say this was sent straight from paradise.', '2004-04-07 07:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
