(657996, 67643, 6870, '<td valign="top">Emotive, yet objective image. I enjoy the use of light and shadow here. Seems only slightly soft, but magnificent work! 9</td>', 'Emotive, yet objective image. I enjoy the use of light and shadow here. Seems only slightly soft, but magnificent work! 9', '2004-04-07 16:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(657998, 67773, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice cropping/framing. Clear photo and interesting geometry.</td>', 'Very nice cropping/framing. Clear photo and interesting geometry.', '2004-04-07 17:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(658000, 67721, 6870, '<td valign="top">Engaing and interesting arrangement. Focus is pretty good--I imagine you want all to be in focus, though the closest pawns are not.  I love the direction lighting and the mysterious mood  you''ve created.</td>', 'Engaing and interesting arrangement. Focus is pretty good--I imagine you want all to be in focus, though the closest pawns are not.  I love the direction lighting and the mysterious mood  you''ve created.', '2004-04-07 17:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(658001, 63224, 6870, '<td valign="top">The little sparklies give this duck image some extra punch!</td>', 'The little sparklies give this duck image some extra punch!', '2004-04-07 17:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(658005, 64552, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely rainbow! i like your placement of the rainbow in the frame. 9</td>', 'Lovely rainbow! i like your placement of the rainbow in the frame. 9', '2004-04-07 17:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(658050, 67796, 7889, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph, the facial expression you have captured is excellent.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph, the facial expression you have captured is excellent.', '2004-04-07 17:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(658053, 67781, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I would have cropped it to remove the sky, top right. Colour and lighting is excellent</td>', 'Great photo, I would have cropped it to remove the sky, top right. Colour and lighting is excellent', '2004-04-07 17:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(658056, 65705, 7889, '<td valign="top">He looks so peaceful and content, love the lighting it really gives atmosphere to the shot. Good luck</td>', 'He looks so peaceful and content, love the lighting it really gives atmosphere to the shot. Good luck', '2004-04-07 17:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(658060, 67621, 7758, '<td valign="top">Superb shot, just a slight extra lift in the saturation and I think this would be a 10..... Todd, 9.</td>', 'Superb shot, just a slight extra lift in the saturation and I think this would be a 10..... Todd, 9.', '2004-04-07 17:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(658063, 67739, 7758, '<td valign="top">Would like to see the colour version of this too...... not sure that b&amp;w really adds anything to it..... I do like the shot though.... Good Luck, Todd. 8.</td>', 'Would like to see the colour version of this too...... not sure that b&w really adds anything to it..... I do like the shot though.... Good Luck, Todd. 8.', '2004-04-07 17:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(658065, 65355, 7758, '<td valign="top">Love it, I would have bumped up the saturation, that''s about the only thing it needs..... in my opinion. Good Luck, Todd. 9.</td>', 'Love it, I would have bumped up the saturation, that''s about the only thing it needs..... in my opinion. Good Luck, Todd. 9.', '2004-04-07 17:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(658068, 67784, 7758, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I just wonder if it might not have looked better without the white pillar behind it..... just a thought.... Good Luck, Todd. 7.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I just wonder if it might not have looked better without the white pillar behind it..... just a thought.... Good Luck, Todd. 7.', '2004-04-07 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(658073, 67768, 7758, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...... but I''m just not sure why you chose to go b&amp;w.... I''d like to see the colour version.... I''m not sure that being b&amp;w adds anything to the shot..... good luck, Todd. 7.</td>', 'Nice shot...... but I''m just not sure why you chose to go b&w.... I''d like to see the colour version.... I''m not sure that being b&w adds anything to the shot..... good luck, Todd. 7.', '2004-04-07 17:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(658074, 67567, 7758, '<td valign="top">with the free editing in this challenge it might have been effective to have increased the saturation and contrast in the sky..... otherwise I really like the shot.... good luck, Todd. 7.</td>', 'with the free editing in this challenge it might have been effective to have increased the saturation and contrast in the sky..... otherwise I really like the shot.... good luck, Todd. 7.', '2004-04-07 17:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(658112, 66555, 7038, '<td valign="top">Superb.  I''d be surprised if this doesn''t get a ribbon.</td>', 'Superb.  I''d be surprised if this doesn''t get a ribbon.', '2004-04-07 18:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(658114, 67637, 1847, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Painted with light?  This is how flower shots should be done!  (And I''ve done a few boring ones myself!)</td>', 'Beautiful.  Painted with light?  This is how flower shots should be done!  (And I''ve done a few boring ones myself!)', '2004-04-07 18:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(658129, 66539, 11793, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective, although i might have included more of the post rather than cutting it off.</td>', 'interesting perspective, although i might have included more of the post rather than cutting it off.', '2004-04-07 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(658141, 67412, 11793, '<td valign="top">cool - good luck<br/></td>', 'cool - good luck', '2004-04-07 18:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(658190, 64850, 8159, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this looks to much like "digital art" to me.</td>', 'In my opinion, this looks to much like "digital art" to me.', '2004-04-07 19:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(658197, 66668, 11793, '<td valign="top">the background  is kind of distracting.<br/>the dog looks good..<br/>good luck</td>', 'the background  is kind of distracting.the dog looks good..good luck', '2004-04-07 19:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(658208, 67373, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. It reminds me of those "generic" pictures you see pre-installed in store-bought photo frames. =] (I won''t mention the titled horizon ''cause I''m sure you''ve gotten enough of those comments...)</td>', 'Nice capture. It reminds me of those "generic" pictures you see pre-installed in store-bought photo frames. =] (I won''t mention the titled horizon ''cause I''m sure you''ve gotten enough of those comments...)', '2004-04-07 19:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(658210, 64270, 11793, '<td valign="top">well done.<br/>good luck</td>', 'well done.good luck', '2004-04-07 19:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(658215, 67795, 8159, '<td valign="top">This first thing that poped into my mind when this picture appeared was "I wonder how many comments you''ve gotten that say that you should have cloned out the rim of the glass/vase"... =] Very nice flower capture with a nice solid black background.</td>', 'This first thing that poped into my mind when this picture appeared was "I wonder how many comments you''ve gotten that say that you should have cloned out the rim of the glass/vase"... =] Very nice flower capture with a nice solid black background.', '2004-04-07 19:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(658217, 65592, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Fantastic use of wide-angle lens and the tones and textures are beautiful.  10</td>', 'Wow!  Fantastic use of wide-angle lens and the tones and textures are beautiful.  10', '2004-04-07 19:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(658220, 63742, 8159, '<td valign="top">To me, might have had a little more impact without the buildings.</td>', 'To me, might have had a little more impact without the buildings.', '2004-04-07 19:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(658222, 64384, 5391, '<td valign="top">Goodness sakes - you went all the way to paradise for this image.  Lovely tones - this would be great for use in any sort of inspirational context.  Heavenly.</td>', 'Goodness sakes - you went all the way to paradise for this image.  Lovely tones - this would be great for use in any sort of inspirational context.  Heavenly.', '2004-04-07 19:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(658225, 66886, 8159, '<td valign="top">This image has a very "painterly" feel to it. Was some sort of post-processing done to this pic to give it that look?</td>', 'This image has a very "painterly" feel to it. Was some sort of post-processing done to this pic to give it that look?', '2004-04-07 19:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(658232, 66679, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I think I would have liked it even more without the inset border.</td>', 'Nice shot. I think I would have liked it even more without the inset border.', '2004-04-07 19:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(658234, 67637, 8159, '<td valign="top">One of the best flower shots I''ve seen so far in this challenge. Bravo.</td>', 'One of the best flower shots I''ve seen so far in this challenge. Bravo.', '2004-04-07 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(658239, 67574, 8159, '<td valign="top">This is way too much "digital art" post-processing for my liking. Sorry.</td>', 'This is way too much "digital art" post-processing for my liking. Sorry.', '2004-04-07 19:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(658246, 67659, 11843, '<td valign="top">I like this. Looks peaceful, great colors. Just a suggestion, crop off most of the right side, up to the walkway and just a little off the left. It seems a little heavy on the left with the dark boulder/fallen tree. Portrait instead of landscape. Just my opinion. 8</td>', 'I like this. Looks peaceful, great colors. Just a suggestion, crop off most of the right side, up to the walkway and just a little off the left. It seems a little heavy on the left with the dark boulder/fallen tree. Portrait instead of landscape. Just my opinion. 8', '2004-04-07 19:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(658248, 67760, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of an interesting moment!</td>', 'Nice capture of an interesting moment!', '2004-04-07 19:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(658252, 67651, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice, but could use some contrast. 6</td>', 'Nice, but could use some contrast. 6', '2004-04-07 19:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(658253, 66991, 12253, '<td valign="top">Especially good with the eye contact, though they are dark enough on my monitor that I may not have noticed if the title didn''t say that.  Perhaps that could be adjusted somewhat if other people see it as dark too.</td>', 'Especially good with the eye contact, though they are dark enough on my monitor that I may not have noticed if the title didn''t say that.  Perhaps that could be adjusted somewhat if other people see it as dark too.', '2004-04-07 19:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(658255, 63159, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the way you caught his/her eye yere, but the nose in the lense, and the shallow DOF are very distracting here.</td>', 'I like the way you caught his/her eye yere, but the nose in the lense, and the shallow DOF are very distracting here.', '2004-04-07 19:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(658258, 66722, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice light, good scene and capture.  I like the larger tree as a framing element here, though it took me a whilke to realize that this was all water and not sky for some reason.  As such, the water is interesting enough in shape that I''m not sure the tree is needed in this shot.  (And the little tree or branch bottom center would be better removed through cloning in my opinion.    Overall, I like this very much.</td>', 'Very nice light, good scene and capture.  I like the larger tree as a framing element here, though it took me a whilke to realize that this was all water and not sky for some reason.  As such, the water is interesting enough in shape that I''m not sure the tree is needed in this shot.  (And the little tree or branch bottom center would be better removed through cloning in my opinion.    Overall, I like this very much.', '2004-04-07 20:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(658270, 63899, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good fog, but a challenging day to photograph.  I thiink this could have been improved by not shooting it from such a low angle; the lighthouse seems such a small part of the pic, and the grass such a large part; subjectively, to me, that just downplays the main interest of the scene.   It also makes the lighthouse look smaller!  I think if you had just the light house in the pic, and all that fog, it would really give a feeling of the scene.  Or maybe just having shot from a higher angle, and including the grass as a much less significant part.</td>', 'A good fog, but a challenging day to photograph.  I thiink this could have been improved by not shooting it from such a low angle; the lighthouse seems such a small part of the pic, and the grass such a large part; subjectively, to me, that just downplays the main interest of the scene.   It also makes the lighthouse look smaller!  I think if you had just the light house in the pic, and all that fog, it would really give a feeling of the scene.  Or maybe just having shot from a higher angle, and including the grass as a much less significant part.', '2004-04-07 20:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(658271, 67635, 11793, '<td valign="top">same thing here...<br/> <br/>good luck</td>', 'same thing here... good luck', '2004-04-07 20:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(658274, 67776, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good closeup, though in my opinion, there''s too little duck here to really show his "beauty".  Also, for a closeup of the eye beak and neck it seems slightly (I do mean slghtly) soft.  The beak itself seems almost to be out of the DOF range.  I think a little more postprocessing sharpening would have jazzed it up a bit.  Maybe also cloning out the brown and white spot like hightlights in the water which do grab a little attention away too.</td>', 'Good closeup, though in my opinion, there''s too little duck here to really show his "beauty".  Also, for a closeup of the eye beak and neck it seems slightly (I do mean slghtly) soft.  The beak itself seems almost to be out of the DOF range.  I think a little more postprocessing sharpening would have jazzed it up a bit.  Maybe also cloning out the brown and white spot like hightlights in the water which do grab a little attention away too.', '2004-04-07 20:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(658276, 64436, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea, but a tough shot to pull off.  Basically, I think it might have been better if more subtle; it appears to me to need more light on the outside areas, and a softer exposure at the light source.  Perhaps just my own aesthetics.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea, but a tough shot to pull off.  Basically, I think it might have been better if more subtle; it appears to me to need more light on the outside areas, and a softer exposure at the light source.  Perhaps just my own aesthetics.', '2004-04-07 20:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(658277, 64821, 11793, '<td valign="top">well done, good luck.<br/></td>', 'well done, good luck.', '2004-04-07 20:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(658279, 67574, 12253, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect; but the face is so dominant, and the rest subdued and hard to figure out, that I am not sure what I am looking at.  And to me, the effect doesn''t stand on its own aesthetically; it might if I could after a few moments see the paradox, or trick, to what I am looking at.  But it almost looks like a mask and photoshop filter, nothing based in reality, even though in this "group" I suspect there''s some real basis for this.</td>', 'An interesting effect; but the face is so dominant, and the rest subdued and hard to figure out, that I am not sure what I am looking at.  And to me, the effect doesn''t stand on its own aesthetically; it might if I could after a few moments see the paradox, or trick, to what I am looking at.  But it almost looks like a mask and photoshop filter, nothing based in reality, even though in this "group" I suspect there''s some real basis for this.', '2004-04-07 20:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(658284, 67745, 12253, '<td valign="top">These guys are hard to catch in the wild, but you seem to have him posing!  But your autofocus was slower I think and to me this is just not near sharp enough.  Also, it looks like it might need to have levels adjusted (contrast, brightness) since it doesn''t appear to have true whites or blacks, and subjectively looks muddy (no pun intended!)</td>', 'These guys are hard to catch in the wild, but you seem to have him posing!  But your autofocus was slower I think and to me this is just not near sharp enough.  Also, it looks like it might need to have levels adjusted (contrast, brightness) since it doesn''t appear to have true whites or blacks, and subjectively looks muddy (no pun intended!)', '2004-04-07 20:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(658306, 66668, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, great b/w contrast and a gorgeous looking dog. 7</td>', 'Nice exposure, great b/w contrast and a gorgeous looking dog. 7', '2004-04-07 20:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
