(658434, 67266, 3524, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of interesting elements in this picture. I like the grid geometry, and progressive distortion of the tiles further back in the reflective distance. The purple door nicely balances your own reflection. I think having yourself just inside the frame on the left is a critical part of the composition. I''m guessing you left yourself in soft focus to keep attention on the strong lines in the rest of the image, but that softness feels out of place to me. Nice shot overall. (7)</td>', 'There are a lot of interesting elements in this picture. I like the grid geometry, and progressive distortion of the tiles further back in the reflective distance. The purple door nicely balances your own reflection. I think having yourself just inside the frame on the left is a critical part of the composition. I''m guessing you left yourself in soft focus to keep attention on the strong lines in the rest of the image, but that softness feels out of place to me. Nice shot overall. (7)', '2004-04-07 21:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(658438, 66552, 5822, '<td valign="top">Really love this composition and the background but think it could be in better focus.</td>', 'Really love this composition and the background but think it could be in better focus.', '2004-04-07 21:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
