(658521, 67061, 255, '<td valign="top">i am very drawn to this. i can''t decide if i would like to see the stem cropped off entirely to give it more of an abstract feel--but regardless, it is a wonderful shot. the color mix is fantastic--love the two-toned background with the two-toned flower. cropping/composition and lighting are excellent. well done!</td>', 'i am very drawn to this. i can''t decide if i would like to see the stem cropped off entirely to give it more of an abstract feel--but regardless, it is a wonderful shot. the color mix is fantastic--love the two-toned background with the two-toned flower. cropping/composition and lighting are excellent. well done!', '2004-04-07 22:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
