(658737, 65815, 8159, '<td valign="top">Wow what a terrific place for an environmental shoot! Great model too. Fantastic shot. Her left breast looks a little awkwardly smunched, but other than that, this is an outstanding shot...</td>', 'Wow what a terrific place for an environmental shoot! Great model too. Fantastic shot. Her left breast looks a little awkwardly smunched, but other than that, this is an outstanding shot...', '2004-04-08 00:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
