(658741, 67244, 7908, '<td valign="top">Took me quite a while to figure out what this had to do with the price of corn ... I''m a little slow sometimes, I guess!</td>', 'Took me quite a while to figure out what this had to do with the price of corn ... I''m a little slow sometimes, I guess!', '2004-04-08 00:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
