(658873, 63735, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice image; I think a perspective adjustment would make it better, and maybe a rotate since it looks tilted (may be confounded with the perspective here though).  I also tink it would have been nice to use more telephoto.  The foreground seems so dominating, yet the buildings are really the dominant force here.</td>', 'Very nice image; I think a perspective adjustment would make it better, and maybe a rotate since it looks tilted (may be confounded with the perspective here though).  I also tink it would have been nice to use more telephoto.  The foreground seems so dominating, yet the buildings are really the dominant force here.', '2004-04-08 00:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
