(658939, 65355, 9331, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and for those who thought this was a desert shot - well it''s actually only a 100 metres or so from the ocean :)<br/>Here''s a better shot of the area by another photographer, which shows this<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.ozoutback.com.au/postcards/postcards_forms/vic_n_tas/Image/6.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.ozoutback.com.au/postcards/postcards_forms/vic_n_tas/Image/6.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.ozoutback.com.au/postcards/postcards_forms/vic_n_tas/Image/6.jpg"/> <br/>If you poked your head over the top of the sand dune in my pic, you would see the beach :)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and for those who thought this was a desert shot - well it''s actually only a 100 metres or so from the ocean :)Here''s a better shot of the area by another photographer, which shows this If you poked your head over the top of the sand dune in my pic, you would see the beach :)', '2004-04-08 01:12:42.000000', NULL, 0),
