(658954, 64035, 6999, '<td valign="top">One of the best captures of light there is on the site - second perhaps, only to the Sydney Harbour Bridge shot. Didn''t see it in voting unfortunately, but would have been a certain 10.</td>', 'One of the best captures of light there is on the site - second perhaps, only to the Sydney Harbour Bridge shot. Didn''t see it in voting unfortunately, but would have been a certain 10.', '2004-04-08 01:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
