(658959, 67567, 18737, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all of you.  I am very happy.  This is the first picture that I have submitted and I wasn''t sure how I would do.  The first photo challenge I have entered anywhere.  Feels good.  Your comments were truly appreciated.</td>', 'Thanks to all of you.  I am very happy.  This is the first picture that I have submitted and I wasn''t sure how I would do.  The first photo challenge I have entered anywhere.  Feels good.  Your comments were truly appreciated.', '2004-04-08 01:16:33.000000', NULL, 0),
