(658988, 67364, 714, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and I am surprised at how it ranked among the other shots.  This should have been at least top 20.</td>', 'I love this shot and I am surprised at how it ranked among the other shots.  This should have been at least top 20.', '2004-04-08 01:27:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(658994, 67392, 714, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome candid shot.  I thought for sure it would do better.</td>', 'This is an awesome candid shot.  I thought for sure it would do better.', '2004-04-08 01:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(658996, 63224, 18913, '<td valign="top">How you didn''t place in the top 5 or the top 3 is beyond me?  I''m starting to regret having joined this site.  It seems that the majority of tastes here prefer traditional regurgitated stock photography - as well as cliche images.  Nothing inventive or original appears to be recognized or respected.  It''s a bit of a joke really.  I mean anyone can take a decent telephoto lens and get close to a parrot and snap a pic but what you have done is add some impressionism and life to the billions and I mean billions of photos of birds out there.</td>', 'How you didn''t place in the top 5 or the top 3 is beyond me?  I''m starting to regret having joined this site.  It seems that the majority of tastes here prefer traditional regurgitated stock photography - as well as cliche images.  Nothing inventive or original appears to be recognized or respected.  It''s a bit of a joke really.  I mean anyone can take a decent telephoto lens and get close to a parrot and snap a pic but what you have done is add some impressionism and life to the billions and I mean billions of photos of birds out there.', '2004-04-08 01:31:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(658998, 64384, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, David!  What are you going to do with all those ribbons.  Give some to me? hehehe...<br/> <br/>Congrats on a fine, fine photo!</td>', 'Wow, David!  What are you going to do with all those ribbons.  Give some to me? hehehe... Congrats on a fine, fine photo!', '2004-04-08 01:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(659000, 66986, 714, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Should have been top 3, but on well at least you got top 10.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Should have been top 3, but on well at least you got top 10.', '2004-04-08 01:36:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(659002, 63224, 14620, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the helpful comments everyone!  As for what kind of duck this is, I had no idea.  Did a quick internet search and I think it may be a Muscovy?  There were a few of them at the park.  As far as a star filter, didn''t use one.  Was just a happy accident that I think may have been emphasized by the circular polarizer.  It was the first time I had used it and really liked the results.<br/> <br/>Thanks Again! :)<br/>Jen</td>', 'Thanks for all the helpful comments everyone!  As for what kind of duck this is, I had no idea.  Did a quick internet search and I think it may be a Muscovy?  There were a few of them at the park.  As far as a star filter, didn''t use one.  Was just a happy accident that I think may have been emphasized by the circular polarizer.  It was the first time I had used it and really liked the results. Thanks Again! :)Jen', '2004-04-08 01:36:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(659004, 64035, 714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Makes snow and the cold winter actually look bearable.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Makes snow and the cold winter actually look bearable.', '2004-04-08 01:37:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(659005, 67498, 18913, '<td valign="top">How you didn''t place in the top 3, especially over the parrot is beyond me.  Your photograph is beyond extraordinary and I commend you to no end for capturing a brilliant photo filled such emotion and technical brilliance.</td>', 'How you didn''t place in the top 3, especially over the parrot is beyond me.  Your photograph is beyond extraordinary and I commend you to no end for capturing a brilliant photo filled such emotion and technical brilliance.', '2004-04-08 01:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
