(659008, 66535, 327, '<td valign="top">I''m happy with my score. Thanks all for your comments, votes and time.</td>', 'I''m happy with my score. Thanks all for your comments, votes and time.', '2004-04-08 01:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(659010, 67355, 714, '<td valign="top">This was a fun shot to take.  I usually am afraid of bees but this little guy was pretty small.  He was only about a half inch in length.  He was climbing from flower to flower while his buddy''s were flying.  He must have been pretty full.<br/> <br/>First macro shot taken with my new Rebel.  I love this camera.<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for the comments.</td>', 'This was a fun shot to take.  I usually am afraid of bees but this little guy was pretty small.  He was only about a half inch in length.  He was climbing from flower to flower while his buddy''s were flying.  He must have been pretty full. First macro shot taken with my new Rebel.  I love this camera. Thanks everyone for the comments.', '2004-04-08 01:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(659012, 64384, 6405, '<td valign="top">David,you got my 2,I bet its a nice photo without the burning,LOL!<br/>Congrats on the first place,majority rules here! :-)</td>', 'David,you got my 2,I bet its a nice photo without the burning,LOL!Congrats on the first place,majority rules here! :-)', '2004-04-08 01:41:15.000000', NULL, 0),
