(659020, 67586, 17148, '<td valign="top">Well, guess this didn''t do as good as I had thought...O-well there''s always the next one. But it all comes down to one thing, I like the shot...haha.</td>', 'Well, guess this didn''t do as good as I had thought...O-well there''s always the next one. But it all comes down to one thing, I like the shot...haha.', '2004-04-08 01:44:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(659022, 64384, 14386, '<td valign="top">Well, wel...I''m sharing your joy for the top finish again! This is an awesome shot. You necer run out of good shots and creativity. You hav ethe stamp of an outstanding photographer. My congratulations!<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'Well, wel...I''m sharing your joy for the top finish again! This is an awesome shot. You necer run out of good shots and creativity. You hav ethe stamp of an outstanding photographer. My congratulations! Manny', '2004-04-08 01:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
