(659058, 65705, 18913, '<td valign="top">Once again originality takes a back seat on this site.  The masses are so used to see pretty babies that are perfectly lit with no noise and heavane forbid any shadows.  Your photo is highly original and sculptural in nature.  It is a photo about form and yes, it has tons of ambience and who cares if it is eerie.  Good art provokes us and makes us think.  I am stunned to see that this work did not place higher.  I would have had it slated in the top 3 at least.  Congratulations once again on an excellent and highly original photo.</td>', 'Once again originality takes a back seat on this site.  The masses are so used to see pretty babies that are perfectly lit with no noise and heavane forbid any shadows.  Your photo is highly original and sculptural in nature.  It is a photo about form and yes, it has tons of ambience and who cares if it is eerie.  Good art provokes us and makes us think.  I am stunned to see that this work did not place higher.  I would have had it slated in the top 3 at least.  Congratulations once again on an excellent and highly original photo.', '2004-04-08 02:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
