(659100, 67480, 8891, '<td valign="top">Geez, Bobster, I could have sworn I left a glowing comment about this. It was certainly my favorite and I gave it a 10....Don''t know what happened to the comment. Perhaps the schools boys gave it the heave ho somehow or other during the Prank.  LOL!   Great Shot!    RoB</td>', 'Geez, Bobster, I could have sworn I left a glowing comment about this. It was certainly my favorite and I gave it a 10....Don''t know what happened to the comment. Perhaps the schools boys gave it the heave ho somehow or other during the Prank.  LOL!   Great Shot!    RoB', '2004-04-08 03:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
