(659180, 67729, 11800, '<td valign="top">A big thank you to everyone who commented on this. I did make a couple of choices that might have detracted from the shot. <br/>1.The reflections. I waited till afternoon just to get them. Used as a method of bringing some more of the outside world into the picture.<br/>2.The label on the bottom left. I didn''t clone it out because her paw was behind it but at this point I can see that it is distracting and I should have gotten rid of it.<br/></td>', 'A big thank you to everyone who commented on this. I did make a couple of choices that might have detracted from the shot. 1.The reflections. I waited till afternoon just to get them. Used as a method of bringing some more of the outside world into the picture.2.The label on the bottom left. I didn''t clone it out because her paw was behind it but at this point I can see that it is distracting and I should have gotten rid of it.', '2004-04-08 06:48:18.000000', NULL, 0),
