(659274, 66991, 8125, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone for the great comments.  I''m very proud of the finish and congratulate the 5 people ahead of me for their wonderful finishes as well.<br/> <br/>A special thanks goes out to Setz as well... it''s with his help that I''ve seen an improvement in my work.<br/> <br/>Edit: Let me not forget to thank everyone else in this community as you all have been an integral part of my growth with everything I have learned since joining this site.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-08 14:11:02.</i></td>', 'Thank you to everyone for the great comments.  I''m very proud of the finish and congratulate the 5 people ahead of me for their wonderful finishes as well. A special thanks goes out to Setz as well... it''s with his help that I''ve seen an improvement in my work. Edit: Let me not forget to thank everyone else in this community as you all have been an integral part of my growth with everything I have learned since joining this site.', '2004-04-08 09:55:20.000000', '2004-04-08 15:11:02.000000', 0),
