(659545, 65815, 5112, '<td valign="top">Mirage.  From a guys point of view, I guess :))))<br/>Congratulations!<br/> <br/>Will I be a total idiot if I point out one little, tiny nitpick that bothers me a bit in this picture?  The bigger of the two dust-devils (or dust from cars driving?) in the distance, right behind her and to the left, I wish it were not there.<br/> <br/>I love the colours in the picture.</td>', 'Mirage.  From a guys point of view, I guess :))))Congratulations! Will I be a total idiot if I point out one little, tiny nitpick that bothers me a bit in this picture?  The bigger of the two dust-devils (or dust from cars driving?) in the distance, right behind her and to the left, I wish it were not there. I love the colours in the picture.', '2004-04-08 12:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
