(659940, 63735, 13602, '<td valign="top">I always score my favorites 9''s and then come back pick a few of them and make em 10''s and comment this whas supesed to be so too, but since I''m on dialup and the number of entries whas enormous, I didn''t get to do it, didn''t even finished voting. This is clearely my favorite in the challenge, superbe view, colors, composition and mood, and I know 10 is a good place but I really wish It would ribbon. My congratulations.</td>', 'I always score my favorites 9''s and then come back pick a few of them and make em 10''s and comment this whas supesed to be so too, but since I''m on dialup and the number of entries whas enormous, I didn''t get to do it, didn''t even finished voting. This is clearely my favorite in the challenge, superbe view, colors, composition and mood, and I know 10 is a good place but I really wish It would ribbon. My congratulations.', '2004-04-08 17:37:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(660002, 67488, 6458, '<td valign="top">Thanks Wendy..<br/> <br/>It''s a bunch of grass in the middle of a small pond, rotated counter clockwise. The reflection on the right is from the water. It was a bit windy that night, which is why the reflection isn''t perfect and why the tops of the grass (on the left) are blurred.<br/> <br/>I understand how people say they''d like it better the original way, but once I saw it this way, I just couldn''t put it back. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-08 17:07:10.</i></td>', 'Thanks Wendy.. It''s a bunch of grass in the middle of a small pond, rotated counter clockwise. The reflection on the right is from the water. It was a bit windy that night, which is why the reflection isn''t perfect and why the tops of the grass (on the left) are blurred. I understand how people say they''d like it better the original way, but once I saw it this way, I just couldn''t put it back. ', '2004-04-08 18:06:05.000000', '2004-04-08 18:07:10.000000', 0),
