(660041, 67447, 17300, '<td valign="top">Suspected that you would get hammered with regards to points on this one. I still like it, for the same reasons as before. I agree with uberjuve''s comment to some extent. The composition takes this photo one step beyond the "normal" photo hera at DPC.<br/> <br/>Looking forward to see your next entry.<br/></td>', 'Suspected that you would get hammered with regards to points on this one. I still like it, for the same reasons as before. I agree with uberjuve''s comment to some extent. The composition takes this photo one step beyond the "normal" photo hera at DPC. Looking forward to see your next entry.', '2004-04-08 18:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
