(660411, 63735, 8891, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective and lighting. Great image!</td>', 'Awesome perspective and lighting. Great image!', '2004-04-08 22:46:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(660420, 66555, 9932, '<td valign="top">This Cougar was setting atop a rocky cliff right against the chain link fence. I had to do a quick paint (does not mean I did it quick, it was very tedious work) mask and do a gaussian Blur. Otherwise it looked like crap. The spot above the tongue is where his to fangs met and you see a small opening through the mouth.<br/> <br/><b>Photoshop:</b> <br/>Level adjustment <br/>Shadow higlight - minor to bring detail out around eye <br/>Quick paint mask <br/><b>Gaussian blur to blur out chain link fence</b></td>', 'This Cougar was setting atop a rocky cliff right against the chain link fence. I had to do a quick paint (does not mean I did it quick, it was very tedious work) mask and do a gaussian Blur. Otherwise it looked like crap. The spot above the tongue is where his to fangs met and you see a small opening through the mouth. Photoshop: Level adjustment Shadow higlight - minor to bring detail out around eye Quick paint mask Gaussian blur to blur out chain link fence', '2004-04-08 22:57:59.000000', NULL, 0),
