(660619, 67744, 10084, '<td valign="top">Looks like a serious but quirky expression. The stripes make your look down to view the whole scene. Like all portraits highlights in the eyes make it interesting. <br/> <br/>I think that the choice of the border may have cause the score to become lower. Comparing the black in the border to the black in the subject makes the black on the clothes and the hair look faded. Bringing the contrast up in the photo would match it more to the frame.<br/> <br/>I thought that this shot would have scored higher. Seems like I was the only one that gave a "10"<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-09 01:12:36.</i></td>', 'Looks like a serious but quirky expression. The stripes make your look down to view the whole scene. Like all portraits highlights in the eyes make it interesting.  I think that the choice of the border may have cause the score to become lower. Comparing the black in the border to the black in the subject makes the black on the clothes and the hair look faded. Bringing the contrast up in the photo would match it more to the frame. I thought that this shot would have scored higher. Seems like I was the only one that gave a "10"', '2004-04-09 02:08:18.000000', '2004-04-09 02:12:36.000000', 0),
