(712163, 64384, 19184, '<td valign="top">I was just bored and browsing through some of the challenges and came across this photo and noticed that you got some 4''s 3''s and a 2 for it and it blew my mind.  My only guess is that these people are extremely jealous that they couldn''t have done this themselves.  Anyway, just wanted to say what a great photo it is.  I would like to see the color version though, I am not the biggest fan of black and white.</td>', 'I was just bored and browsing through some of the challenges and came across this photo and noticed that you got some 4''s 3''s and a 2 for it and it blew my mind.  My only guess is that these people are extremely jealous that they couldn''t have done this themselves.  Anyway, just wanted to say what a great photo it is.  I would like to see the color version though, I am not the biggest fan of black and white.', '2004-05-11 18:46:17.000000', NULL, 0),
