(879595, 65811, 8816, '<td valign="top">Funnily enough, I started a series that this one would fit into very well!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=98265" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8816/thumb/98265.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8816/thumb/98265.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8816/thumb/98265.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=98264" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8816/thumb/98264.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8816/thumb/98264.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8816/thumb/98264.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=98263" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8816/thumb/98263.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8816/thumb/98263.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8816/thumb/98263.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>This shot is very well captured, the black and white looks wonderful.  I really love how the paper looks against the white background, definable but without drawing attention.  The line you''ve managed to form are perfect!<br/> <br/>Lee<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-26 23:48:21.</i></td>', 'Funnily enough, I started a series that this one would fit into very well!     This shot is very well captured, the black and white looks wonderful.  I really love how the paper looks against the white background, definable but without drawing attention.  The line you''ve managed to form are perfect! Lee', '2004-08-27 00:48:08.000000', '2004-08-27 00:48:21.000000', 0),
(892278, 65815, 26332, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph. The light and color are crisp and grab the viewer. I am a weekend hack who loves photography more for capturing life as it happens than anything else. However, I also know what I like and I like this photograph.</td>', 'I love this photograph. The light and color are crisp and grab the viewer. I am a weekend hack who loves photography more for capturing life as it happens than anything else. However, I also know what I like and I like this photograph.', '2004-09-04 01:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(892280, 67637, 26332, '<td valign="top">Love it, Love it. The flowers almost appear metalic. Great photo.</td>', 'Love it, Love it. The flowers almost appear metalic. Great photo.', '2004-09-04 01:53:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(897920, 66986, 22734, '<td valign="top">What makes these compositions interesting, besides camera setting to get the desired feel, is first and foremost the framing. Selecting the interesting angle of view. This is where most photographers faulter. These shots are treacherous because the rock formations are generally dark. Here the the flow of the rivulet is used to great advantage, it defines the main bolder in the center and the left flows right down the image. The sky, the myst and the lonely bush, slowly bring the eyes down. A superb comp snatched out of an otherwise busy subject.</td>', 'What makes these compositions interesting, besides camera setting to get the desired feel, is first and foremost the framing. Selecting the interesting angle of view. This is where most photographers faulter. These shots are treacherous because the rock formations are generally dark. Here the the flow of the rivulet is used to great advantage, it defines the main bolder in the center and the left flows right down the image. The sky, the myst and the lonely bush, slowly bring the eyes down. A superb comp snatched out of an otherwise busy subject.', '2004-09-07 20:25:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(910197, 66679, 26718, '<td valign="top">I think that this is by far the best one out of your folio.</td>', 'I think that this is by far the best one out of your folio.', '2004-09-15 00:05:21.000000', NULL, 0),
