(1083929, 67527, 10658, '<td valign="top">I would''ve given this a 10 had I voted on that challenge.  I guess it helps that I think squirrels are terribly cute (even the semi-rabid ones that I''ve seen in NYC and Boston Common) and fun to photograph.  None of my photos of them have ever come out as awesome as yours though!  I love how you''ve captured this one''s personality :) I even like the choice of border!  Everything works here, it should''ve scored higher.</td>', 'I would''ve given this a 10 had I voted on that challenge.  I guess it helps that I think squirrels are terribly cute (even the semi-rabid ones that I''ve seen in NYC and Boston Common) and fun to photograph.  None of my photos of them have ever come out as awesome as yours though!  I love how you''ve captured this one''s personality :) I even like the choice of border!  Everything works here, it should''ve scored higher.', '2004-12-31 00:50:40.000000', NULL, 0),
