(1311572, 67032, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ecce Signum:</b></div><hr/><i> This is interesting, I voted on this a year ago and gave it a 5 (sorry). I think I must have marked it down because of the border, it definately detracts from the wonderful image. I love the background  and think if you''d just moved a little to get the classic legs apart on either side of the tail this could have been on many a christmas card (if you''d lower yourself to that?). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>A 5 - You mean old sod!!<br/> <br/>:-P<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Ecce Signum: This is interesting, I voted on this a year ago and gave it a 5 (sorry). I think I must have marked it down because of the border, it definately detracts from the wonderful image. I love the background  and think if you''d just moved a little to get the classic legs apart on either side of the tail this could have been on many a christmas card (if you''d lower yourself to that?).   A 5 - You mean old sod!! :-P', '2005-04-21 18:41:24.000000', NULL, 0),
