(2795102, 67390, 47541, '<td valign="top">A nice pose and the lighting works for me.  Being advanced editing I''d have tried to do something with the brown thing in the background to tone it down a bit.  I''d maybe also have a bit more in the frame to the left - out to her elbow perhaps?</td>', 'A nice pose and the lighting works for me.  Being advanced editing I''d have tried to do something with the brown thing in the background to tone it down a bit.  I''d maybe also have a bit more in the frame to the left - out to her elbow perhaps?', '2006-09-04 06:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2798476, 67390, 48560, '<td valign="top">Sweet model, and in a relaxed casual pose.<br/>The cropping could be better though. I said that because her head seems suspended due to her not-so-visible arms, at first glance at least. Then again, still a nice portrait.</td>', 'Sweet model, and in a relaxed casual pose.The cropping could be better though. I said that because her head seems suspended due to her not-so-visible arms, at first glance at least. Then again, still a nice portrait.', '2006-09-04 23:17:48.000000', NULL, 0),
