(3359574, 67390, 48471, '<td valign="top">A lovely image, a lovely model, a lovely smile.<br/>A not so lovely square format. The watch isn''t lovely also. The colours, get rid of them and convert this to black and white. Burn the background, so that I can see only the face and the smile. And, work on the title.<br/>Maybe a too late comment, but this is the best from the photos on your front page. In my opinion.</td>', 'A lovely image, a lovely model, a lovely smile.A not so lovely square format. The watch isn''t lovely also. The colours, get rid of them and convert this to black and white. Burn the background, so that I can see only the face and the smile. And, work on the title.Maybe a too late comment, but this is the best from the photos on your front page. In my opinion.', '2007-02-12 23:59:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3491565, 65815, 76164, '<td valign="top">&gt; It''s easy to take good photos when you shoot a good model <br/>&gt; at an inspiring location...<br/> <br/>... and PhotoShop<br/> <br/>however, it is a nice snaphot!<br/> <br/>regards, michael<br/></td>', '> It''s easy to take good photos when you shoot a good model > at an inspiring location... ... and PhotoShop however, it is a nice snaphot! regards, michael', '2007-03-27 18:26:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3502650, 67567, 72317, '<td valign="top">Hello there. I ran across this because I was wondering if anyone else owned this camera. It''s a fantastic photo. The ice and the seagull really are the best parts. If only the water had picked up a little blue from the sky. But really it''s great. Better than anything I could''ve done.</td>', 'Hello there. I ran across this because I was wondering if anyone else owned this camera. It''s a fantastic photo. The ice and the seagull really are the best parts. If only the water had picked up a little blue from the sky. But really it''s great. Better than anything I could''ve done.', '2007-03-31 20:18:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3784641, 67032, 76198, '<td valign="top">Came across this and for those who are confused - <br/> <br/>This is a European Robin (Erithacus rubecula) which is wholey unrelated to the American Robin (Turdus migratorius), but share a common name because of their similar coloration. <br/> <br/>And he''s cute as a button. Nice shot.</td>', 'Came across this and for those who are confused -  This is a European Robin (Erithacus rubecula) which is wholey unrelated to the American Robin (Turdus migratorius), but share a common name because of their similar coloration.  And he''s cute as a button. Nice shot.', '2007-06-14 16:28:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4319254, 66971, 87785, '<td valign="top">WOW, breath takong!!</td>', 'WOW, breath takong!!', '2007-12-17 19:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4391591, 67585, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really like your lighting, both in the foreground and background. You''ve captured the colors and softness of the lily nicely. I do notice quite a bit of grain in your background. Nothing a run through Neat Image or similar wouldn''t fix.<br/> <br/>One thing I struggled with shooting Calla Lilies was composition. It''s like photographing a person. If you crop at a joint it looks awkward. Something about your composition here makes it feel like it was clipped at a joint. I think anything without the stem looks unnatural. I took a ton of shots and what I ended up posting still didn''t seem right, heh.<br/> <br/>I read through a couple of the other comments, and I have to agree with there being too much dead space. I cropped a big chunk of it out in Photoshop, and can''t say I missed what was cropped out. The minimalism type feel and contrast was still there.</td>', 'I really like your lighting, both in the foreground and background. You''ve captured the colors and softness of the lily nicely. I do notice quite a bit of grain in your background. Nothing a run through Neat Image or similar wouldn''t fix. One thing I struggled with shooting Calla Lilies was composition. It''s like photographing a person. If you crop at a joint it looks awkward. Something about your composition here makes it feel like it was clipped at a joint. I think anything without the stem looks unnatural. I took a ton of shots and what I ended up posting still didn''t seem right, heh. I read through a couple of the other comments, and I have to agree with there being too much dead space. I cropped a big chunk of it out in Photoshop, and can''t say I missed what was cropped out. The minimalism type feel and contrast was still there.', '2008-01-14 15:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4544073, 67798, 83845, '<td valign="top">I did a series of shots title smushed faces in my college darkroom class.  This brought back memories!</td>', 'I did a series of shots title smushed faces in my college darkroom class.  This brought back memories!', '2008-03-06 20:22:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005166, 67740, 69008, '<td valign="top">It is interesting to see how the shapes of the BG look almost like a cathedral just to the left of the foreground tree trunk. I am surprised that no one else picked up on that, or at least they didn''t comment about it. <br/>It''s fun to go back to the earlier days of our digital images, and see what we were doing at that time and how it compares to what we are doing today.  This is a nice capture for a grab shot.</td>', 'It is interesting to see how the shapes of the BG look almost like a cathedral just to the left of the foreground tree trunk. I am surprised that no one else picked up on that, or at least they didn''t comment about it. It''s fun to go back to the earlier days of our digital images, and see what we were doing at that time and how it compares to what we are doing today.  This is a nice capture for a grab shot.', '2008-10-12 16:30:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5065028, 64449, 68599, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I like how you captured the motion of the birds. The only critique I have is to try placing the tower in a different position other than the center.</td>', 'This is a great shot. I like how you captured the motion of the birds. The only critique I have is to try placing the tower in a different position other than the center.', '2008-11-15 11:56:19.000000', NULL, 0),
